  zh["(formsubmit.co) receives the inquiry form and forwards it to Hurfi by email. It may show a captcha to check that a person sent the form."] = "（formsubmit.co）接收询盘表单并以电子邮件转发给 Hurfi。它可能会显示验证码，以确认表单由真人提交。";
