  zh["This post’s point, a factory that has everything except visibility, fits many food-machinery makers. It is Hurfi’s own brand work, not a client result."] = "这篇文章所说的“工厂样样不缺，唯独缺乏曝光”，也适用于许多食品机械制造商。这是 Hurfi 自有品牌的内容，不代表客户案例成果。";
