  zh["Infographic of four figures for Commercial Cleaning & Hygiene Equipment: 18.58m service robot sets made in China in 2025; +16.1% growth in service robot output; +47.6% service robot output growth in Beijing; 14.4m t electrical equipment placed on the EU market."] = "商用清洁与卫生设备信息图，列出四项数据：2025年中国服务机器人产量1,858万套；服务机器人产量增长16.1%；北京服务机器人产量增长47.6%；欧盟电气设备投放市场量为1,440万吨。";
