  zh["Approval rules vary widely by country. These references matter for Europe and markets that follow EU rules:"] = "各国的认证规则差异很大。以下法规对欧洲及参照欧盟规则的市场尤为重要：";
  fr["Approval rules vary widely by country. These references matter for Europe and markets that follow EU rules:"] = "Les règles d’homologation varient fortement selon les pays. Les références suivantes comptent pour l’Europe et les marchés qui suivent les règles de l’UE :";
  zh["Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 governs the approval and market surveillance of agricultural and forestry vehicles; it has been amended several times, including in 2019 and 2024."] = "欧盟第 167/2013 号法规规范农林车辆的认证和市场监督，该法规已多次修订，包括 2019 年和 2024 年。";
  fr["Regulation (EU) No 167/2013 governs the approval and market surveillance of agricultural and forestry vehicles; it has been amended several times, including in 2019 and 2024."] = "Le règlement (UE) n° 167/2013 régit la réception et la surveillance du marché des véhicules agricoles et forestiers ; il a été modifié plusieurs fois, notamment en 2019 et en 2024.";
  zh["A 2025 Commission delegated regulation amended vehicle braking and functional safety requirements for agricultural and forestry vehicles."] = "2025 年，欧盟委员会一项授权法规修订了农林车辆的制动和功能安全要求。";
  fr["A 2025 Commission delegated regulation amended vehicle braking and functional safety requirements for agricultural and forestry vehicles."] = "En 2025, un règlement délégué de la Commission a modifié les exigences de freinage et de sécurité fonctionnelle des véhicules agricoles et forestiers.";
  zh["Implements and other agricultural machinery fall under the EU Machinery Directive 2006/42/EC; the Machinery Regulation (EU) 2023/1230 applies from 20 January 2027."] = "农具及其他农业机械适用欧盟《机械指令》2006/42/EC；《机械法规》(EU) 2023/1230 自 2027 年 1 月 20 日起适用。";
  fr["Implements and other agricultural machinery fall under the EU Machinery Directive 2006/42/EC; the Machinery Regulation (EU) 2023/1230 applies from 20 January 2027."] = "Les instruments aratoires et autres machines agricoles relèvent de la directive Machines 2006/42/CE de l’UE ; le règlement Machines (UE) 2023/1230 s’applique à partir du 20 janvier 2027.";
  zh["Google’s guidance on multi-regional and multilingual sites explains how to serve separate language and country versions, important when dealers are in many countries."] = "Google 关于多地区和多语言网站的建议，说明了如何分别提供语言版本和国家版本；当经销商分布在多个国家时，这一点很重要。";
  fr["Google’s guidance on multi-regional and multilingual sites explains how to serve separate language and country versions, important when dealers are in many countries."] = "Les recommandations de Google sur les sites multirégionaux et multilingues expliquent comment proposer des versions distinctes par langue et par pays, ce qui compte lorsque les concessionnaires sont dans plusieurs pays.";
  zh["State which approvals you hold for which models and markets. Dealers will ask before they stock your machines."] = "说明哪些型号在哪些市场已获得哪些认证。经销商在进货前一定会问。";
  fr["State which approvals you hold for which models and markets. Dealers will ask before they stock your machines."] = "Indiquez les homologations obtenues, par modèle et par marché. Les concessionnaires le demanderont avant de référencer vos machines.";
  zh["Questions overseas buyers ask agritech and agricultural equipment suppliers"] = "海外买家向农业科技与农机设备供应商提出的问题";
  fr["Questions overseas buyers ask agritech and agricultural equipment suppliers"] = "Questions des acheteurs étrangers aux fournisseurs d’agritech et de matériel agricole";
  zh["How quickly can we get spare parts?"] = "多快能拿到备件？";
  fr["How quickly can we get spare parts?"] = "Sous quel délai pouvons-nous obtenir des pièces de rechange ?";
  zh["Parts stock, ordering process and shipping times."] = "备件库存、订购流程和运输时间。";
  fr["Parts stock, ordering process and shipping times."] = "Stock de pièces, processus de commande et délais d’expédition.";
  zh["What dealer support do you offer?"] = "你们提供哪些经销商支持？";
  fr["What dealer support do you offer?"] = "Quel soutien offrez-vous aux concessionnaires ?";
  zh["Training, marketing material, warranty handling and margins."] = "培训、营销资料、保修处理和利润空间。";
  fr["Training, marketing material, warranty handling and margins."] = "Formation, supports marketing, gestion des garanties et marges.";
  zh["Is it approved for our market?"] = "该机型在我们市场获得认证了吗？";
  fr["Is it approved for our market?"] = "Est-il homologué pour notre marché ?";
  zh["Approvals and homologation status per model and country."] = "按机型和国别列明认证与型式批准状态。";
  fr["Approvals and homologation status per model and country."] = "Homologations et état de réception par modèle et par pays.";
  zh["Will it work in our conditions?"] = "它适合我们的作业条件吗？";
  fr["Will it work in our conditions?"] = "Fonctionnera-t-il dans nos conditions ?";
  zh["Soil, crop, climate and terrain where the machines are proven."] = "设备经过验证的土壤、作物、气候和地形条件。";
  fr["Soil, crop, climate and terrain where the machines are proven."] = "Sols, cultures, climat et relief dans lesquels les machines ont fait leurs preuves.";
  zh["Where are your machines already working?"] = "你们的设备目前在哪里作业？";
  fr["Where are your machines already working?"] = "Où vos machines sont-elles déjà en service ?";
  zh["References by country and crop."] = "按国家和作物列出的案例。";
  fr["References by country and crop."] = "Des références par pays et par culture.";
  zh["What are the service intervals and costs?"] = "保养周期和费用是多少？";
