  zh["Maintenance schedules and parts prices."] = "保养计划和备件价格。";
  fr["Maintenance schedules and parts prices."] = "Plans d’entretien et prix des pièces.";
  zh["A website, SEO and RFQ playbook for agritech and agricultural equipment manufacturers"] = "面向农业科技与农机设备制造商的外贸网站、SEO 与询盘手册";
  fr["A website, SEO and RFQ playbook for agritech and agricultural equipment manufacturers"] = "Un guide site web, SEO et demande de devis pour les fabricants d’agritech et de matériel agricole";
  zh["Agricultural equipment sells through dealers, so the site must recruit and support them as well as reach farmers. Our usual order:"] = "农机通过经销商销售，因此网站既要开发和支持经销商，也要触达农户。我们通常的做法是：";
  fr["Agricultural equipment sells through dealers, so the site must recruit and support them as well as reach farmers. Our usual order:"] = "Le matériel agricole se vend via des concessionnaires : le site doit donc à la fois les recruter, les accompagner et toucher les agriculteurs. Notre ordre habituel :";
