  zh["Infographic of four figures for Agritech & Agricultural Equipment: 714.88m t of grain produced in China in 2025; 64.81m t of fertiliser made in 2025, up 7.1%; +12.1% agricultural and food processing in Weifang; 53 African countries at the first three Changsha expos."] = "农业科技与农机设备四组数据信息图：2025 年中国粮食产量 71488 万吨；2025 年化肥产量 6481 万吨，增长 7.1%；潍坊农副食品加工业增长 12.1%；前三届长沙中非经贸博览会吸引 53 个非洲国家。";
