  zh["Many Dongguan factories already supply well-known brands, but their own websites rarely show it. Hurfi helps Dongguan manufacturers present their capability in English and reach overseas buyers through search — remotely, from Xi’an and Bogura."] = "许多东莞工厂已经在为知名品牌供货，但自己的网站很少体现这一点。Hurfi 帮助东莞制造商用英语呈现自身能力，并通过搜索触达海外买家——我们远程协作，团队位于西安和博格拉。";
  fr["Many Dongguan factories already supply well-known brands, but their own websites rarely show it. Hurfi helps Dongguan manufacturers present their capability in English and reach overseas buyers through search — remotely, from Xi’an and Bogura."] = "De nombreuses usines de Dongguan fournissent déjà des marques connues, mais leur propre site le montre rarement. Hurfi aide les fabricants de Dongguan à présenter leurs capacités en anglais et à atteindre les acheteurs étrangers via la recherche — à distance, depuis Xi’an et Bogura.";
  zh["Hurfi has no office or staff in Dongguan. We work with Dongguan manufacturers remotely over WeChat, email and video calls, from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi 在东莞没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频会议，从西安（陕西）和博格拉（孟加拉国）的办公室远程服务东莞制造商。";
  fr["Hurfi has no office or staff in Dongguan. We work with Dongguan manufacturers remotely over WeChat, email and video calls, from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi n’a ni bureau ni personnel à Dongguan. Nous travaillons à distance avec les fabricants de Dongguan par WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence, depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an (Shaanxi) et de Bogura (Bangladesh).";
  zh["What Dongguan makes, according to official data"] = "官方数据中的东莞产业";
  fr["What Dongguan makes, according to official data"] = "Ce que produit Dongguan, selon les données officielles";
  zh["Dongguan’s own government documents describe a manufacturing base built on electronics, equipment and home products. That shapes where an export website should focus."] = "东莞市政府文件将该市描述为以电子、装备和家居产品为基础的制造基地。这也决定了外贸网站应该聚焦的方向。";
  fr["Dongguan’s own government documents describe a manufacturing base built on electronics, equipment and home products. That shapes where an export website should focus."] = "Les documents du gouvernement de Dongguan décrivent une base manufacturière fondée sur l’électronique, les équipements et les produits pour la maison. Cela oriente la priorité d’un site export.";
  zh["The municipal government describes new-generation electronic information as Dongguan’s largest pillar industry, with smart mobile terminals as its leading segment."] = "市政府将新一代电子信息列为东莞最大的支柱产业，其中智能移动终端是主导板块。";
  fr["The municipal government describes new-generation electronic information as Dongguan’s largest pillar industry, with smart mobile terminals as its leading segment."] = "La municipalité présente la nouvelle génération de l’information électronique comme la première industrie pilier de Dongguan, avec les terminaux mobiles intelligents comme segment dominant.";
  zh["Dongguan’s smart mobile terminal cluster was selected as a national advanced manufacturing cluster by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology in 2019. The city reports producing 196 million smartphones in 2022 — about one in six made in China."] = "2019 年，东莞智能移动终端集群被工业和信息化部评为国家先进制造业集群。该市称 2022 年生产智能手机 1.96 亿部——约占全国产量的六分之一。";
  fr["Dongguan’s smart mobile terminal cluster was selected as a national advanced manufacturing cluster by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology in 2019. The city reports producing 196 million smartphones in 2022 — about one in six made in China."] = "En 2019, le cluster des terminaux mobiles intelligents de Dongguan a été retenu comme cluster national de fabrication avancée par le ministère de l’Industrie et des Technologies de l’information. La ville indique avoir produit 196 millions de smartphones en 2022 — environ un sur six fabriqués en Chine.";
  zh["In January 2024 the city reported around 210,000 manufacturing enterprises and three national advanced manufacturing clusters: smart mobile terminals, smart equipment, and pan-home furnishing."] = "2024 年 1 月，该市称拥有约 21 万家制造企业，以及三个国家先进制造业集群：智能移动终端、智能装备和泛家居。";
  fr["In January 2024 the city reported around 210,000 manufacturing enterprises and three national advanced manufacturing clusters: smart mobile terminals, smart equipment, and pan-home furnishing."] = "En janvier 2024, la ville recensait environ 210 000 entreprises manufacturières et trois clusters nationaux de fabrication avancée : terminaux mobiles intelligents, équipements intelligents et ameublement pan-domestique.";
  zh["What this means for a Dongguan manufacturer’s website"] = "这对东莞企业的网站意味着什么";
  fr["What this means for a Dongguan manufacturer’s website"] = "Ce que cela implique pour le site d’un fabricant de Dongguan";
  zh["Electronics supply chain"] = "电子供应链";
  fr["Electronics supply chain"] = "Chaîne d’approvisionnement électronique";
  zh["For electronics and component suppliers, buyers want part data, compliance documents and traceability. A catalog that engineers can search beats a brochure."] = "对电子和元器件供应商，买家想要零件数据、合规文件和可追溯性。工程师能检索的目录胜过一本宣传册。";
  fr["For electronics and component suppliers, buyers want part data, compliance documents and traceability. A catalog that engineers can search beats a brochure."] = "Pour les fournisseurs d’électronique et de composants, les acheteurs veulent des données de pièces, des documents de conformité et de la traçabilité. Un catalogue que les ingénieurs peuvent interroger vaut mieux qu’une plaquette.";
  zh["OEM and ODM work"] = "OEM 与 ODM 业务";
  fr["OEM and ODM work"] = "Travail OEM et ODM";
  zh["Factories that build for other brands need a site that proves capability without exposing client names they are not allowed to share."] = "为其他品牌代工的工厂，需要一个能证明实力、又不泄露不得公开的客户名称的网站。";
  fr["Factories that build for other brands need a site that proves capability without exposing client names they are not allowed to share."] = "Les usines qui produisent pour d’autres marques ont besoin d’un site prouvant leurs capacités sans divulguer des noms de clients qu’elles ne peuvent pas citer.";
  zh["Smart equipment"] = "智能装备";
  fr["Smart equipment"] = "Équipements intelligents";
  zh["Equipment makers need specification pages, video of machines working, and a straight answer on service abroad."] = "设备制造商需要规格页面、设备运行视频，以及关于海外服务的明确答复。";
  fr["Equipment makers need specification pages, video of machines working, and a straight answer on service abroad."] = "Les fabricants d’équipements ont besoin de pages de spécifications, de vidéos de machines en fonctionnement et d’une réponse claire sur le service à l’étranger.";
