  zh["Export websites and Google SEO for Shandong manufacturers"] = "为山东制造企业打造外贸网站与 Google SEO";
  fr["Export websites and Google SEO for Shandong manufacturers"] = "Sites web export et SEO Google pour les fabricants du Shandong";
  zh["Shandong became the third Chinese province to pass 10 trillion yuan of GDP in 2025. Its equipment, vehicles, chemicals and batteries leave through coastal ports that handled 48.168 million TEU of containers that year. This guide summarises the province’s 2025 official figures and profiles its manufacturing cities."] = "2025 年，山东成为第三个 GDP 突破 10 万亿元的中国省份。当年，其装备、汽车、化工和电池产品经沿海港口出口，港口集装箱吞吐量达 4,816.8 万标箱。本指南汇总该省 2025 年官方数据，并介绍其制造业城市。";
  fr["Shandong became the third Chinese province to pass 10 trillion yuan of GDP in 2025. Its equipment, vehicles, chemicals and batteries leave through coastal ports that handled 48.168 million TEU of containers that year. This guide summarises the province’s 2025 official figures and profiles its manufacturing cities."] = "En 2025, le Shandong est devenu la troisième province chinoise à dépasser 10 000 milliards de yuans de PIB. Ses équipements, véhicules, produits chimiques et batteries partent par des ports maritimes qui ont traité 48,168 millions d’EVP de conteneurs cette année-là. Ce guide résume les chiffres officiels 2025 de la province et présente ses villes manufacturières.";
  zh["Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Shandong; we work with manufacturers there remotely."] = "Hurfi 的办公室位于西安（陕西）和博格拉（孟加拉国）。我们在山东没有办公室或员工，而是远程服务当地制造商。";
  fr["Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Shandong; we work with manufacturers there remotely."] = "Les bureaux de Hurfi se trouvent à Xi’an (Shaanxi) et à Bogura (Bangladesh). Nous n’avons ni bureau ni personnel au Shandong ; nous travaillons à distance avec les fabricants de la province.";
  zh["Official figures"] = "官方数据";
  fr["Official figures"] = "Chiffres officiels";
  zh["Other cities"] = "其他城市";
  fr["Other cities"] = "Autres villes";
  zh["Shandong’s manufacturing economy in official figures"] = "官方数据中的山东制造业";
  fr["Shandong’s manufacturing economy in official figures"] = "L’économie manufacturière du Shandong en chiffres officiels";
  zh["The Shandong Provincial Bureau of Statistics’ 2025 bulletin gives the province-wide picture below."] = "山东省统计局 2025 年统计公报给出了以下全省概况。";
  fr["The Shandong Provincial Bureau of Statistics’ 2025 bulletin gives the province-wide picture below."] = "Le bulletin 2025 du bureau provincial des statistiques du Shandong donne la vision d’ensemble suivante.";
  zh["Shandong’s GDP was 10,319.75 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.5%, making it the third province and the first in northern China to pass 10 trillion yuan."] = "2025 年山东 GDP 为 103,197.5 亿元，增长 5.5%，成为第三个、也是北方第一个突破 10 万亿元的省份。";
  fr["Shandong’s GDP was 10,319.75 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.5%, making it the third province and the first in northern China to pass 10 trillion yuan."] = "Le PIB du Shandong a atteint 10 319,75 milliards de yuans en 2025, en hausse de 5,5 %, ce qui en fait la troisième province et la première du nord de la Chine à dépasser 10 000 milliards de yuans.";
  zh["Value added of industry above designated size grew 7.6% and manufacturing 8.7%; equipment manufacturing grew 11.4% and made up 26.6% of above-designated-size value added."] = "规模以上工业增加值增长 7.6%，制造业增长 8.7%；装备制造业增长 11.4%，占规模以上工业增加值的 26.6%。";
  fr["Value added of industry above designated size grew 7.6% and manufacturing 8.7%; equipment manufacturing grew 11.4% and made up 26.6% of above-designated-size value added."] = "La valeur ajoutée de l’industrie des entreprises de taille supérieure au seuil réglementaire a augmenté de 7,6 % et celle de la fabrication de 8,7 % ; la fabrication d’équipements a progressé de 11,4 % et représenté 26,6 % de cette valeur ajoutée.";
  zh["Output of new-energy vehicles was 1.105 million (+50.3%), industrial robots 28,000 sets (+26.6%) and lithium-ion batteries 86.141 million kWh (+103.1%)."] = "新能源汽车产量 110.5 万辆（增长 50.3%），工业机器人 2.8 万套（增长 26.6%），锂离子电池 8,614.1 万千瓦时（增长 103.1%）。";
  fr["Output of new-energy vehicles was 1.105 million (+50.3%), industrial robots 28,000 sets (+26.6%) and lithium-ion batteries 86.141 million kWh (+103.1%)."] = "La production de véhicules à énergie nouvelle a atteint 1,105 million d’unités (+50,3 %), celle de robots industriels 28 000 ensembles (+26,6 %) et celle de batteries lithium-ion 86,141 millions de kWh (+103,1 %).";
  zh["Jinan, Qingdao and Yantai together had GDP of 4,312.17 billion yuan and contributed 41.4% of the province’s growth."] = "济南、青岛和烟台三市 GDP 合计 43,121.7 亿元，对全省增长的贡献率达 41.4%。";
  fr["Jinan, Qingdao and Yantai together had GDP of 4,312.17 billion yuan and contributed 41.4% of the province’s growth."] = "Jinan, Qingdao et Yantai ont cumulé un PIB de 4 312,17 milliards de yuans et contribué à 41,4 % de la croissance provinciale.";
  zh["Coastal ports handled 2.19 billion tonnes of cargo (+5.7%) and 48.168 million TEU of containers (+7.0%); goods exports were 2.16 trillion yuan, 48.9% of them mechanical and electrical products."] = "沿海港口完成货物吞吐量 21.9 亿吨（增长 5.7%），集装箱 4,816.8 万标箱（增长 7.0%）；货物出口额 2.16 万亿元，其中机电产品占 48.9%。";
  fr["Coastal ports handled 2.19 billion tonnes of cargo (+5.7%) and 48.168 million TEU of containers (+7.0%); goods exports were 2.16 trillion yuan, 48.9% of them mechanical and electrical products."] = "Les ports maritimes ont traité 2,19 milliards de tonnes de marchandises (+5,7 %) et 48,168 millions d’EVP de conteneurs (+7,0 %) ; les exportations de marchandises ont atteint 2 160 milliards de yuans, dont 48,9 % de produits mécaniques et électriques.";
  zh["Shandong’s exporters are heavy-industry and equipment companies with strong ports behind them. Overseas buyers of these products want approvals, specifications and shipping capability on the website before they ask for a quote."] = "山东的出口企业以重工业和装备制造为主，背后是实力雄厚的港口。这类产品的海外买家在询价前，希望网站上就能看到认证、规格和运输能力。";
  fr["Shandong’s exporters are heavy-industry and equipment companies with strong ports behind them. Overseas buyers of these products want approvals, specifications and shipping capability on the website before they ask for a quote."] = "Les exportateurs du Shandong sont des entreprises de l’industrie lourde et de l’équipement, adossées à de puissants ports. Les acheteurs étrangers de ces produits veulent voir sur le site les homologations, les spécifications et la capacité d’expédition avant de demander un devis.";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Shandong Provincial Bureau of Statistics, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the province, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下列官方来源（山东省统计局 2025 年统计公报）。数据描述的是全省情况，不代表任何 Hurfi 客户。";
  fr["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Shandong Provincial Bureau of Statistics, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the province, not any Hurfi client."] = "Infographie réalisée par Hurfi à partir des sources officielles ci-dessous (bulletin statistique 2025 du bureau provincial des statistiques du Shandong). Les chiffres décrivent la province, non un client de Hurfi.";
  zh["City guides in Shandong"] = "山东城市指南";
  fr["City guides in Shandong"] = "Guides de villes du Shandong";
  zh["Each guide covers the city’s official industry figures, what overseas buyers compare and a website, SEO and RFQ playbook."] = "每份指南都包含该市官方产业数据、海外买家比较的要点，以及网站、SEO 与询盘手册。";
  fr["Each guide covers the city’s official industry figures, what overseas buyers compare and a website, SEO and RFQ playbook."] = "Chaque guide couvre les chiffres industriels officiels de la ville, les critères de comparaison des acheteurs étrangers et un guide site web, SEO et demande de devis.";
  zh["Vehicles, chemicals, transport and special equipment, shipped through Qingdao’s own port."] = "汽车、化工、运输和专用设备，经青岛自有港口出海。";
