  zh["Trucks, servers, electronics and machine tools; rail links to Europe."] = "卡车、服务器、电子产品和机床；有通往欧洲的铁路班列。";
  fr["Trucks, servers, electronics and machine tools; rail links to Europe."] = "Camions, serveurs, électronique et machines-outils ; liaisons ferroviaires vers l’Europe.";
  zh["Chemicals, non-ferrous metals, vehicles and equipment; specification-led buyers."] = "化工、有色金属、汽车和设备；买家以规格为导向。";
  fr["Chemicals, non-ferrous metals, vehicles and equipment; specification-led buyers."] = "Produits chimiques, métaux non ferreux, véhicules et équipements ; des acheteurs guidés par les spécifications.";
  zh["Engines, machinery, chemicals and food; most trade with Belt and Road countries."] = "发动机、机械、化工和食品；主要与“一带一路”国家贸易。";
