  zh["Want this mapped to your factory?"] = "想把这些落到您的工厂吗？";
  fr["Want this mapped to your factory?"] = "Vous voulez adapter ce plan à votre usine ?";
  zh["Book a free consultation and we will look at your current site, products and markets, and suggest which of these steps to take first."] = "预约免费咨询，我们会查看您现有的网站、产品和市场，并建议先做哪几步。";
  fr["Book a free consultation and we will look at your current site, products and markets, and suggest which of these steps to take first."] = "Réservez une consultation gratuite : nous examinerons votre site actuel, vos produits et vos marchés, puis nous vous suggérerons par quelles étapes commencer.";
