  zh["Figures are quoted from the official sources below and were checked on the date shown. They describe the province or city, not any Hurfi client."] = "数据引自下方官方来源，核对日期如标注所示。数据描述的是省份或城市整体情况，不代表任何 Hurfi 客户。";
  fr["Figures are quoted from the official sources below and were checked on the date shown. They describe the province or city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Les chiffres sont tirés des sources officielles ci-dessous et ont été vérifiés à la date indiquée. Ils décrivent la province ou la ville, non un client de Hurfi.";
  zh["Shandong Provincial Bureau of Statistics and NBS Shandong Survey Team."] = "山东省统计局和国家统计局山东调查总队。";
