  fr["Sites for machinery, equipment and vehicle makers with specifications, service and references."] = "Des sites pour les fabricants de machines, d’équipements et de véhicules, avec spécifications, service et références.";
  zh["Searches for machine types and models in the markets you serve."] = "在您服务的市场中，围绕机型与型号做搜索优化。";
  fr["Searches for machine types and models in the markets you serve."] = "Du référencement sur les types et modèles de machines dans les marchés que vous servez.";
  zh["Campaigns for chosen machines in growing markets."] = "在增长市场中为选定机型开展推广活动。";
  fr["Campaigns for chosen machines in growing markets."] = "Des campagnes pour des machines choisies sur les marchés porteurs.";
  zh["Posts that show machines at work and delivered projects."] = "展示设备作业现场和已交付项目的帖文。";
  fr["Posts that show machines at work and delivered projects."] = "Des publications montrant les machines en fonctionnement et les projets livrés.";
  zh["Questions from Hunan manufacturers"] = "湖南制造商的常见问题";
  fr["Questions from Hunan manufacturers"] = "Questions des fabricants du Hunan";
  zh["Does Hurfi have an office in Hunan?"] = "Hurfi 在湖南有办公室吗？";
  fr["Does Hurfi have an office in Hunan?"] = "Hurfi a-t-il un bureau au Hunan ?";
  zh["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Hunan; we work with manufacturers there remotely by WeChat, email and video calls."] = "没有。Hurfi 的办公室位于西安（陕西）和博格拉（孟加拉国）。我们在湖南没有办公室或员工，而是通过微信、邮件和视频会议远程服务当地制造商。";
  fr["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Hunan; we work with manufacturers there remotely by WeChat, email and video calls."] = "Non. Les bureaux de Hurfi se trouvent à Xi’an (Shaanxi) et à Bogura (Bangladesh). Nous n’avons ni bureau ni personnel au Hunan ; nous travaillons à distance avec les fabricants de la province par WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence.";
  zh["Which Hunan cities do you have guides for?"] = "你们有哪些湖南城市指南？";
  fr["Which Hunan cities do you have guides for?"] = "Pour quelles villes du Hunan avez-vous des guides ?";
  zh["Changsha, plus a short sourced profile of Zhuzhou on this page."] = "长沙，以及本页上一份有来源出处的株洲简介。";
  fr["Changsha, plus a short sourced profile of Zhuzhou on this page."] = "Changsha, plus un court profil sourcé de Zhuzhou sur cette page.";
  zh["Can you help factories outside the cities listed here?"] = "你们能服务未列出的城市的工厂吗？";
  fr["Can you help factories outside the cities listed here?"] = "Pouvez-vous aider des usines situées hors des villes listées ici ?";
  zh["Yes. Many of the factories we talk to are outside the big cities. We work across Hunan remotely."] = "可以。我们接触的许多工厂都不在大城市。我们远程服务湖南全省。";
  fr["Yes. Many of the factories we talk to are outside the big cities. We work across Hunan remotely."] = "Oui. Beaucoup des usines avec lesquelles nous échangeons se trouvent hors des grandes villes. Nous travaillons à distance dans tout le Hunan.";
  zh["Our US exports fell. What next?"] = "我们的对美出口下降了，下一步怎么办？";
  fr["Our US exports fell. What next?"] = "Nos exportations vers les États-Unis ont baissé. Et ensuite ?";
  zh["Pick markets you can serve — ASEAN grew in 2025 — and build pages with the specifications, service and terms buyers there need."] = "选择您能服务的市场——2025 年东盟在增长——并建设包含当地买家所需规格、服务和条款的页面。";
  fr["Pick markets you can serve — ASEAN grew in 2025 — and build pages with the specifications, service and terms buyers there need."] = "Choisissez des marchés que vous pouvez servir — l’ASEAN a progressé en 2025 — et créez des pages avec les spécifications, le service et les conditions attendus par les acheteurs locaux.";
  zh["We make machinery. What should the site show?"] = "我们做机械，网站该展示什么？";
  fr["We make machinery. What should the site show?"] = "Nous fabriquons des machines. Que doit montrer le site ?";
  zh["Specifications, applications, service, spare parts and references, per machine family."] = "按机型系列提供规格、应用、服务、备件和业绩。";
  fr["Specifications, applications, service, spare parts and references, per machine family."] = "Spécifications, applications, service, pièces de rechange et références, par famille de machines.";
  zh["Can you write about heavy equipment correctly?"] = "你们能准确撰写重型设备的内容吗？";
  fr["Can you write about heavy equipment correctly?"] = "Pouvez-vous rédiger correctement sur les équipements lourds ?";
  zh["With your engineers, yes. Your team approves every technical statement."] = "与您的工程师合作可以。每一项技术表述都由您的团队确认。";
  fr["With your engineers, yes. Your team approves every technical statement."] = "Oui, avec vos ingénieurs. Chaque affirmation technique est validée par votre équipe.";
  zh["Do you run Google Ads and LinkedIn?"] = "你们做 Google Ads 和 LinkedIn 吗？";
  fr["Do you run Google Ads and LinkedIn?"] = "Gérez-vous Google Ads et LinkedIn ?";
  zh["Yes. We usually start with search ads for one product family and regular LinkedIn posts."] = "做。我们通常先为一个产品系列投放搜索广告，并定期发布 LinkedIn 内容。";
  fr["Yes. We usually start with search ads for one product family and regular LinkedIn posts."] = "Oui. Nous commençons généralement par des annonces search pour une famille de produits et des publications régulières sur LinkedIn.";
  zh["Can you guarantee rankings or orders?"] = "你们能保证排名或订单吗？";
  fr["Can you guarantee rankings or orders?"] = "Pouvez-vous garantir des positions ou des commandes ?";
  zh["No. We show you real results from your own accounts, including what is not working yet."] = "不能。我们向您展示来自您自己账户的真实结果，包括尚未见效的部分。";
  fr["No. We show you real results from your own accounts, including what is not working yet."] = "Non. Nous vous montrons les résultats réels issus de vos propres comptes, y compris ce qui ne fonctionne pas encore.";
  zh["Book a free consultation and send us your website and catalogue beforehand if you can."] = "预约免费咨询，如方便请提前把网站和产品目录发给我们。";
  fr["Book a free consultation and send us your website and catalogue beforehand if you can."] = "Réservez une consultation gratuite et envoyez-nous si possible votre site et votre catalogue au préalable.";
  zh["Hunan in the China directory"] = "中国目录中的湖南";
  fr["Hunan in the China directory"] = "Le Hunan dans l’annuaire Chine";
  zh["Zhuzhou Statistics Bureau (bulletin text as reproduced by tjgb.hongheiku.com)."] = "株洲市统计局（公报文本由 tjgb.hongheiku.com 转载）。";
  fr["Zhuzhou Statistics Bureau (bulletin text as reproduced by tjgb.hongheiku.com)."] = "Bureau des statistiques de Zhuzhou (texte du bulletin reproduit par tjgb.hongheiku.com).";
  zh["株洲市2025年国民经济和社会发展统计公报 (Zhuzhou 2025 Statistical Bulletin)"] = "株洲市2025年国民经济和社会发展统计公报（株洲 2025 年统计公报）";
  fr["株洲市2025年国民经济和社会发展统计公报 (Zhuzhou 2025 Statistical Bulletin)"] = "株洲市2025年国民经济和社会发展统计公报 (bulletin statistique 2025 de Zhuzhou)";
  zh["Talk to us about Hunan"] = "与我们聊聊湖南";
  fr["Talk to us about Hunan"] = "Parlez-nous du Hunan";
  zh["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Hunan: 1.626 m cars made (+30.8%); +39.6% concrete machinery output; +5.5% exports to ASEAN; 33.9% of above-scale value added from equipment manufacturing."] = "湖南 2025 年四组官方数据信息图：汽车产量 162.6 万辆（+30.8%）；混凝土机械产量 +39.6%；对东盟出口 +5.5%；装备制造业占规模以上工业增加值 33.9%。";
  fr["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Hunan: 1.626 m cars made (+30.8%); +39.6% concrete machinery output; +5.5% exports to ASEAN; 33.9% of above-scale value added from equipment manufacturing."] = "Infographie de quatre chiffres officiels 2025 pour le Hunan : 1,626 million d’automobiles produites (+30,8 %) ; +39,6 % de production de machines à béton ; +5,5 % d’exportations vers l’ASEAN ; 33,9 % de la valeur ajoutée des entreprises de taille supérieure au seuil issus de la fabrication d’équipements.";
  zh["Canton Fair 2026: Dates, Phases and Buyer Guide | Hurfi"] = "2026 广交会：时间、分期与买家指南 | Hurfi";
  fr["Canton Fair 2026: Dates, Phases and Buyer Guide | Hurfi"] = "Canton Fair 2026 : dates, phases et guide acheteur | Hurfi";
  zh["Canton Fair guide for buyers and exporters"] = "广交会采购与出口指南";
  fr["Canton Fair guide for buyers and exporters"] = "Guide du Canton Fair pour acheteurs et exportateurs";
  zh["The 140th Canton Fair runs in three phases from 15 October to 4 November 2026 in Guangzhou. This guide gives the confirmed dates, which phase covers which products, how buyers register, and what a manufacturer should fix on its website before the fair and after it."] = "第 140 届广交会将于 2026 年 10 月 15 日至 11 月 4 日在广州分三期举行。本指南提供已确认的日期、各期对应的产品、买家登记方式，以及制造商在展前和展后应完善哪些网站内容。";
  fr["The 140th Canton Fair runs in three phases from 15 October to 4 November 2026 in Guangzhou. This guide gives the confirmed dates, which phase covers which products, how buyers register, and what a manufacturer should fix on its website before the fair and after it."] = "La 140e édition du Canton Fair se tient en trois phases du 15 octobre au 4 novembre 2026 à Canton. Ce guide donne les dates confirmées, la phase qui correspond à chaque famille de produits, la procédure d’inscription des acheteurs, et ce qu’un fabricant doit corriger sur son site avant et après le salon.";
  zh["What the Canton Fair is"] = "广交会是什么";
  fr["What the Canton Fair is"] = "Qu’est-ce que le Canton Fair";
  zh["2026 dates, hours and venue"] = "2026 年时间、开放时段与地点";
  fr["2026 dates, hours and venue"] = "Dates, horaires et lieu en 2026";
  zh["Which phase are your products in?"] = "您的产品属于哪一期？";
  fr["Which phase are your products in?"] = "À quelle phase correspondent vos produits ?";
  zh["If you are buying: registration and the invitation letter"] = "如果您是采购方：登记与邀请函";
  fr["If you are buying: registration and the invitation letter"] = "Si vous achetez : inscription et lettre d’invitation";
  zh["If you are exhibiting: fix your website first"] = "如果您是参展商：先完善网站";
  fr["If you are exhibiting: fix your website first"] = "Si vous exposez : commencez par votre site";
  zh["Follow-up decides who gets the RFQ"] = "跟进决定谁能拿到询价";
  fr["Follow-up decides who gets the RFQ"] = "Le suivi décide qui reçoit la demande de devis";
  zh["Planning the 2027 sessions"] = "规划 2027 年展会";
  fr["Planning the 2027 sessions"] = "Préparer les sessions 2027";
  zh["A checklist for this session"] = "本届展会清单";
  fr["A checklist for this session"] = "Liste de contrôle pour cette session";
  zh["The China Import and Export Fair, held in Guangzhou and known as the Canton Fair, has run every spring and autumn since 1957. It is a trade fair: buyers and exhibitors register, and it is not open to the general public. Each session runs in three phases of about five days, with two- to three-day intervals between them to reset the halls."] = "中国进出口商品交易会（广交会）在广州举办，自 1957 年起每年春秋两届。它是贸易展会：采购商和参展商需登记入场，不对公众开放。每届分三期，每期约五天，期间有两到三天的间隔用于重新布展。";
  fr["The China Import and Export Fair, held in Guangzhou and known as the Canton Fair, has run every spring and autumn since 1957. It is a trade fair: buyers and exhibitors register, and it is not open to the general public. Each session runs in three phases of about five days, with two- to three-day intervals between them to reset the halls."] = "La Foire chinoise d’importation et d’exportation, organisée à Canton sous le nom de Canton Fair, se tient chaque printemps et chaque automne depuis 1957. C’est un salon professionnel : acheteurs et exposants s’inscrivent et le public n’y a pas accès. Chaque session se déroule en trois phases d’environ cinq jours, séparées par deux à trois jours de remontage des halls.";
  zh["The scale is unusual. The organiser lists 1.55 million square metres of exhibition area and more than 32,000 exhibitors, and reports 310,000 overseas buyers from 223 countries and regions at the 138th session. For a manufacturer, that means a buyer you meet at one booth is meeting dozens of suppliers in the same week."] = "规模罕见。主办方公布展览面积 155 万平方米、参展商超过 3.2 万家，并称第 138 届有来自 223 个国家和地区的 31 万名境外采购商。对制造商来说，这意味着您在展位遇到的买家，同一周内还在与数十家供应商洽谈。";
  fr["The scale is unusual. The organiser lists 1.55 million square metres of exhibition area and more than 32,000 exhibitors, and reports 310,000 overseas buyers from 223 countries and regions at the 138th session. For a manufacturer, that means a buyer you meet at one booth is meeting dozens of suppliers in the same week."] = "L’échelle est inhabituelle. L’organisateur annonce 1,55 million de mètres carrés d’exposition et plus de 32 000 exposants, et 310 000 acheteurs étrangers de 223 pays et régions à la 138e session. Pour un fabricant, cela signifie que l’acheteur rencontré sur un stand en voit des dizaines d’autres la même semaine.";
  zh["The organiser has published both 2026 sessions. All phases run at the China Import and Export Fair Complex, No. 382 Yuejiang Zhong Road, Guangzhou, from 9:30 to 18:00."] = "主办方已公布 2026 年两届的日程。所有期次都在广交会展馆举行，地址为广州市阅江中路 382 号，开放时间为 9:30 至 18:00。";
  fr["The organiser has published both 2026 sessions. All phases run at the China Import and Export Fair Complex, No. 382 Yuejiang Zhong Road, Guangzhou, from 9:30 to 18:00."] = "L’organisateur a publié les deux sessions de 2026. Toutes les phases se tiennent au complexe de la Foire de Canton, 382 Yuejiang Zhong Road, Canton, de 9 h 30 à 18 h.";
  zh["139th (Spring 2026):"] = "第 139 届（2026 年春）：";
  fr["139th (Spring 2026):"] = "139e (printemps 2026) :";
  zh["Phase 1, 15–19 April; Phase 2, 23–27 April; Phase 3, 1–5 May."] = "第一期 4 月 15—19 日；第二期 4 月 23—27 日；第三期 5 月 1—5 日。";
  fr["Phase 1, 15–19 April; Phase 2, 23–27 April; Phase 3, 1–5 May."] = "Phase 1, 15–19 avril ; phase 2, 23–27 avril ; phase 3, 1er–5 mai.";
  zh["140th (Autumn 2026):"] = "第 140 届（2026 年秋）：";
  fr["140th (Autumn 2026):"] = "140e (automne 2026) :";
  zh["Phase 1, 15–19 October; Phase 2, 23–27 October; Phase 3, 31 October–4 November."] = "第一期 10 月 15—19 日；第二期 10 月 23—27 日；第三期 10 月 31 日—11 月 4 日。";
  fr["Phase 1, 15–19 October; Phase 2, 23–27 October; Phase 3, 31 October–4 November."] = "Phase 1, 15–19 octobre ; phase 2, 23–27 octobre ; phase 3, 31 octobre–4 novembre.";
  zh["Intervals in autumn 2026:"] = "2026 年秋季换展期：";
  fr["Intervals in autumn 2026:"] = "Intervalles à l’automne 2026 :";
  zh["20–22 October and 28–30 October, used to dismantle and rebuild the halls."] = "10 月 20—22 日和 10 月 28—30 日，用于撤展和重新布展。";
  fr["20–22 October and 28–30 October, used to dismantle and rebuild the halls."] = "20–22 octobre et 28–30 octobre, consacrés au démontage et au remontage des halls.";
  zh["Hosts and organiser:"] = "主办与承办：";
  fr["Hosts and organiser:"] = "Hôtes et organisateur :";
  zh["the Ministry of Commerce and the Guangdong provincial government host; the China Foreign Trade Centre organises."] = "商务部与广东省人民政府主办，中国对外贸易中心承办。";
  fr["the Ministry of Commerce and the Guangdong provincial government host; the China Foreign Trade Centre organises."] = "le ministère du Commerce et le gouvernement du Guangdong accueillent ; le China Foreign Trade Centre organise.";
  zh["Phases are grouped by product, so buyers plan travel around the phase that matches what they source. The organiser's list is long; this is the summary most buyers use."] = "各期按产品分组，买家会围绕自己采购的品类安排行程。主办方的清单很长，以下是多数买家使用的概要。";
  fr["Phases are grouped by product, so buyers plan travel around the phase that matches what they source. The organiser's list is long; this is the summary most buyers use."] = "Les phases sont regroupées par produit : les acheteurs planifient leur voyage selon la phase correspondant à leurs achats. La liste de l’organisateur est longue ; voici le résumé utilisé par la plupart des acheteurs.";
  zh["Phase 1 — industrial and technical:"] = "第一期——工业与技术类：";
  fr["Phase 1 — industrial and technical:"] = "Phase 1 — industriel et technique :";
  zh["household appliances, consumer electronics and information products, industrial automation, processing, power and general machinery, construction and agricultural machinery, new materials and chemicals, vehicles and spare parts, motorcycles, bicycles, lighting, hardware and tools, new energy resources."] = "家用电器、消费电子与信息产品、工业自动化、加工机械、动力与通用机械、工程与农业机械、新材料与化工、汽车及零部件、摩托车、自行车、照明、五金工具、新能源。";
  fr["household appliances, consumer electronics and information products, industrial automation, processing, power and general machinery, construction and agricultural machinery, new materials and chemicals, vehicles and spare parts, motorcycles, bicycles, lighting, hardware and tools, new energy resources."] = "électroménager, électronique grand public et produits d’information, automatisation industrielle, machines de transformation, énergie et machines générales, machines de construction et agricoles, matériaux nouveaux et produits chimiques, véhicules et pièces, motos, vélos, éclairage, quincaillerie et outils, énergies nouvelles.";
  zh["Phase 2 — consumer and building:"] = "第二期——消费品与建材类：";
  fr["Phase 2 — consumer and building:"] = "Phase 2 — biens de consommation et bâtiment :";
  zh["ceramics, kitchenware and household items, glass and art ceramics, home decorations, gardening, festival products, gifts, clocks and optical instruments, building and decorative materials, sanitary and bathroom equipment, furniture."] = "陶瓷、厨具与家居用品、玻璃与艺术陶瓷、家居装饰、园艺、节庆用品、礼品、钟表与光学仪器、建筑装饰材料、卫浴设备、家具。";
  fr["ceramics, kitchenware and household items, glass and art ceramics, home decorations, gardening, festival products, gifts, clocks and optical instruments, building and decorative materials, sanitary and bathroom equipment, furniture."] = "céramique, ustensiles de cuisine et articles ménagers, verre et céramique d’art, décoration intérieure, jardinage, articles de fête, cadeaux, horlogerie et instruments d’optique, matériaux de construction et de décoration, équipements sanitaires, mobilier.";
  zh["Phase 3 — fashion, textiles and health:"] = "第三期——时尚、纺织与健康类：";
  fr["Phase 3 — fashion, textiles and health:"] = "Phase 3 — mode, textiles et santé :";
  zh["clothing and accessories, underwear, sportswear, furs and leather, textile raw materials and fabrics, shoes, cases and bags, home textiles and carpets, office supplies, food, medicines, health products and medical devices, personal care, sports and recreation, pet products, toys and children's items."] = "服装及配饰、内衣、运动休闲装、皮草皮革、纺织原料与面料、鞋、箱包、家纺与地毯、办公用品、食品、医药、保健品与医疗器械、个人护理、运动与休闲、宠物用品、玩具及婴童用品。";
  fr["clothing and accessories, underwear, sportswear, furs and leather, textile raw materials and fabrics, shoes, cases and bags, home textiles and carpets, office supplies, food, medicines, health products and medical devices, personal care, sports and recreation, pet products, toys and children's items."] = "vêtements et accessoires, sous-vêtements, sportswear, fourrures et cuir, matières textiles et tissus, chaussures, bagages, linge de maison et tapis, fournitures de bureau, alimentation, médicaments, produits de santé et dispositifs médicaux, soins personnels, sport et loisirs, articles pour animaux, jouets et articles pour enfants.";
  zh["Buyer registration is handled by the organiser, through its buyer platform. You register with passport and company details, receive a buyer badge, and use the same system for the visa invitation letter many first-time visitors need."] = "买家登记由主办方通过其买家平台办理。您用护照和公司信息登记，获得买家证，并通过同一系统申请许多首次参观者所需的签证邀请函。";
  fr["Buyer registration is handled by the organiser, through its buyer platform. You register with passport and company details, receive a buyer badge, and use the same system for the visa invitation letter many first-time visitors need."] = "L’inscription des acheteurs est gérée par l’organisateur via sa plateforme acheteurs. Vous vous inscrivez avec votre passeport et les informations de votre société, recevez un badge acheteur et utilisez le même système pour la lettre d’invitation au visa dont beaucoup de visiteurs ont besoin.";
  zh["Register early: badge approval and visa timing are the two things that most often go wrong close to a session."] = "尽早登记：临近展期时，买家证审批和签证时间最容易出问题。";
  fr["Register early: badge approval and visa timing are the two things that most often go wrong close to a session."] = "Inscrivez-vous tôt : la validation du badge et les délais de visa sont les deux points qui posent le plus souvent problème à l’approche d’une session.";
  zh["Apply for the invitation letter only through the organiser's buyer system; treat unsolicited offers of letters or badges as suspect."] = "邀请函只通过主办方的买家系统申请；对主动提供的邀请函或买家证要保持警惕。";
  fr["Apply for the invitation letter only through the organiser's buyer system; treat unsolicited offers of letters or badges as suspect."] = "Ne demandez la lettre d’invitation que via le système acheteurs de l’organisateur ; méfiez-vous des offres spontanées de lettres ou de badges.";
  zh["Plan halls by phase before you book flights — arriving in the wrong phase means the suppliers you want are not there."] = "订机票前先按期次规划展馆——来错期次，您想见的供应商根本不在。";
  fr["Plan halls by phase before you book flights — arriving in the wrong phase means the suppliers you want are not there."] = "Planifiez les halls par phase avant de réserver vos vols : arriver à la mauvaise phase signifie que les fournisseurs recherchés ne sont pas là.";
  zh["Book accommodation early; the Pazhou area fills for the weeks around each phase."] = "尽早订住宿；琶洲一带在每期前后几周都很紧张。";
  fr["Book accommodation early; the Pazhou area fills for the weeks around each phase."] = "Réservez l’hébergement tôt ; le quartier de Pazhou est complet les semaines autour de chaque phase.";
  zh["Bring your own product specifications and target prices, so booth conversations start at the technical level."] = "带上您自己的产品规格和目标价格，让展位交流直接从技术层面开始。";
  fr["Bring your own product specifications and target prices, so booth conversations start at the technical level."] = "Emportez vos propres spécifications et prix cibles, pour que les échanges au stand commencent au niveau technique.";
  zh["Buyers use the fair to build a shortlist, then go online to cut it down. Everything you claim at the booth should already be on your site, in text a search engine can read, because that is what the buyer checks in the hotel that evening."] = "买家在展会上建立候选名单，然后上网筛掉一部分。您在展位上说的每一句话，都应早已存在于网站上的可被搜索引擎读取的文字中，因为买家当晚在酒店查看的就是它。";
  fr["Buyers use the fair to build a shortlist, then go online to cut it down. Everything you claim at the booth should already be on your site, in text a search engine can read, because that is what the buyer checks in the hotel that evening."] = "Les acheteurs utilisent le salon pour établir une présélection, puis vont en ligne pour la réduire. Tout ce que vous affirmez sur le stand doit déjà figurer sur votre site, en texte lisible par un moteur de recherche, car c’est ce que l’acheteur consulte le soir à l’hôtel.";
  zh["A page for every product you exhibit, with specifications in HTML rather than only inside a PDF catalogue."] = "为每件参展产品设一个页面，规格用 HTML 呈现，而不只是放在 PDF 目录里。";
  fr["A page for every product you exhibit, with specifications in HTML rather than only inside a PDF catalogue."] = "Une page pour chaque produit exposé, avec les spécifications en HTML et non seulement dans un catalogue PDF.";
  zh["Certificates and approvals on the product pages they cover, with scope and market."] = "把证书和认证放在对应的产品页面上，并注明范围和市场。";
  fr["Certificates and approvals on the product pages they cover, with scope and market."] = "Les certificats et homologations sur les pages produits concernées, avec le périmètre et le marché.";
  zh["MOQ, lead time and packing stated plainly, so the first email is about the project and not about basics."] = "明确写出最小起订量、交期和包装，让第一封邮件谈项目而不是谈基本问题。";
  fr["MOQ, lead time and packing stated plainly, so the first email is about the project and not about basics."] = "Indiquez clairement le MOQ, le délai et l’emballage, pour que le premier e-mail porte sur le projet et non sur les bases.";
  zh["A fair page with booth number, hall and phase, linking to the products on show."] = "设一个展会页面，写明展位号、展馆和期次，并链接到参展产品。";
  fr["A fair page with booth number, hall and phase, linking to the products on show."] = "Une page salon avec numéro de stand, hall et phase, renvoyant aux produits présentés.";
  zh["A QR code on brochures and booth panels that opens the exact product section, tagged so you can see visits that came from the fair."] = "在宣传册和展位展板上放二维码，直接打开对应的产品部分，并加上标记，以便看到来自展会的访问。";
  fr["A QR code on brochures and booth panels that opens the exact product section, tagged so you can see visits that came from the fair."] = "Un QR code sur les brochures et les panneaux du stand qui ouvre la section produit exacte, avec un marquage pour repérer les visites venues du salon.";
  zh["An English enquiry form that works on a phone, plus a named contact with a direct email."] = "一个在手机上可用的英文询盘表单，以及一位有直接邮箱的对接人。";
  fr["An English enquiry form that works on a phone, plus a named contact with a direct email."] = "Un formulaire de demande en anglais qui fonctionne sur mobile, et un contact nommé avec une adresse e-mail directe.";
  zh["Most exhibitors collect more cards than they can follow up well. The supplier that replies within a few days, answers the buyer's actual question and links to the right product page usually wins the quotation request, even against a cheaper competitor."] = "多数参展商收集的名片多到自己跟进不完。几天内回复、回答买家真正的问题并链接到正确产品页的供应商，通常能拿到报价请求，即使竞争对手价格更低。";
  fr["Most exhibitors collect more cards than they can follow up well. The supplier that replies within a few days, answers the buyer's actual question and links to the right product page usually wins the quotation request, even against a cheaper competitor."] = "La plupart des exposants collectent plus de cartes qu’ils ne peuvent en suivre. Le fournisseur qui répond en quelques jours, répond à la vraie question de l’acheteur et renvoie à la bonne page produit obtient généralement la demande de devis, même face à un concurrent moins cher.";
  zh["Our guide to"] = "我们关于";
  fr["Our guide to"] = "Notre guide sur";
  zh["trade show follow-up for manufacturers"] = "展会跟进";
  fr["trade show follow-up for manufacturers"] = "le suivi de salon pour les fabricants";
  zh["covers the email structure and a 30-day plan;"] = "介绍了邮件结构和 30 天计划；";
  fr["covers the email structure and a 30-day plan;"] = "détaille la structure de l’e-mail et un plan sur 30 jours ;";
  zh["industrial product page SEO"] = "工业产品页面 SEO";
  fr["industrial product page SEO"] = "le SEO des pages produits industriels";
  zh["covers the pages the email should point to."] = "讲的是邮件应指向哪些页面。";
  fr["covers the pages the email should point to."] = "couvre les pages vers lesquelles l’e-mail doit renvoyer.";
  zh["The spring session normally falls in mid-April with the same three-phase pattern, and the autumn session in mid-October. Exact dates, hall layout and registration windows are published by the organiser, and they are the only source worth planning around; third-party date lists are often copied and wrong."] = "春季展通常在 4 月中旬，沿用同样的三期模式，秋季展在 10 月中旬。具体日期、展馆布局和登记时间由主办方公布，也是唯一值得据此规划的来源；第三方日期清单多为转抄，常有错误。";
  fr["The spring session normally falls in mid-April with the same three-phase pattern, and the autumn session in mid-October. Exact dates, hall layout and registration windows are published by the organiser, and they are the only source worth planning around; third-party date lists are often copied and wrong."] = "La session de printemps tombe normalement à la mi-avril selon le même schéma en trois phases, et celle d’automne à la mi-octobre. Les dates exactes, la disposition des halls et les fenêtres d’inscription sont publiées par l’organisateur, seule source fiable pour planifier ; les listes de dates de tiers sont souvent recopiées et fausses.";
  zh["Confirm which phase your products are in, and book travel for those days only."] = "确认产品所属期次，只订那几天的行程。";
  fr["Confirm which phase your products are in, and book travel for those days only."] = "Confirmez la phase de vos produits et ne réservez le voyage que pour ces jours.";
  zh["Publish or refresh the product pages for everything on the booth."] = "为展位上的所有产品发布或更新产品页面。";
  fr["Publish or refresh the product pages for everything on the booth."] = "Publiez ou actualisez les pages produits de tout ce qui est présenté au stand.";
  zh["Add the fair page with booth, hall and phase, and link it from the home page."] = "添加含展位号、展馆和期次的展会页面，并从首页链接过去。";
  fr["Add the fair page with booth, hall and phase, and link it from the home page."] = "Ajoutez la page salon avec stand, hall et phase, et liez-la depuis la page d’accueil.";
  zh["Create one tracked link or QR code for each product group."] = "为每个产品组创建一个可追踪的链接或二维码。";
  fr["Create one tracked link or QR code for each product group."] = "Créez un lien ou un QR code suivi par groupe de produits.";
  zh["Decide who replies to enquiries, and in what language, before the first day."] = "在开展第一天前，确定由谁、用哪种语言回复询盘。";
  fr["Decide who replies to enquiries, and in what language, before the first day."] = "Décidez qui répond aux demandes, et dans quelle langue, avant le premier jour.";
  zh["Log every contact with product interest and market, not just a name."] = "记录每个联系人的产品兴趣和市场，而不只是一个名字。";
  fr["Log every contact with product interest and market, not just a name."] = "Consignez chaque contact avec le produit qui l’intéresse et son marché, pas seulement un nom.";
  zh["Send the first follow-up within three days of meeting the buyer."] = "在见到买家后三天内发出第一封跟进邮件。";
  fr["Send the first follow-up within three days of meeting the buyer."] = "Envoyez le premier suivi dans les trois jours suivant la rencontre.";
  zh["Review which page the fair traffic landed on, and fix what it exposed."] = "查看展会流量落在哪个页面，并修正它暴露的问题。";
  fr["Review which page the fair traffic landed on, and fix what it exposed."] = "Vérifiez sur quelle page le trafic du salon est arrivé et corrigez ce qu’il a révélé.";
  zh["Product and fair pages that carry the specifications, certificates and terms buyers check after the booth."] = "承载买家在展位之后要核对的规格、证书和条款的产品页与展会页。";
  fr["Product and fair pages that carry the specifications, certificates and terms buyers check after the booth."] = "Des pages produits et salon qui portent les spécifications, certificats et conditions vérifiés après le stand.";
  zh["Search titles, internal links and sitemaps so buyers who search your company name or product find the right page."] = "搜索结果标题、内链和站点地图，让搜索您公司名或产品的买家找到正确页面。";
  fr["Search titles, internal links and sitemaps so buyers who search your company name or product find the right page."] = "Des titres, liens internes et plans de site pour que les acheteurs qui cherchent votre société ou un produit trouvent la bonne page.";
  zh["Campaign landing pages and tracked fair links for chosen product families."] = "为选定产品系列制作活动落地页和可追踪的展会链接。";
  fr["Campaign landing pages and tracked fair links for chosen product families."] = "Des pages d’atterrissage et des liens salon suivis pour les familles de produits choisies.";
  zh["Posts that show the booth, the products and the shipments that follow."] = "展示展位、产品以及随后发货的帖文。";
  fr["Posts that show the booth, the products and the shipments that follow."] = "Des publications montrant le stand, les produits et les expéditions qui suivent.";
  zh["When is the next Canton Fair?"] = "下一届广交会是什么时候？";
  fr["When is the next Canton Fair?"] = "Quand a lieu le prochain Canton Fair ?";
  zh["The 140th session (autumn 2026) runs 15–19 October, 23–27 October and 31 October–4 November 2026 in Guangzhou. The 139th ran 15 April–5 May 2026 in the same three-phase pattern."] = "第 140 届（2026 年秋）于 2026 年 10 月 15—19 日、10 月 23—27 日、10 月 31 日—11 月 4 日在广州举行。第 139 届已于 2026 年 4 月 15 日—5 月 5 日以同样的三期模式举办。";
  fr["The 140th session (autumn 2026) runs 15–19 October, 23–27 October and 31 October–4 November 2026 in Guangzhou. The 139th ran 15 April–5 May 2026 in the same three-phase pattern."] = "La 140e session (automne 2026) se tient du 15 au 19 octobre, du 23 au 27 octobre et du 31 octobre au 4 novembre 2026 à Canton. La 139e s’est tenue du 15 avril au 5 mai 2026 selon le même schéma en trois phases.";
  zh["Is the Canton Fair open to the public?"] = "广交会向公众开放吗？";
  fr["Is the Canton Fair open to the public?"] = "Le Canton Fair est-il ouvert au public ?";
  zh["No. It is a trade fair for registered buyers and exhibitors. Visitors register through the organiser and are issued a buyer badge."] = "不开放。它是面向已登记采购商和参展商的贸易展会。参观者需通过主办方登记并领取买家证。";
  fr["No. It is a trade fair for registered buyers and exhibitors. Visitors register through the organiser and are issued a buyer badge."] = "Non. C’est un salon professionnel réservé aux acheteurs et exposants inscrits. Les visiteurs s’inscrivent auprès de l’organisateur et reçoivent un badge acheteur.";
  zh["How do I register as an overseas buyer?"] = "境外采购商如何登记？";
  fr["How do I register as an overseas buyer?"] = "Comment s’inscrire comme acheteur étranger ?";
  zh["Through the organiser's buyer platform, with passport and company details. Register well before the session so the badge and any visa paperwork arrive in time."] = "通过主办方的买家平台，凭护照和公司信息登记。请尽早登记，以便买家证和签证材料及时到位。";
  fr["Through the organiser's buyer platform, with passport and company details. Register well before the session so the badge and any visa paperwork arrive in time."] = "Via la plateforme acheteurs de l’organisateur, avec passeport et informations de société. Inscrivez-vous bien avant la session pour que le badge et les documents de visa arrivent à temps.";
  zh["How do I get a Canton Fair invitation letter for a visa?"] = "如何获得用于签证的广交会邀请函？";
  fr["How do I get a Canton Fair invitation letter for a visa?"] = "Comment obtenir une lettre d’invitation du Canton Fair pour un visa ?";
  zh["Request it through the organiser's buyer system after registering. Treat any paid or unsolicited offer of an invitation letter as suspect."] = "登记后通过主办方的买家系统申请。对任何付费或主动提供的邀请函要保持警惕。";
  fr["Request it through the organiser's buyer system after registering. Treat any paid or unsolicited offer of an invitation letter as suspect."] = "Demandez-la via le système acheteurs de l’organisateur après l’inscription. Méfiez-vous de toute lettre d’invitation payante ou non sollicitée.";
  zh["Which phase should I attend?"] = "我应该参加哪一期？";
  fr["Which phase should I attend?"] = "À quelle phase participer ?";
  zh["The one that matches what you source: Phase 1 for machinery, electronics, vehicles, hardware and building materials; Phase 2 for houseware, gifts and furniture; Phase 3 for textiles, clothing, shoes, food and health products."] = "与您采购内容相匹配的那一期：第一期是机械、电子、汽车、五金和建材；第二期是家居用品、礼品和家具；第三期是纺织、服装、鞋类、食品和健康产品。";
  fr["The one that matches what you source: Phase 1 for machinery, electronics, vehicles, hardware and building materials; Phase 2 for houseware, gifts and furniture; Phase 3 for textiles, clothing, shoes, food and health products."] = "Celle qui correspond à vos achats : phase 1 pour machines, électronique, véhicules, quincaillerie et matériaux de construction ; phase 2 pour arts de la table, cadeaux et mobilier ; phase 3 pour textiles, vêtements, chaussures, alimentation et produits de santé.";
  zh["How large is the fair?"] = "展会规模有多大？";
  fr["How large is the fair?"] = "Quelle est la taille du salon ?";
  zh["The organiser lists 1.55 million square metres and more than 32,000 exhibitors. The 138th session reported 310,000 overseas buyers from 223 countries and regions."] = "主办方公布展览面积 155 万平方米、参展商超过 3.2 万家。第 138 届报告有来自 223 个国家和地区的 31 万名境外采购商。";
  fr["The organiser lists 1.55 million square metres and more than 32,000 exhibitors. The 138th session reported 310,000 overseas buyers from 223 countries and regions."] = "L’organisateur annonce 1,55 million de mètres carrés et plus de 32 000 exposants. La 138e session a accueilli 310 000 acheteurs étrangers de 223 pays et régions.";
  zh["Do we need a Chinese-speaking team at the fair?"] = "展会上需要会说中文的团队吗？";
  fr["Do we need a Chinese-speaking team at the fair?"] = "Faut-il une équipe sinophone au salon ?";
  zh["Most export booths work in English. A Mandarin speaker still helps with smaller suppliers, local transport and contracts, but it is not a requirement for buyer meetings."] = "多数出口展位用英语工作。有中文同事仍有助于对接小供应商、当地交通和合同，但对买家会谈并非必需。";
  fr["Most export booths work in English. A Mandarin speaker still helps with smaller suppliers, local transport and contracts, but it is not a requirement for buyer meetings."] = "La plupart des stands export travaillent en anglais. Un sinophone reste utile pour les petits fournisseurs, le transport local et les contrats, mais ce n’est pas indispensable pour les rendez-vous acheteurs.";
  zh["How should an exporter use the fair for SEO?"] = "出口企业如何借展会做 SEO？";
  fr["How should an exporter use the fair for SEO?"] = "Comment un exportateur utilise-t-il le salon pour son SEO ?";
  zh["Publish a fair page with booth details, link it to the exhibited products, tag the QR links, and keep the product pages updated afterwards so the traffic the fair sends can convert."] = "发布含展位信息的展会页面，链接到参展产品，为二维码链接加标记，并在展后持续更新产品页，让展会带来的流量能够转化。";
  fr["Publish a fair page with booth details, link it to the exhibited products, tag the QR links, and keep the product pages updated afterwards so the traffic the fair sends can convert."] = "Publiez une page salon avec les informations de stand, liez-la aux produits exposés, marquez les liens QR et continuez à mettre à jour les pages produits ensuite, pour que le trafic envoyé par le salon convertisse.";
  zh["Can Hurfi help us prepare?"] = "Hurfi 能帮我们准备吗？";
  fr["Can Hurfi help us prepare?"] = "Hurfi peut-il nous aider à préparer ?";
  zh["Yes. We can build or refresh the product pages, write the fair page, set up tracked links and prepare the follow-up templates before the session."] = "可以。我们能在展前搭建或更新产品页、撰写展会页、设置追踪链接并准备跟进模板。";
  fr["Yes. We can build or refresh the product pages, write the fair page, set up tracked links and prepare the follow-up templates before the session."] = "Oui. Nous pouvons créer ou actualiser les pages produits, rédiger la page salon, mettre en place les liens suivis et préparer les modèles de suivi avant la session.";
  zh["General information: 140th session dates, hours and venue"] = "基本信息：第 140 届日期、开放时段与地点";
  fr["General information: 140th session dates, hours and venue"] = "Informations générales : dates, horaires et lieu de la 140e session";
  zh[". Checked 21 October 2026."] = "。核对日期：2026 年 10 月 21 日。";
  fr[". Checked 21 October 2026."] = ". Vérifié le 21 octobre 2026.";
  zh["General information: 139th session dates and exhibit categories"] = "基本信息：第 139 届日期与展品类别";
  fr["General information: 139th session dates and exhibit categories"] = "Informations générales : dates et catégories de la 139e session";
  zh["The State Council of the People's Republic of China (english.gov.cn)."] = "中华人民共和国国务院（english.gov.cn）。";
  fr["The State Council of the People's Republic of China (english.gov.cn)."] = "Le Conseil des affaires d’État de la République populaire de Chine (english.gov.cn).";
  zh["140th Canton Fair in south China to draw over 32,000 exhibitors"] = "第 140 届广交会将在华南举行，参展商超过 3.2 万家";
  fr["140th Canton Fair in south China to draw over 32,000 exhibitors"] = "Le 140e Canton Fair dans le sud de la Chine attirera plus de 32 000 exposants";
  zh["Diagram of the steps covered in this guide: 1. Find the phase for your products; 2. Prepare product pages before you travel; 3. Register and plan the visit; 4. Record what buyers asked; 5. Follow up within three days; 6. Measure fair-sourced RFQs."] = "本指南步骤示意图：1. 确定产品所属期次；2. 出发前准备产品页面；3. 登记并规划行程；4. 记录买家提出的问题；5. 三天内跟进；6. 统计来自展会的询盘。";
  fr["Diagram of the steps covered in this guide: 1. Find the phase for your products; 2. Prepare product pages before you travel; 3. Register and plan the visit; 4. Record what buyers asked; 5. Follow up within three days; 6. Measure fair-sourced RFQs."] = "Schéma des étapes de ce guide : 1. Trouver la phase de vos produits ; 2. Préparer les pages produits avant le départ ; 3. S’inscrire et planifier la visite ; 4. Noter ce que les acheteurs ont demandé ; 5. Relancer sous trois jours ; 6. Mesurer les demandes issues du salon.";
  zh["What Is International SEO? A Guide for Exporters | Hurfi"] = "什么是国际 SEO？出口企业指南 | Hurfi";
  fr["What Is International SEO? A Guide for Exporters | Hurfi"] = "Qu’est-ce que le SEO international ? Guide pour exportateurs | Hurfi";
  zh["International SEO is the work of making one website rank and convert in more than one language or country. It is not translation with keywords added. This guide explains the parts that change results, in the order a manufacturer should do them."] = "国际 SEO 是让同一个网站在多种语言或多个国家获得排名并带来转化的系统工作，不是加上关键词的翻译。本指南按制造商应执行的顺序，说明真正影响结果的部分。";
  fr["International SEO is the work of making one website rank and convert in more than one language or country. It is not translation with keywords added. This guide explains the parts that change results, in the order a manufacturer should do them."] = "Le SEO international consiste à faire en sorte qu’un même site se classe et convertisse dans plusieurs langues ou pays. Ce n’est pas une traduction à laquelle on ajoute des mots-clés. Ce guide explique, dans l’ordre où un fabricant doit les traiter, les éléments qui changent réellement les résultats.";
  zh["A working definition"] = "一个可用的定义";
  fr["A working definition"] = "Une définition opérationnelle";
  zh["Multilingual and multi-regional are different problems"] = "多语言与多地区是两个不同问题";
  fr["Multilingual and multi-regional are different problems"] = "Multilingue et multirégional sont deux problèmes différents";
  zh["How search engines learn which page is for whom"] = "搜索引擎如何判断哪个页面面向谁";
  fr["How search engines learn which page is for whom"] = "Comment les moteurs savent quelle page vise qui";
  zh["Choosing a URL structure"] = "选择网址结构";
  fr["Choosing a URL structure"] = "Choisir une structure d’URL";
  zh["Translation quality is the part nobody automates"] = "翻译质量是无法自动化的部分";
  fr["Translation quality is the part nobody automates"] = "La qualité de traduction, la part que personne n’automatise";
  zh["Search is not only Google"] = "搜索不只是 Google";
  fr["Search is not only Google"] = "La recherche n’est pas que Google";
  zh["What answer engines need from the same pages"] = "答案引擎需要同样的页面提供什么";
  fr["What answer engines need from the same pages"] = "Ce que les moteurs de réponse attendent des mêmes pages";
  zh["A four-week start for one market"] = "针对一个市场的四周启动";
  fr["A four-week start for one market"] = "Un démarrage en quatre semaines pour un marché";
  zh["How this differs from the checklist"] = "这与清单有何不同";
  fr["How this differs from the checklist"] = "En quoi cela diffère de la checklist";
  zh["International SEO covers three jobs: making pages exist in the right language, telling search engines which country and language each page serves, and making the local version good enough to be chosen over a local competitor. The first is translation. The second is technical annotation. The third is where most of the return comes from, and where most projects stop too early."] = "国际 SEO 包含三项工作：让页面以正确语言存在、告诉搜索引擎每个页面服务哪个国家和语言、并让本地版本好到能胜过本地竞争对手。第一项是翻译，第二项是技术标注，第三项贡献了大部分回报，也是多数项目过早停下的地方。";
  fr["International SEO covers three jobs: making pages exist in the right language, telling search engines which country and language each page serves, and making the local version good enough to be chosen over a local competitor. The first is translation. The second is technical annotation. The third is where most of the return comes from, and where most projects stop too early."] = "Le SEO international couvre trois tâches : faire exister les pages dans la bonne langue, indiquer aux moteurs quel pays et quelle langue chaque page sert, et rendre la version locale assez bonne pour être préférée à un concurrent local. La première est la traduction. La deuxième est l’annotation technique. La troisième apporte l’essentiel du retour, et c’est là que la plupart des projets s’arrêtent trop tôt.";
  zh["For a Chinese manufacturer, the practical question is not “should we translate the site” but “in which markets can we support a buyer, and what does that buyer need to see before sending an enquiry”."] = "对中国制造商来说，实际问题不是“要不要翻译网站”，而是“我们能在哪些市场为买家提供支持，那位买家在发出询盘前需要看到什么”。";
  fr["For a Chinese manufacturer, the practical question is not “should we translate the site” but “in which markets can we support a buyer, and what does that buyer need to see before sending an enquiry”."] = "Pour un fabricant chinois, la vraie question n’est pas « faut-il traduire le site » mais « dans quels marchés pouvons-nous accompagner un acheteur, et que doit-il voir avant d’envoyer une demande ».";
  zh["Google's own documentation draws the line clearly: a multilingual site offers content in more than one language, while a multi-regional site targets users in different countries, even in the same language. A manufacturer shipping to Canada and the United States has a multi-regional problem; a Canadian business with English and French versions has a multilingual one, and many exporters have both at once."] = "Google 自己的文档划得很清楚：多语言网站用多种语言提供内容，多地区网站面向不同国家的用户，即使语言相同。向加拿大和美国发货的制造商面对的是多地区问题；同时有英法两版的加拿大企业面对的是多语言问题，而许多出口企业两者兼有。";
  fr["Google's own documentation draws the line clearly: a multilingual site offers content in more than one language, while a multi-regional site targets users in different countries, even in the same language. A manufacturer shipping to Canada and the United States has a multi-regional problem; a Canadian business with English and French versions has a multilingual one, and many exporters have both at once."] = "La documentation de Google trace clairement la frontière : un site multilingue propose du contenu en plusieurs langues, tandis qu’un site multirégional cible des utilisateurs de différents pays, même dans une seule langue. Un fabricant qui livre au Canada et aux États-Unis a un problème multirégional ; une entreprise canadienne avec des versions anglaise et française a un problème multilingue, et beaucoup d’exportateurs ont les deux à la fois.";
  zh["This matters because the two need different signals. Language versions need correct language tags and translated content. Country versions need consistent regional signals: currency, units, certifications accepted there, delivery terms, contact hours and local proof."] = "这很重要，因为两者需要不同的信号。语言版本需要正确的语言标记和翻译内容；国家版本需要一致的地区信号：货币、单位、当地认可的认证、交货条款、联系时间以及本地佐证。";
  fr["This matters because the two need different signals. Language versions need correct language tags and translated content. Country versions need consistent regional signals: currency, units, certifications accepted there, delivery terms, contact hours and local proof."] = "Cela compte parce que les deux exigent des signaux différents. Les versions linguistiques ont besoin de balises de langue correctes et d’un contenu traduit. Les versions nationales ont besoin de signaux régionaux cohérents : devise, unités, certifications acceptées sur place, conditions de livraison, horaires de contact et preuves locales.";
  zh["Three mechanisms do most of the work. The HTML lang attribute declares the language of a page, and should match the text actually on it. hreflang annotations link alternate language or region versions of the same page to each other. Canonical tags then make clear which URL is the original when near-duplicates exist."] = "三项机制承担了大部分工作。HTML 的 lang 属性声明页面语言，且应与页面实际文字一致。hreflang 注释把同一页面的其他语言或地区版本相互链接。canonical 标签则在存在近乎重复的页面时说明哪个网址是原始版本。";
  fr["Three mechanisms do most of the work. The HTML lang attribute declares the language of a page, and should match the text actually on it. hreflang annotations link alternate language or region versions of the same page to each other. Canonical tags then make clear which URL is the original when near-duplicates exist."] = "Trois mécanismes font l’essentiel du travail. L’attribut lang du HTML déclare la langue d’une page et doit correspondre au texte réellement présent. Les annotations hreflang relient entre elles les versions linguistiques ou régionales d’une même page. Les balises canonical précisent ensuite quelle URL est l’originale lorsqu’il existe des quasi-doublons.";
  zh["Every language version should carry hreflang annotations for the other versions, including a self-reference."] = "每个语言版本都应为其他版本提供 hreflang 注释，包括指向自身的引用。";
  fr["Every language version should carry hreflang annotations for the other versions, including a self-reference."] = "Chaque version linguistique doit porter des annotations hreflang pour les autres versions, y compris une auto-référence.";
  zh["Annotations should be reciprocal: if page A points to page B, page B points back to A."] = "注释应相互对应：如果页面 A 指向页面 B，页面 B 也要指回 A。";
  fr["Annotations should be reciprocal: if page A points to page B, page B points back to A."] = "Les annotations doivent être réciproques : si la page A pointe vers la page B, la page B doit pointer vers la A.";
  zh["Use x-default for the version served when no language or region matches."] = "当没有匹配的语言或地区时，用 x-default 指定所提供的版本。";
  fr["Use x-default for the version served when no language or region matches."] = "Utilisez x-default pour la version servie lorsqu’aucune langue ni région ne correspond.";
  zh["Set the lang attribute on the html element; do not declare a language the page does not use."] = "在 html 元素上设置 lang 属性；不要声明页面并未使用的语言。";
  fr["Set the lang attribute on the html element; do not declare a language the page does not use."] = "Définissez l’attribut lang sur l’élément html ; ne déclarez pas une langue que la page n’utilise pas.";
  zh["Keep one canonical per language version, and make sure sitemaps list the versions you want indexed."] = "每个语言版本保留一个 canonical，并确保站点地图列出你希望被索引的版本。";
  fr["Keep one canonical per language version, and make sure sitemaps list the versions you want indexed."] = "Gardez un canonical par version linguistique et vérifiez que les plans de site listent les versions que vous voulez indexer.";
  zh["There are three common patterns, and the right answer depends on how much you will invest per market rather than on a technical preference."] = "常见模式有三种，正确答案取决于你愿意在每个市场投入多少，而不是技术偏好。";
  fr["There are three common patterns, and the right answer depends on how much you will invest per market rather than on a technical preference."] = "Il existe trois schémas courants, et le bon choix dépend de l’investissement par marché plutôt que d’une préférence technique.";
  zh["Country-code domains"] = "国别域名";
  fr["Country-code domains"] = "Domaines nationaux";
  zh["(example.de, example.fr): strongest country signal, but each domain needs its own authority, hosting and maintenance."] = "（example.de、example.fr）：国家信号最强，但每个域名都需要自己的权重、主机和维护。";
  fr["(example.de, example.fr): strongest country signal, but each domain needs its own authority, hosting and maintenance."] = "(example.de, example.fr) : signal pays le plus fort, mais chaque domaine a besoin de sa propre autorité, de son hébergement et de sa maintenance.";
  zh["(de.example.com): easier to separate technically, but treated more like separate sites than folders."] = "（de.example.com）：技术上更易分离，但被当作独立站点而非目录。";
  fr["(de.example.com): easier to separate technically, but treated more like separate sites than folders."] = "(de.example.com) : plus facile à séparer techniquement, mais traité davantage comme des sites distincts que comme des dossiers.";
  zh["(example.com/de/): cheapest to launch and usually the fastest way to inherit the main site's authority; weaker as a country signal."] = "（example.com/de/）：上线成本最低，通常也是继承主站权重最快的方式；但作为国家信号较弱。";
  fr["(example.com/de/): cheapest to launch and usually the fastest way to inherit the main site's authority; weaker as a country signal."] = "(example.com/de/) : le moins cher à lancer et souvent le moyen le plus rapide d’hériter de l’autorité du site principal ; signal pays plus faible.";
  zh["For most manufacturers starting with two or three markets, subfolders are the pragmatic first step; a country domain can follow where the market justifies it."] = "对大多数从两三个市场起步的制造商来说，子目录是务实的第一步；在市场足以支撑时，再跟进国别域名。";
  fr["For most manufacturers starting with two or three markets, subfolders are the pragmatic first step; a country domain can follow where the market justifies it."] = "Pour la plupart des fabricants qui démarrent sur deux ou trois marchés, les sous-dossiers sont la première étape pragmatique ; un domaine national peut suivre là où le marché le justifie.";
  zh["A machine translation of a specification table produces a page that reads fluently and is still wrong. Model numbers, tolerances, standards, directive numbers and certificate scopes have to survive translation exactly, and the surrounding sentence has to sound like the industry in that language."] = "机器翻译的规格表读起来流畅，却仍然是错的。型号、公差、标准、指令编号和证书范围必须原样保留，周围的句子也要听起来像该语言里的行业用语。";
  fr["A machine translation of a specification table produces a page that reads fluently and is still wrong. Model numbers, tolerances, standards, directive numbers and certificate scopes have to survive translation exactly, and the surrounding sentence has to sound like the industry in that language."] = "Une traduction automatique d’un tableau de spécifications produit une page fluide et pourtant fausse. Références, tolérances, normes, numéros de directive et périmètres de certificats doivent survivre exactement à la traduction, et la phrase autour doit sonner comme le métier dans cette langue.";
  zh["The workflow that holds up is: a professional translator who works in the sector, then a technical reviewer from your own team, then a native check of the final page. That is slower than a plugin, and it is the difference between a page buyers trust and one they close."] = "可靠的流程是：熟悉该行业的专业译员，然后是你自己团队的技术审校，最后是对最终页面的母语校对。这比插件慢，但决定了页面是被买家信任还是被关掉。";
  fr["The workflow that holds up is: a professional translator who works in the sector, then a technical reviewer from your own team, then a native check of the final page. That is slower than a plugin, and it is the difference between a page buyers trust and one they close."] = "La méthode qui tient est la suivante : un traducteur professionnel du secteur, puis une relecture technique par votre équipe, puis une vérification par un natif de la page finale. C’est plus lent qu’un plugin, et c’est la différence entre une page à laquelle les acheteurs font confiance et une page qu’ils ferment.";
  zh["Google dominates in most Western markets, but not everywhere. Baidu is the main engine in mainland China, Yandex in Russia, Naver in South Korea, and Seznam in the Czech Republic. Each has its own indexing behaviour, and some prefer locally hosted or locally registered sites."] = "Google 在多数西方市场占主导，但并非处处如此。中国大陆主要是百度，俄罗斯是 Yandex，韩国是 Naver，捷克是 Seznam。每个引擎的索引行为不同，有些更偏好本地托管或本地注册的站点。";
  fr["Google dominates in most Western markets, but not everywhere. Baidu is the main engine in mainland China, Yandex in Russia, Naver in South Korea, and Seznam in the Czech Republic. Each has its own indexing behaviour, and some prefer locally hosted or locally registered sites."] = "Google domine sur la plupart des marchés occidentaux, mais pas partout. Baidu est le moteur principal en Chine continentale, Yandex en Russie, Naver en Corée du Sud et Seznam en Tchéquie. Chacun a son comportement d’indexation, et certains préfèrent les sites hébergés ou enregistrés localement.";
  zh["This does not mean building a separate strategy per engine. It means checking, market by market, which engine your buyers actually use, and making sure the site is crawlable and legible there before spending on content."] = "这并不意味着要为每个引擎单独制定策略，而是逐个市场确认买家实际使用哪个引擎，并在投入内容之前确保站点在那里可抓取、可阅读。";
  fr["This does not mean building a separate strategy per engine. It means checking, market by market, which engine your buyers actually use, and making sure the site is crawlable and legible there before spending on content."] = "Cela ne signifie pas construire une stratégie par moteur. Cela signifie vérifier, marché par marché, quel moteur vos acheteurs utilisent réellement, et s’assurer que le site y est explorable et lisible avant d’investir dans le contenu.";
  zh["Buyers increasingly start with an AI assistant rather than a search box. Those systems quote pages that state facts plainly and attribute them: what a product is, which standard it meets, what the lead time is, who published the figure. The same structure that helps a careful buyer helps a retrieval system."] = "买家越来越多地从 AI 助手而不是搜索框开始。这些系统引用的是把事实讲清楚并标明出处的页面：产品是什么、符合哪项标准、交期多久、数据由谁发布。帮助谨慎买家的同一种结构，也帮助检索系统。";
  fr["Buyers increasingly start with an AI assistant rather than a search box. Those systems quote pages that state facts plainly and attribute them: what a product is, which standard it meets, what the lead time is, who published the figure. The same structure that helps a careful buyer helps a retrieval system."] = "Les acheteurs commencent de plus en plus par un assistant IA plutôt que par une barre de recherche. Ces systèmes citent les pages qui énoncent les faits clairement et les attribuent : ce qu’est un produit, quelle norme il respecte, quel est le délai, qui a publié le chiffre. La structure qui aide un acheteur attentif aide aussi un système de récupération.";
  zh["In practice: one clear H2 per question, specifications in HTML tables rather than images, FAQ sections with real answers, and schema that describes the page honestly. Our guide to"] = "实践中：每个问题一个清晰的 H2，规格放在 HTML 表格而不是图片里，FAQ 部分给出真实回答，并用 schema 如实描述页面。我们关于";
  fr["In practice: one clear H2 per question, specifications in HTML tables rather than images, FAQ sections with real answers, and schema that describes the page honestly. Our guide to"] = "En pratique : un H2 clair par question, des spécifications en tableaux HTML plutôt qu’en images, des sections FAQ avec de vraies réponses, et un schema qui décrit la page honnêtement. Notre guide sur";
  zh["covers the retrieval side in more depth."] = "的指南更深入地讨论了检索这一面。";
  fr["covers the retrieval side in more depth."] = "couvre plus en détail le volet récupération.";
  zh["choose one market, one product family and the pages that matter; check who ranks there now."] = "选定一个市场、一个产品系列和真正重要的页面；查看目前谁在那里排名。";
  fr["choose one market, one product family and the pages that matter; check who ranks there now."] = "choisissez un marché, une famille de produits et les pages qui comptent ; regardez qui se classe aujourd’hui.";
  zh["translate those pages with a sector translator; keep numbers, standards and certificate names untouched."] = "由行业译员翻译这些页面；数字、标准和证书名称保持不动。";
  fr["translate those pages with a sector translator; keep numbers, standards and certificate names untouched."] = "faites traduire ces pages par un traducteur du secteur ; ne touchez pas aux chiffres, normes et noms de certificats.";
  zh["add language tags, hreflang and sitemap entries; fix internal links between language versions."] = "添加语言标记、hreflang 和站点地图条目；修正语言版本之间的内链。";
  fr["add language tags, hreflang and sitemap entries; fix internal links between language versions."] = "ajoutez les balises de langue, le hreflang et les entrées de plan de site ; corrigez les liens internes entre versions linguistiques.";
  zh["localise proof — currency, units, delivery terms, certificates accepted there — then measure impressions and enquiries for that market alone."] = "本地化佐证——货币、单位、交货条款、当地认可的证书——然后只针对该市场衡量展示次数和询盘。";
  fr["localise proof — currency, units, delivery terms, certificates accepted there — then measure impressions and enquiries for that market alone."] = "localisez les preuves — devise, unités, conditions de livraison, certificats acceptés sur place — puis mesurez impressions et demandes pour ce seul marché.";
  zh["international SEO checklist for exporters"] = "面向出口企业的国际 SEO 清单";
  fr["international SEO checklist for exporters"] = "la checklist SEO international pour exportateurs";
  zh["is the audit view: the items to verify on a site that already exists. This page is the definition and the build order. Start here if the site has no translated pages yet; start with the checklist if it has several and you are not sure they work."] = "是审计视角：用于核对已经存在的网站。本页是定义与搭建顺序。如果网站还没有翻译页面，从这里开始；如果已有多个版本而你不确定它们是否有效，从清单开始。";
  fr["is the audit view: the items to verify on a site that already exists. This page is the definition and the build order. Start here if the site has no translated pages yet; start with the checklist if it has several and you are not sure they work."] = "est la vue d’audit : les points à vérifier sur un site existant. Cette page donne la définition et l’ordre de construction. Commencez ici si le site n’a pas encore de pages traduites ; commencez par la checklist s’il en a plusieurs et que vous doutez qu’elles fonctionnent.";
  zh["Translated pages built on the same design, with language tags and hreflang wired in from the start."] = "沿用同一设计的翻译页面，从一开始就接入语言标记和 hreflang。";
  fr["Translated pages built on the same design, with language tags and hreflang wired in from the start."] = "Des pages traduites sur le même design, avec balises de langue et hreflang intégrés dès le départ.";
  zh["Per-market titles, internal links and sitemaps, plus checks on which engine matters in each country."] = "按市场定制的标题、内链和站点地图，并核查每个国家哪个引擎更重要。";
  fr["Per-market titles, internal links and sitemaps, plus checks on which engine matters in each country."] = "Des titres, liens internes et plans de site par marché, et des vérifications sur le moteur qui compte dans chaque pays.";
  zh["Campaigns in the market's own language, with local units and terms."] = "用市场本地语言开展推广，并采用当地单位和术语。";
  fr["Campaigns in the market's own language, with local units and terms."] = "Des campagnes dans la langue du marché, avec unités et termes locaux.";
  zh["Posts and pages that give answer engines clean facts to quote."] = "为答案引擎提供可引用清晰事实的帖文和页面。";
  fr["Posts and pages that give answer engines clean facts to quote."] = "Des publications et pages qui donnent aux moteurs de réponse des faits clairs à citer.";
  zh["What is international SEO in simple terms?"] = "简单来说，什么是国际 SEO？";
  fr["What is international SEO in simple terms?"] = "Qu’est-ce que le SEO international, en termes simples ?";
  zh["Making a website rank and convert in more than one language or country: translated pages, technical signals that tell search engines which version is for whom, and local proof that makes the page worth choosing."] = "让网站在多种语言或多个国家获得排名并带来转化：翻译的页面、告诉搜索引擎哪个版本面向谁的技术信号，以及让页面值得被选择的本地佐证。";
  fr["Making a website rank and convert in more than one language or country: translated pages, technical signals that tell search engines which version is for whom, and local proof that makes the page worth choosing."] = "Faire qu’un site se classe et convertisse dans plusieurs langues ou pays : des pages traduites, des signaux techniques indiquant aux moteurs quelle version vise qui, et des preuves locales qui rendent la page digne d’être choisie.";
  zh["Is international SEO just translation?"] = "国际 SEO 只是翻译吗？";
  fr["Is international SEO just translation?"] = "Le SEO international se résume-t-il à la traduction ?";
  zh["No. Translation is one input. The rest is URL and hreflang structure, language tags, local units and certifications, and measurement per market."] = "不是。翻译只是其中一项输入，其余是网址与 hreflang 结构、语言标记、本地单位与认证，以及按市场衡量。";
  fr["No. Translation is one input. The rest is URL and hreflang structure, language tags, local units and certifications, and measurement per market."] = "Non. La traduction n’est qu’un ingrédient. Le reste, ce sont la structure d’URL et de hreflang, les balises de langue, les unités et certifications locales, et la mesure par marché.";
  zh["Do I need hreflang if I only have one translation?"] = "只有一个翻译版本也需要 hreflang 吗？";
  fr["Do I need hreflang if I only have one translation?"] = "Faut-il du hreflang avec une seule traduction ?";
  zh["Yes, between the original and the translated version, with a self-reference and a return link. Without it, engines may treat the pages as duplicates or serve the wrong one."] = "需要，在原始版本和翻译版本之间互指，并包含自身引用和回指链接。否则引擎可能把页面视为重复，或提供错误的版本。";
  fr["Yes, between the original and the translated version, with a self-reference and a return link. Without it, engines may treat the pages as duplicates or serve the wrong one."] = "Oui, entre l’original et la version traduite, avec auto-référence et lien retour. Sans cela, les moteurs peuvent considérer les pages comme des doublons ou servir la mauvaise.";
  zh["Should we use a country domain or a subfolder?"] = "应该用国别域名还是子目录？";
  fr["Should we use a country domain or a subfolder?"] = "Faut-il un domaine national ou un sous-dossier ?";
  zh["Subfolders are the cheapest way to start and inherit the main site's authority; country domains give a stronger local signal but each needs its own investment. Most manufacturers should start with subfolders."] = "子目录是起步并继承主站权重最便宜的方式；国别域名本地信号更强，但每个都需要单独投入。多数制造商应从子目录开始。";
  fr["Subfolders are the cheapest way to start and inherit the main site's authority; country domains give a stronger local signal but each needs its own investment. Most manufacturers should start with subfolders."] = "Les sous-dossiers sont le moyen le moins cher de démarrer et d’hériter de l’autorité du site principal ; les domaines nationaux offrent un signal local plus fort mais exigent chacun leur propre investissement. La plupart des fabricants devraient commencer par des sous-dossiers.";
  zh["Can we machine translate product pages?"] = "产品页面可以机器翻译吗？";
  fr["Can we machine translate product pages?"] = "Peut-on traduire les pages produits automatiquement ?";
  zh["Not for specifications, certificates or terms. Machine output can be used as a draft for marketing copy at most, and every technical page needs a sector translator plus a review by your engineers."] = "规格、证书和条款不行。机器译文最多只能作为营销文案的草稿，每个技术页面都需要行业译员和你们工程师的审校。";
  fr["Not for specifications, certificates or terms. Machine output can be used as a draft for marketing copy at most, and every technical page needs a sector translator plus a review by your engineers."] = "Pas pour les spécifications, certificats ou conditions. Une sortie automatique peut au mieux servir de brouillon pour du contenu marketing, et chaque page technique exige un traducteur du secteur et une relecture par vos ingénieurs.";
  zh["Does international SEO work for Baidu or Yandex?"] = "国际 SEO 对百度或 Yandex 有效吗？";
  fr["Does international SEO work for Baidu or Yandex?"] = "Le SEO international fonctionne-t-il pour Baidu ou Yandex ?";
  zh["Partly. Each engine has its own behaviour and some favour locally hosted or registered sites. Check which engine your buyers use in that market before investing in content."] = "部分有效。每个引擎行为不同，有些偏好本地托管或本地注册的站点。在投入内容之前，先确认该市场买家使用哪个引擎。";
  fr["Partly. Each engine has its own behaviour and some favour locally hosted or registered sites. Check which engine your buyers use in that market before investing in content."] = "En partie. Chaque moteur a son comportement et certains privilégient les sites hébergés ou enregistrés localement. Vérifiez quel moteur utilisent vos acheteurs sur ce marché avant d’investir dans le contenu.";
  zh["How long until a translated page ranks?"] = "翻译页面多久能获得排名？";
  fr["How long until a translated page ranks?"] = "Combien de temps avant qu’une page traduite se classe ?";
  zh["It depends on competition, site authority and how much local proof the page carries. We do not promise timelines; we report impressions and enquiries per market from your own accounts."] = "取决于竞争程度、站点权重和页面承载的本地佐证。我们不做时间承诺；我们按市场报告来自你自有账户的展示次数和询盘。";
  fr["It depends on competition, site authority and how much local proof the page carries. We do not promise timelines; we report impressions and enquiries per market from your own accounts."] = "Cela dépend de la concurrence, de l’autorité du site et des preuves locales que porte la page. Nous ne promettons pas de délais ; nous rapportons impressions et demandes par marché depuis vos propres comptes.";
  zh["Can we start with one market?"] = "可以先做一个市场吗？";
  fr["Can we start with one market?"] = "Peut-on commencer par un seul marché ?";
  zh["Yes, and we usually recommend it. One market done properly teaches you what the second needs, and costs far less than five half-finished versions."] = "可以，我们通常也这样建议。把一个市场做扎实，会让你知道第二个市场需要什么，成本也远低于五个半成品版本。";
  fr["Yes, and we usually recommend it. One market done properly teaches you what the second needs, and costs far less than five half-finished versions."] = "Oui, et nous le recommandons généralement. Un marché bien traité vous apprend ce dont le second a besoin, pour bien moins cher que cinq versions à moitié finies.";
  zh["W3C Internationalization Activity."] = "W3C 国际化活动。";
  fr["W3C Internationalization Activity."] = "Activité d’internationalisation du W3C.";
  zh["Declaring language in HTML"] = "在 HTML 中声明语言";
  fr["Declaring language in HTML"] = "Déclarer la langue en HTML";
  zh["Diagram of the steps covered in this guide: 1. Choose the markets, not the languages; 2. Pick a URL structure you can maintain; 3. Translate with a technical reviewer; 4. Implement hreflang and language tags; 5. Localise proof and units; 6. Measure each market separately."] = "本指南步骤示意图：1. 选市场，而不是选语言；2. 选一种你能维护的网址结构；3. 在技术审校下翻译；4. 部署 hreflang 与语言标记；5. 本地化佐证与单位；6. 分市场衡量。";
  fr["Diagram of the steps covered in this guide: 1. Choose the markets, not the languages; 2. Pick a URL structure you can maintain; 3. Translate with a technical reviewer; 4. Implement hreflang and language tags; 5. Localise proof and units; 6. Measure each market separately."] = "Schéma des étapes de ce guide : 1. Choisir les marchés, pas les langues ; 2. Retenir une structure d’URL maintenable ; 3. Traduire avec une relecture technique ; 4. Mettre en place hreflang et balises de langue ; 5. Localiser preuves et unités ; 6. Mesurer chaque marché séparément.";
  zh["Dates, phases, buyer registration and invitation letters for the 140th session, and what exporters should prepare before and after."] = "第 140 届的日期、分期、买家登记与邀请函，以及出口企业在展前展后应做的准备。";
  fr["Dates, phases, buyer registration and invitation letters for the 140th session, and what exporters should prepare before and after."] = "Dates, phases, inscription des acheteurs et lettres d’invitation pour la 140e session, et ce que les exportateurs doivent préparer avant et après.";
  zh["The difference between translating a site and ranking in another market, and the parts that actually change results."] = "翻译网站与在另一个市场获得排名之间的区别，以及真正改变结果的环节。";
  fr["The difference between translating a site and ranking in another market, and the parts that actually change results."] = "La différence entre traduire un site et se classer sur un autre marché, et les éléments qui changent réellement les résultats.";
  zh["How do overseas buyers search for CNC machining suppliers?"] = "海外买家如何搜索 CNC 加工供应商？";
  fr["How do overseas buyers search for CNC machining suppliers?"] = "Comment les acheteurs étrangers cherchent-ils des fournisseurs d’usinage CNC ?";
  zh["Mostly by service and material, not by company type: “custom CNC machining service”, “precision CNC machining parts”, “aluminium CNC machining”, “stainless steel CNC machining”. A supplier page that only says “CNC machining company” misses those searches."] = "主要按服务和材料搜索，而不是按公司类型：“custom CNC machining service”“precision CNC machining parts”“aluminium CNC machining”“stainless steel CNC machining”。只写“CNC machining company”的供应商页面会错过这些搜索。";
  fr["Mostly by service and material, not by company type: “custom CNC machining service”, “precision CNC machining parts”, “aluminium CNC machining”, “stainless steel CNC machining”. A supplier page that only says “CNC machining company” misses those searches."] = "Surtout par service et par matière, pas par type d’entreprise : « custom CNC machining service », « precision CNC machining parts », « aluminium CNC machining », « stainless steel CNC machining ». Une page qui ne dit que « CNC machining company » manque ces recherches.";
  zh["Should aluminium and stainless steel parts have separate pages?"] = "铝件和不锈钢件应该分成不同页面吗？";
  fr["Should aluminium and stainless steel parts have separate pages?"] = "Faut-il des pages distinctes pour l’aluminium et l’inox ?";
  zh["Yes, if you machine both at volume. Buyers search by material, and a page that lists the alloys you cut, achievable tolerances, finishes and typical parts matches that search far better than one general page."] = "如果两者都批量加工，应该分开。买家按材料搜索，列出你所加工合金、可达公差、表面处理和典型零件的页面，比一个笼统页面更契合这种搜索。";
  fr["Yes, if you machine both at volume. Buyers search by material, and a page that lists the alloys you cut, achievable tolerances, finishes and typical parts matches that search far better than one general page."] = "Oui, si vous usinez les deux en volume. Les acheteurs cherchent par matière, et une page qui liste les alliages usinés, les tolérances atteignables, les finitions et les pièces typiques correspond bien mieux à cette recherche qu’une page générale.";
  zh["What should a custom machining quote form ask for?"] = "定制加工询价表单应该要求提供什么？";
  fr["What should a custom machining quote form ask for?"] = "Que doit demander un formulaire de devis d’usinage sur mesure ?";
  zh["Drawing format (STEP, IGES or DXF), material and alloy, tolerances, surface finish, quantity and target date. Ask for the file, not a description of it, so the first reply can be a real quotation."] = "图纸格式（STEP、IGES 或 DXF）、材料和合金、公差、表面处理、数量以及目标交期。要求提供文件本身，而不是对文件的描述，这样第一次回复就能是真正的报价。";
  fr["Drawing format (STEP, IGES or DXF), material and alloy, tolerances, surface finish, quantity and target date. Ask for the file, not a description of it, so the first reply can be a real quotation."] = "Le format du plan (STEP, IGES ou DXF), la matière et l’alliage, les tolérances, la finition de surface, la quantité et la date cible. Demandez le fichier, pas sa description, pour que la première réponse soit une vraie offre.";
  zh["Fujian Manufacturers: Export Websites & SEO | Hurfi"] = "福建制造商：外贸网站与 SEO | Hurfi";
  fr["Fujian Manufacturers: Export Websites & SEO | Hurfi"] = "Fabricants du Fujian : sites export et SEO | Hurfi";
  zh["Export websites and Google SEO for Fujian manufacturers"] = "为福建制造商打造外贸网站与 Google SEO";
  fr["Export websites and Google SEO for Fujian manufacturers"] = "Sites export et SEO Google pour les fabricants du Fujian";
  zh["Fujian makes electronics, machinery and electrical equipment in Xiamen, textiles, shoes, apparel and sports goods in Quanzhou, textiles, steel and vehicles in Fuzhou, and lithium batteries in Ningde. Its exports fell in 2025, but sales to the EU grew. This guide summarises the province’s official figures and links to our city guides."] = "福建在厦门生产电子、机械和电气设备，在泉州生产纺织、鞋、服装和运动用品，在福州生产纺织、钢铁和车辆，在宁德生产锂电池。2025 年出口下降，但对欧盟出口增长。本指南汇总全省官方数据，并链接到各城市指南。";
  fr["Fujian makes electronics, machinery and electrical equipment in Xiamen, textiles, shoes, apparel and sports goods in Quanzhou, textiles, steel and vehicles in Fuzhou, and lithium batteries in Ningde. Its exports fell in 2025, but sales to the EU grew. This guide summarises the province’s official figures and links to our city guides."] = "Le Fujian produit de l’électronique, des machines et des équipements électriques à Xiamen, du textile, des chaussures, de l’habillement et des articles de sport à Quanzhou, du textile, de l’acier et des véhicules à Fuzhou, et des batteries au lithium à Ningde. Ses exportations ont reculé en 2025, mais les ventes vers l’UE ont progressé. Ce guide résume les chiffres officiels de la province et renvoie à nos guides de villes.";
  zh["Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Fujian; we work with manufacturers there remotely."] = "Hurfi 的办公室位于西安（陕西）和博古拉（孟加拉国）。我们在福建没有办公室或员工；我们以远程方式与当地制造商合作。";
  fr["Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Fujian; we work with manufacturers there remotely."] = "Les bureaux de Hurfi sont à Xi’an (Shaanxi) et à Bogura (Bangladesh). Nous n’avons ni bureau ni personnel au Fujian ; nous travaillons à distance avec les fabricants de la province.";
  zh["Fujian’s manufacturing economy in official figures"] = "官方数据中的福建制造业";
  fr["Fujian’s manufacturing economy in official figures"] = "L’économie manufacturière du Fujian en chiffres officiels";
  zh["The Fujian Provincial Bureau of Statistics’ 2025 bulletin gives the province-wide picture below."] = "福建省统计局 2025 年公报给出以下全省图景。";
  fr["The Fujian Provincial Bureau of Statistics’ 2025 bulletin gives the province-wide picture below."] = "Le bulletin 2025 du Bureau provincial de la statistique du Fujian donne la photographie provinciale ci-dessous.";
  zh["Fujian’s GDP was 6,019.945 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.0%; value added of industry above designated size grew 6.5%."] = "2025 年福建 GDP 为 60,199.45 亿元，增长 5.0%；规模以上工业增加值增长 6.5%。";
  fr["Fujian’s GDP was 6,019.945 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.0%; value added of industry above designated size grew 6.5%."] = "Le PIB du Fujian s’est élevé à 6 019,945 milliards de yuans en 2025, en hausse de 5,0 % ; la valeur ajoutée industrielle des entreprises de taille supérieure a progressé de 6,5 %.";
  zh["Computer, communication and other electronic equipment grew 16.9%, electrical machinery 14.0% and ferrous metals 13.1%; high-tech manufacturing grew 14.6% and equipment manufacturing 13.9%."] = "计算机、通信和其他电子设备增长 16.9%，电气机械 14.0%，黑色金属 13.1%；高技术制造业增长 14.6%，装备制造业 13.9%。";
  fr["Computer, communication and other electronic equipment grew 16.9%, electrical machinery 14.0% and ferrous metals 13.1%; high-tech manufacturing grew 14.6% and equipment manufacturing 13.9%."] = "L’informatique, la communication et les autres équipements électroniques ont progressé de 16,9 %, les machines électriques de 14,0 % et les métaux ferreux de 13,1 % ; l’industrie de haute technologie a crû de 14,6 % et la fabrication d’équipements de 13,9 %.";
  zh["Goods trade was 1,882.699 billion yuan (−5.4%) and exports 1,155.362 billion yuan (−6.7%); mechanical and electrical exports rose 2.2% to 545.593 billion yuan."] = "货物贸易 18,826.99 亿元（−5.4%），出口 11,553.62 亿元（−6.7%）；机电产品出口增长 2.2% 至 5,455.93 亿元。";
  fr["Goods trade was 1,882.699 billion yuan (−5.4%) and exports 1,155.362 billion yuan (−6.7%); mechanical and electrical exports rose 2.2% to 545.593 billion yuan."] = "Le commerce de marchandises a atteint 1 882,699 milliards de yuans (−5,4 %) et les exportations 1 155,362 milliards (−6,7 %) ; les exportations mécaniques et électriques ont augmenté de 2,2 % pour atteindre 545,593 milliards.";
  zh["Exports to the EU rose 9.7% to 222.047 billion yuan, while exports to ASEAN fell 18.0% and to the United States 22.1%."] = "对欧盟出口增长 9.7% 至 2,220.47 亿元，对东盟出口下降 18.0%，对美国下降 22.1%。";
  fr["Exports to the EU rose 9.7% to 222.047 billion yuan, while exports to ASEAN fell 18.0% and to the United States 22.1%."] = "Les exportations vers l’UE ont augmenté de 9,7 % pour atteindre 222,047 milliards de yuans, tandis que celles vers l’ASEAN ont reculé de 18,0 % et vers les États-Unis de 22,1 %.";
  zh["Fujian’s ports handled 18.4364 million TEU of containers, up 1.8%."] = "福建港口集装箱吞吐量 1,843.64 万标箱，增长 1.8%。";
  fr["Fujian’s ports handled 18.4364 million TEU of containers, up 1.8%."] = "Les ports du Fujian ont traité 18,4364 millions d’EVP de conteneurs, en hausse de 1,8 %.";
  zh["The province made 275,900 cars (+25.2%) and 7.8863 million tonnes of chemical fibre; general-trade exports fell 6.9% while processing-trade exports rose 7.6%."] = "全省生产汽车 27.59 万辆（+25.2%）、化学纤维 788.63 万吨；一般贸易出口下降 6.9%，加工贸易出口增长 7.6%。";
  fr["The province made 275,900 cars (+25.2%) and 7.8863 million tonnes of chemical fibre; general-trade exports fell 6.9% while processing-trade exports rose 7.6%."] = "La province a produit 275 900 voitures (+25,2 %) et 7,8863 millions de tonnes de fibres chimiques ; les exportations en commerce général ont reculé de 6,9 % tandis que celles en perfectionnement ont progressé de 7,6 %.";
  zh["Fujian’s exporters are mostly private and highly specialised, and 2025 pushed many of them towards new buyers and markets. Europe was the bright spot. Selling there means certifications in order, real product data and a website that answers questions before they are asked. Processing trade and mechanical and electrical exports both grew, a sign of where demand was holding up."] = "福建的出口企业多为民营且高度专业化，2025 年把其中许多推向新买家和市场。欧洲是亮点。在那里销售意味着认证齐备、真实的产品数据，以及一个能在问题提出前就作答的网站。加工贸易与机电出口双增长，说明需求在哪些环节仍然稳固。";
  fr["Fujian’s exporters are mostly private and highly specialised, and 2025 pushed many of them towards new buyers and markets. Europe was the bright spot. Selling there means certifications in order, real product data and a website that answers questions before they are asked. Processing trade and mechanical and electrical exports both grew, a sign of where demand was holding up."] = "Les exportateurs du Fujian sont surtout privés et très spécialisés, et 2025 en a poussé beaucoup vers de nouveaux acheteurs et marchés. L’Europe a été le point fort. Y vendre suppose des certifications en règle, de vraies données produits et un site qui répond aux questions avant qu’elles soient posées. Le commerce de perfectionnement et les exportations mécaniques et électriques ont tous deux progressé, signe des segments où la demande tenait.";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Fujian Provincial Bureau of Statistics, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the province, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据取自下方所列官方来源（福建省统计局 2025 年统计公报）。数据描述全省情况，不涉及任何 Hurfi 客户。";
  fr["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Fujian Provincial Bureau of Statistics, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the province, not any Hurfi client."] = "Infographie Hurfi, réalisée à partir des sources officielles listées ci-dessous (Bulletin statistique 2025 du Bureau provincial de la statistique du Fujian). Les chiffres décrivent la province, non un client de Hurfi.";
  zh["City guides in Fujian"] = "福建城市指南";
  fr["City guides in Fujian"] = "Guides de villes au Fujian";
  zh["Electronics, machinery, electrical equipment and medicines; specifications and certifications first."] = "电子、机械、电气设备与医药；先讲规格与认证。";
  fr["Electronics, machinery, electrical equipment and medicines; specifications and certifications first."] = "Électronique, machines, équipements électriques et médicaments ; spécifications et certifications d’abord.";
  zh["Textiles, shoes, sportswear, machinery and packaging; brand and OEM paths kept apart."] = "纺织、鞋、运动服、机械与包装；品牌与 OEM 路径分开。";
  fr["Textiles, shoes, sportswear, machinery and packaging; brand and OEM paths kept apart."] = "Textile, chaussures, sportswear, machines et emballage ; chemins de marque et OEM distincts.";
  zh["Textiles and fibre, steel, cars and displays; rebuilding exports after a hard 2025."] = "纺织与化纤、钢铁、汽车与显示器；在艰难的 2025 年后重建出口。";
  fr["Textiles and fibre, steel, cars and displays; rebuilding exports after a hard 2025."] = "Textile et fibres, acier, voitures et écrans ; reconstruire les exportations après une année 2025 difficile.";
  zh["More Fujian manufacturing cities, from their 2025 bulletins"] = "更多福建制造业城市，数据取自其 2025 年公报";
  fr["More Fujian manufacturing cities, from their 2025 bulletins"] = "D’autres villes manufacturières du Fujian, d’après leurs bulletins 2025";
  zh["Ningde’s value added of industry above designated size grew 13.2% in 2025; lithium-battery new energy, new-energy vehicles, stainless steel and copper made 83.5% of it."] = "2025 年宁德规模以上工业增加值增长 13.2%；锂电新能源、新能源汽车、不锈钢和铜材占其中的 83.5%。";
  fr["Ningde’s value added of industry above designated size grew 13.2% in 2025; lithium-battery new energy, new-energy vehicles, stainless steel and copper made 83.5% of it."] = "La valeur ajoutée industrielle des entreprises de taille supérieure de Ningde a progressé de 13,2 % en 2025 ; les nouvelles énergies lithium, les véhicules à énergie nouvelle, l’inox et le cuivre en ont représenté 83,5 %.";
  zh["Lithium-battery new energy grew 17.7%, stainless steel 16.5% and copper materials 21.3%, while new-energy vehicles fell 3.7%."] = "锂电新能源增长 17.7%，不锈钢 16.5%，铜材 21.3%，新能源汽车下降 3.7%。";
  fr["Lithium-battery new energy grew 17.7%, stainless steel 16.5% and copper materials 21.3%, while new-energy vehicles fell 3.7%."] = "Les nouvelles énergies lithium ont progressé de 17,7 %, l’inox de 16,5 % et les matériaux en cuivre de 21,3 %, tandis que les véhicules à énergie nouvelle ont reculé de 3,7 %.";
  zh["Exports rose 12.6% to 113.30 billion yuan; lithium-ion battery exports grew 17.1%, exports to the EU 66.4%, and exports to the US fell 13.5%."] = "出口增长 12.6% 至 1,133.0 亿元；锂电池出口增长 17.1%，对欧盟出口增长 66.4%，对美国出口下降 13.5%。";
  fr["Exports rose 12.6% to 113.30 billion yuan; lithium-ion battery exports grew 17.1%, exports to the EU 66.4%, and exports to the US fell 13.5%."] = "Les exportations ont augmenté de 12,6 % pour atteindre 113,30 milliards de yuans ; les exportations de batteries lithium-ion ont cru de 17,1 %, celles vers l’UE de 66,4 %, et vers les États-Unis ont reculé de 13,5 %.";
  zh["Private firms made 77.6% of Ningde’s trade, and mechanical and electrical exports grew 16.6%."] = "民营企业占宁德贸易额的 77.6%，机电出口增长 16.6%。";
  fr["Private firms made 77.6% of Ningde’s trade, and mechanical and electrical exports grew 16.6%."] = "Les entreprises privées ont réalisé 77,6 % du commerce de Ningde, et les exportations mécaniques et électriques ont progressé de 16,6 %.";
  zh["Ningde is a battery and materials city. Suppliers into its battery chain should publish specifications, test reports and transport certifications clearly; Europe’s fast-growing demand also brings strict documentation rules. Related:"] = "宁德是电池与材料之城。为其电池产业链供货的供应商应清楚公布规格、检测报告和运输认证；欧洲快速增长的需求也带来严格的单证要求。相关：";
  fr["Ningde is a battery and materials city. Suppliers into its battery chain should publish specifications, test reports and transport certifications clearly; Europe’s fast-growing demand also brings strict documentation rules. Related:"] = "Ningde est une ville de batteries et de matériaux. Les fournisseurs de sa filière batterie doivent publier clairement spécifications, rapports d’essai et certifications de transport ; la demande européenne en forte croissance apporte aussi des règles documentaires strictes. Voir :";
  zh["Ningde in the China directory"] = "中国目录中的宁德";
  fr["Ningde in the China directory"] = "Ningde dans l’annuaire Chine";
  zh["Other Fujian cities we work with"] = "我们合作的其他福建城市";
  fr["Other Fujian cities we work with"] = "D’autres villes du Fujian avec lesquelles nous travaillons";
  zh["We work with manufacturers in every Fujian city, remotely. We have not yet checked official figures for the cities below, so we do not quote any; each links to its entry in the China directory."] = "我们以远程方式与福建各城市的制造商合作。以下城市我们尚未核对官方数据，因此不作引用；每项都链接到中国目录中的条目。";
  fr["We work with manufacturers in every Fujian city, remotely. We have not yet checked official figures for the cities below, so we do not quote any; each links to its entry in the China directory."] = "Nous travaillons à distance avec des fabricants de toutes les villes du Fujian. Nous n’avons pas encore vérifié les chiffres officiels des villes ci-dessous, nous n’en citons donc aucun ; chacune renvoie à son entrée dans l’annuaire Chine.";
  zh["Website and search priorities for Fujian exporters"] = "福建出口企业的网站与搜索重点";
  fr["Website and search priorities for Fujian exporters"] = "Priorités site web et recherche pour les exportateurs du Fujian";
  zh["Put what you make, for whom and to which standards on the first screen."] = "在第一屏就说明你做什么、为谁做、符合哪些标准。";
  fr["Put what you make, for whom and to which standards on the first screen."] = "Mettez dès le premier écran ce que vous fabriquez, pour qui et selon quelles normes.";
  zh["Give each product family a page with specifications in text and certificates by market."] = "为每个产品系列设一个页面，规格用文字呈现，并按市场列出证书。";
  fr["Give each product family a page with specifications in text and certificates by market."] = "Donnez à chaque famille de produits une page avec les spécifications en texte et les certificats par marché.";
  zh["For Europe, prepare CE and other required documents before you build market pages."] = "面向欧洲，在搭建市场页面前先准备 CE 及其他所需文件。";
  fr["For Europe, prepare CE and other required documents before you build market pages."] = "Pour l’Europe, préparez le marquage CE et les autres documents requis avant de construire les pages marché.";
  zh["Separate own-brand and OEM pages; many Fujian makers do both."] = "自有品牌页与 OEM 页分开；许多福建企业两者兼做。";
  fr["Separate own-brand and OEM pages; many Fujian makers do both."] = "Séparez les pages marque propre et OEM ; beaucoup de fabricants du Fujian font les deux.";
  zh["Explain shipping from Xiamen, Fuzhou or your nearest port."] = "说明从厦门、福州或最近港口的运输安排。";
  fr["Explain shipping from Xiamen, Fuzhou or your nearest port."] = "Expliquez l’expédition depuis Xiamen, Fuzhou ou votre port le plus proche.";
  zh["Track RFQs by product line and country to see which new markets respond."] = "按产品线和国家追踪询盘，看哪些新市场有回应。";
  fr["Track RFQs by product line and country to see which new markets respond."] = "Suivez les demandes par ligne de produits et par pays pour voir quels nouveaux marchés répondent.";
  zh["How Hurfi helps Fujian manufacturers"] = "Hurfi 如何帮助福建制造商";
  fr["How Hurfi helps Fujian manufacturers"] = "Comment Hurfi aide les fabricants du Fujian";
