  fr["Does Hurfi have an office in Fujian?"] = "Hurfi a-t-il un bureau au Fujian ?";
  zh["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Fujian; we work with manufacturers there remotely by WeChat, email and video calls."] = "没有。Hurfi 的办公室位于西安（陕西）和博古拉（孟加拉国）。我们在福建没有办公室或员工；我们通过微信、邮件和视频通话与当地制造商远程合作。";
  fr["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Fujian; we work with manufacturers there remotely by WeChat, email and video calls."] = "Non. Les bureaux de Hurfi sont à Xi’an (Shaanxi) et à Bogura (Bangladesh). Nous n’avons ni bureau ni personnel au Fujian ; nous travaillons à distance avec les fabricants par WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence.";
  zh["Which Fujian cities do you have guides for?"] = "你们有福建哪些城市的指南？";
  fr["Which Fujian cities do you have guides for?"] = "Pour quelles villes du Fujian avez-vous des guides ?";
  zh["Xiamen, Quanzhou and Fuzhou, plus a short sourced profile of Ningde on this page."] = "厦门、泉州和福州，以及本页上关于宁德的简要数据档案。";
  fr["Xiamen, Quanzhou and Fuzhou, plus a short sourced profile of Ningde on this page."] = "Xiamen, Quanzhou et Fuzhou, plus un court profil sourcé de Ningde sur cette page.";
  zh["Yes. We work with manufacturers anywhere in Fujian remotely."] = "可以。我们以远程方式与福建任何地方的制造商合作。";
