  zh["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Fujian: 1,155.36 bn yuan of exports (−6.7%); +9.7% exports to the EU; +16.9% electronics value added; 18.44 m TEU of containers (+1.8%)."] = "福建 2025 年四项官方数据图：出口 11,553.6 亿元（−6.7%）；对欧盟出口 +9.7%；电子业增加值 +16.9%；集装箱 1,844 万标箱（+1.8%）。";
  fr["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Fujian: 1,155.36 bn yuan of exports (−6.7%); +9.7% exports to the EU; +16.9% electronics value added; 18.44 m TEU of containers (+1.8%)."] = "Infographie de quatre chiffres officiels 2025 pour le Fujian : 1 155,36 milliards de yuans d’exportations (−6,7 %) ; +9,7 % vers l’UE ; +16,9 % de valeur ajoutée électronique ; 18,44 millions d’EVP (+1,8 %).";
  zh["Sichuan Manufacturers: Export Websites & SEO | Hurfi"] = "四川制造商：外贸网站与 SEO | Hurfi";
