  zh["Deyang’s GDP was 338.71 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.4%."] = "2025 年德阳 GDP 为 3,387.1 亿元，增长 5.4%。";
  fr["Deyang’s GDP was 338.71 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.4%."] = "Le PIB de Deyang s’est élevé à 338,71 milliards de yuans en 2025, en hausse de 5,4 %.";
  zh["It made 76.106 million kW of power-generation equipment (+38.3%), including 40.2 million kW of power-station steam turbines (+26.4%) and 8.185 million kW of gas turbines (+20.0%)."] = "发电设备产量 7,610.6 万千瓦（+38.3%），其中电站汽轮机 4,020 万千瓦（+26.4%）、燃气轮机 818.5 万千瓦（+20.0%）。";
  fr["It made 76.106 million kW of power-generation equipment (+38.3%), including 40.2 million kW of power-station steam turbines (+26.4%) and 8.185 million kW of gas turbines (+20.0%)."] = "Elle a produit 76 106 MW d’équipements de production d’électricité (+38,3 %), dont 40 200 MW de turbines à vapeur de centrales (+26,4 %) et 8 185 MW de turbines à gaz (+20,0 %).";
  zh["Exports fell 22.0% to 13.64 billion yuan."] = "出口下降 22.0% 至 136.4 亿元。";
  fr["Exports fell 22.0% to 13.64 billion yuan."] = "Les exportations ont reculé de 22,0 % pour atteindre 13,64 milliards de yuans.";
  zh["Revenue of above-designated-size industry was 455.08 billion yuan (+1.7%), but profits fell 9.8%."] = "规模以上工业营业收入 4,550.8 亿元（+1.7%），利润下降 9.8%。";
  fr["Revenue of above-designated-size industry was 455.08 billion yuan (+1.7%), but profits fell 9.8%."] = "Le chiffre d’affaires de l’industrie de taille supérieure a atteint 455,08 milliards de yuans (+1,7 %), mais les bénéfices ont reculé de 9,8 %.";
  zh["Deyang makes heavy power-generation equipment, and its output grew strongly in 2025. Its suppliers sell on standards, type tests and delivered projects; a website should show all three. Related:"] = "德阳生产重型发电设备，2025 年产量大幅增长。其供应商靠标准、型式试验和已交付项目来销售；网站应同时展示这三者。相关：";
  fr["Deyang makes heavy power-generation equipment, and its output grew strongly in 2025. Its suppliers sell on standards, type tests and delivered projects; a website should show all three. Related:"] = "Deyang fabrique des équipements lourds de production d’électricité, et sa production a fortement augmenté en 2025. Ses fournisseurs vendent sur les normes, les essais de type et les projets livrés ; un site doit montrer les trois. Voir :";
