  zh["Does Hurfi have an office in Liaoning?"] = "Hurfi 在辽宁有办公室吗？";
  fr["Does Hurfi have an office in Liaoning?"] = "Hurfi a-t-il un bureau au Liaoning ?";
  zh["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Liaoning; we work with manufacturers there remotely by WeChat, email and video calls."] = "没有。Hurfi 的办公室位于西安（陕西）和博古拉（孟加拉国）。我们在辽宁没有办公室或员工；我们通过微信、邮件和视频通话与当地制造商远程合作。";
  fr["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Liaoning; we work with manufacturers there remotely by WeChat, email and video calls."] = "Non. Les bureaux de Hurfi sont à Xi’an (Shaanxi) et à Bogura (Bangladesh). Nous n’avons ni bureau ni personnel au Liaoning ; nous travaillons à distance avec les fabricants par WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence.";
  zh["Which Liaoning cities do you have guides for?"] = "你们有辽宁哪些城市的指南？";
  fr["Which Liaoning cities do you have guides for?"] = "Pour quelles villes du Liaoning avez-vous des guides ?";
  zh["Dalian and Shenyang, plus short sourced profiles of Anshan and Yingkou on this page."] = "大连和沈阳，以及本页上关于鞍山和营口的简要数据档案。";
  fr["Dalian and Shenyang, plus short sourced profiles of Anshan and Yingkou on this page."] = "Dalian et Shenyang, plus de courts profils sourcés d’Anshan et de Yingkou sur cette page.";
  zh["Yes. We work with manufacturers anywhere in Liaoning remotely."] = "可以。我们以远程方式与辽宁任何地方的制造商合作。";
  fr["Yes. We work with manufacturers anywhere in Liaoning remotely."] = "Oui. Nous travaillons à distance avec des fabricants partout au Liaoning.";
  zh["We are a state-owned or long-established company. Do we need a new site?"] = "我们是国企或老牌企业，需要新网站吗？";
  fr["We are a state-owned or long-established company. Do we need a new site?"] = "Nous sommes une entreprise d’État ou ancienne. Avons-nous besoin d’un nouveau site ?";
  zh["If the current site does not show specifications, approvals and contacts clearly in English, yes — buyers judge you by it."] = "如果现有网站不能清楚用英文展示规格、认证和联系方式，就需要——买家正是据此判断你。";
  fr["If the current site does not show specifications, approvals and contacts clearly in English, yes — buyers judge you by it."] = "Si le site actuel ne montre pas clairement en anglais les spécifications, les homologations et les contacts, oui — les acheteurs vous jugent là-dessus.";
  zh["We sell steel and materials. What should the site show?"] = "我们卖钢材和材料，网站应展示什么？";
  fr["We sell steel and materials. What should the site show?"] = "Nous vendons de l’acier et des matériaux. Que doit montrer le site ?";
  zh["Grades, compositions, standards, sizes, packing and the test certificates you provide."] = "牌号、成分、标准、尺寸、包装，以及你能提供的检测证书。";
  fr["Grades, compositions, standards, sizes, packing and the test certificates you provide."] = "Nuances, compositions, normes, dimensions, emballage et les certificats d’essai que vous fournissez.";
  zh["Our buyers are in Russia and Central Asia. Can you help?"] = "我们的买家在俄罗斯和中亚，你们能帮忙吗？";
  fr["Our buyers are in Russia and Central Asia. Can you help?"] = "Nos acheteurs sont en Russie et en Asie centrale. Pouvez-vous nous aider ?";
  zh["Yes, with Russian-language pages where you sell, properly translated and tagged."] = "可以，在你销售的地方提供俄语页面，并妥善翻译和标注。";
  fr["Yes, with Russian-language pages where you sell, properly translated and tagged."] = "Oui, avec des pages en russe là où vous vendez, correctement traduites et balisées.";
