  zh["Does Hurfi have an office in Hubei?"] = "Hurfi 在湖北有办公室吗？";
  fr["Does Hurfi have an office in Hubei?"] = "Hurfi a-t-il un bureau au Hubei ?";
  zh["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Hubei; we work with manufacturers there remotely by WeChat, email and video calls."] = "没有。Hurfi 的办公室位于西安（陕西）和博古拉（孟加拉国）。我们在湖北没有办公室或员工；我们通过微信、邮件和视频通话与当地制造商远程合作。";
  fr["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh). We do not have an office or staff in Hubei; we work with manufacturers there remotely by WeChat, email and video calls."] = "Non. Les bureaux de Hurfi sont à Xi’an (Shaanxi) et à Bogura (Bangladesh). Nous n’avons ni bureau ni personnel au Hubei ; nous travaillons à distance avec les fabricants par WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence.";
