  zh["Do you run Google Ads and social media?"] = "你们做 Google Ads 和社交媒体吗？";
  fr["Do you run Google Ads and social media?"] = "Faites-vous du Google Ads et des réseaux sociaux ?";
  zh["Yes — small, measured campaigns first, and LinkedIn content built from your own photos and projects."] = "做——先做小规模、可衡量的推广，并用你自己的照片和项目制作 LinkedIn 内容。";
  fr["Yes — small, measured campaigns first, and LinkedIn content built from your own photos and projects."] = "Oui — d’abord de petites campagnes mesurées, et du contenu LinkedIn construit à partir de vos propres photos et projets.";
  zh["No. Anyone who guarantees rankings or orders is guessing."] = "不能。任何保证排名或订单的人都是在猜。";
