  zh["Ships and offshore equipment, textiles, fibre and electrical equipment; exports up 17%."] = "船舶与海工装备、纺织、化纤和电气设备；出口增长 17%。";
  fr["Ships and offshore equipment, textiles, fibre and electrical equipment; exports up 17%."] = "Navires et équipements offshore, textiles, fibres et matériel électrique ; exportations en hausse de 17 %.";
  zh["More Jiangsu manufacturing cities, from their 2025 bulletins"] = "江苏更多制造业城市（依据其 2025 年公报）";
