  zh["Xuzhou’s GDP was 995.722 billion yuan in 2025 (+5.8%); value added of industry above designated size grew 6.8%."] = "2025 年徐州 GDP 为 9957.22 亿元（+5.8%），规模以上工业增加值增长 6.8%。";
  fr["Xuzhou’s GDP was 995.722 billion yuan in 2025 (+5.8%); value added of industry above designated size grew 6.8%."] = "Le PIB de Xuzhou s’est élevé à 995,722 milliards de yuans en 2025 (+5,8 %) ; la valeur ajoutée de l’industrie au-dessus de la taille désignée a progressé de 6,8 %.";
  zh["Exports were 89.463 billion yuan (−3.5%), of which mechanical and electrical products were 63.192 billion yuan (+4.4%); Belt and Road countries took 68.0% of exports, while exports to the US fell 41.6% and to the EU 20.9%."] = "出口 894.63 亿元（−3.5%），其中机电产品 631.92 亿元（+4.4%）；“一带一路”国家占出口的 68.0%，对美出口下降 41.6%，对欧盟下降 20.9%。";
  fr["Exports were 89.463 billion yuan (−3.5%), of which mechanical and electrical products were 63.192 billion yuan (+4.4%); Belt and Road countries took 68.0% of exports, while exports to the US fell 41.6% and to the EU 20.9%."] = "Les exportations ont atteint 89,463 milliards de yuans (−3,5 %), dont 63,192 milliards de produits mécaniques et électriques (+4,4 %) ; les pays de la Ceinture et la Route ont représenté 68,0 % des exportations, tandis que les exportations vers les États-Unis ont chuté de 41,6 % et celles vers l’UE de 20,9 %.";
  zh["Xuzhou port handled 69.481 million tonnes of cargo (+15.7%) and 345,000 TEU of containers (+20.4%)."] = "徐州港完成货物吞吐量 6948.1 万吨（+15.7%），集装箱 34.5 万标箱（+20.4%）。";
  fr["Xuzhou port handled 69.481 million tonnes of cargo (+15.7%) and 345,000 TEU of containers (+20.4%)."] = "Le port de Xuzhou a traité 69,481 millions de tonnes de marchandises (+15,7 %) et 345 000 EVP de conteneurs (+20,4 %).";
  zh["Two-thirds of Xuzhou’s exports go to Belt and Road markets. Machinery and equipment suppliers there should build pages for those buyers — with parts, service and shipping answered up front. Related:"] = "徐州三分之二的出口流向“一带一路”市场。当地的机械与设备供应商应面向这些买家建立页面——把配件、服务和运输问题直接写清楚。相关：";
  fr["Two-thirds of Xuzhou’s exports go to Belt and Road markets. Machinery and equipment suppliers there should build pages for those buyers — with parts, service and shipping answered up front. Related:"] = "Deux tiers des exportations de Xuzhou vont vers les marchés de la Ceinture et la Route. Les fournisseurs de machines et d’équipements y gagneraient à créer des pages pour ces acheteurs — avec les pièces, le service et l’expédition traités d’emblée. À lire aussi :";
  zh["Xuzhou in the China directory"] = "中国目录中的徐州";
  fr["Xuzhou in the China directory"] = "Xuzhou dans l’annuaire Chine";
  zh["Other Jiangsu cities we work with"] = "我们合作的其他江苏城市";
