  fr["Guangdong Provincial Bureau of Statistics (bulletin text as reproduced by tjgb.hongheiku.com; official page stats.gd.gov.cn/tjgb/content/post_4876564.html)."] = "Bureau provincial de la statistique du Guangdong (texte du bulletin tel que reproduit par tjgb.hongheiku.com ; page officielle stats.gd.gov.cn/tjgb/content/post_4876564.html).";
  zh["2025年广东省国民经济和社会发展统计公报 (Guangdong 2025 Statistical Bulletin)"] = "2025年广东省国民经济和社会发展统计公报";
  fr["2025年广东省国民经济和社会发展统计公报 (Guangdong 2025 Statistical Bulletin)"] = "2025年广东省国民经济和社会发展统计公报 (Bulletin statistique 2025 du Guangdong)";
  zh["Jiangmen Statistics Bureau and NBS Jiangmen Survey Team (Jiangmen government portal)."] = "江门市统计局、国家统计局江门调查总队（江门市政府门户网站）。";
  fr["Jiangmen Statistics Bureau and NBS Jiangmen Survey Team (Jiangmen government portal)."] = "Bureau de la statistique de Jiangmen et équipe d’enquête de Jiangmen du NBS (portail du gouvernement de Jiangmen).";
  zh["2025年江门市国民经济和社会发展统计公报 (Jiangmen 2025 Statistical Bulletin, 22 May 2026)"] = "2025年江门市国民经济和社会发展统计公报（2026 年 5 月 22 日）";
  fr["2025年江门市国民经济和社会发展统计公报 (Jiangmen 2025 Statistical Bulletin, 22 May 2026)"] = "2025年江门市国民经济和社会发展统计公报 (Bulletin statistique 2025 de Jiangmen, 22 mai 2026)";
  zh["Talk to us about Guangdong"] = "谈谈广东的业务";
  fr["Talk to us about Guangdong"] = "Parlons du Guangdong";
  zh["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Guangdong: 20.9% of China’s goods trade; 59.6% of above-scale value added from equipment manufacturing; 336,300 industrial robot sets (+31.2%); 80.97 m TEU of containers (+4.5%)."] = "广东 2025 年四项官方数据图：占中国货物贸易的 20.9%；装备制造业占规模以上增加值的 59.6%；工业机器人 33.63 万套（+31.2%）；集装箱吞吐量 8097 万标箱（+4.5%）。";
  fr["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Guangdong: 20.9% of China’s goods trade; 59.6% of above-scale value added from equipment manufacturing; 336,300 industrial robot sets (+31.2%); 80.97 m TEU of containers (+4.5%)."] = "Infographie de quatre chiffres officiels 2025 pour le Guangdong : 20,9 % du commerce de marchandises chinois ; 59,6 % de la valeur ajoutée au-dessus de la taille désignée issue de la fabrication d’équipements ; 336 300 ensembles de robots industriels (+31,2 %) ; 80,97 millions d’EVP de conteneurs (+4,5 %).";
  zh["Incoterms 2020 Explained: EXW, FCA and DDP | Hurfi"] = "Incoterms 2020 详解：EXW、FCA 与 DDP | Hurfi";
  fr["Incoterms 2020 Explained: EXW, FCA and DDP | Hurfi"] = "Incoterms 2020 expliqués : EXW, FCA et DDP | Hurfi";
  zh["Incoterms 2020 explained for exporters"] = "写给出口企业的 Incoterms 2020 说明";
  fr["Incoterms 2020 explained for exporters"] = "Les Incoterms 2020 expliqués pour les exportateurs";
  zh["Incoterms 2020 are the International Chamber of Commerce’s eleven three-letter rules that decide who arranges carriage, who pays which cost, and where risk passes from seller to buyer. This guide covers the rules a Chinese manufacturer is asked to quote most often — EXW, FCA, FOB, CIF, DAP, DPU and DDP — and what each one obliges the seller to do."] = "Incoterms 2020 是国际商会制定的十一条三字母规则，用来确定由谁安排运输、由谁承担哪项费用，以及风险在何处由卖方转移给买方。本文讲的是中国制造商最常被要求报价的几条规则——EXW、FCA、FOB、CIF、DAP、DPU 与 DDP——以及每一条对卖方提出了什么要求。";
  fr["Incoterms 2020 are the International Chamber of Commerce’s eleven three-letter rules that decide who arranges carriage, who pays which cost, and where risk passes from seller to buyer. This guide covers the rules a Chinese manufacturer is asked to quote most often — EXW, FCA, FOB, CIF, DAP, DPU and DDP — and what each one obliges the seller to do."] = "Les Incoterms 2020 sont les onze règles de trois lettres de la Chambre de commerce internationale qui déterminent qui organise le transport, qui paie chaque coût et où le risque passe du vendeur à l’acheteur. Ce guide couvre les règles que l’on demande le plus souvent à un fabricant chinois de citer — EXW, FCA, FOB, CIF, DAP, DPU et DDP — et ce que chacune impose au vendeur.";
  zh["What Incoterms 2020 actually decide"] = "Incoterms 2020 究竟确定了什么";
  fr["What Incoterms 2020 actually decide"] = "Ce que les Incoterms 2020 déterminent réellement";
  zh["The eleven rules fall into two groups"] = "十一条规则分为两组";
  fr["The eleven rules fall into two groups"] = "Les onze règles se répartissent en deux groupes";
  zh["EXW and FCA: the difference that matters to a Chinese factory"] = "EXW 与 FCA：对中国工厂真正重要的差别";
  fr["EXW and FCA: the difference that matters to a Chinese factory"] = "EXW et FCA : la différence qui compte pour une usine chinoise";
  zh["FOB, CFR and CIF: risk leaves early, documents carry the trade"] = "FOB、CFR 与 CIF：风险早早转移，单据承载交易";
  fr["FOB, CFR and CIF: risk leaves early, documents carry the trade"] = "FOB, CFR et CIF : le risque part tôt, les documents portent l’échange";
  zh["DAP, DPU and DDP: who clears customs and who unloads"] = "DAP、DPU 与 DDP：谁负责清关，谁负责卸货";
  fr["DAP, DPU and DDP: who clears customs and who unloads"] = "DAP, DPU et DDP : qui dédouane et qui décharge";
  zh["What changed in Incoterms 2020"] = "Incoterms 2020 改了什么";
  fr["What changed in Incoterms 2020"] = "Ce qui a changé dans les Incoterms 2020";
  zh["Where trade terms belong on a manufacturer’s website"] = "贸易术语应该放在制造商网站的什么位置";
  fr["Where trade terms belong on a manufacturer’s website"] = "Où placer les conditions de livraison sur le site d’un fabricant";
  zh["Incoterms are eleven three-letter trade terms published by the International Chamber of Commerce. The current edition, Incoterms 2020, has been in force since 1 January 2020 and replaced the 2010 edition; the rules themselves have been used in international sales contracts since 1936."] = "Incoterms 是国际商会发布的十一条三字母贸易术语。现行版本 Incoterms 2020 自 2020 年 1 月 1 日起生效，取代 2010 年版；这套规则本身自 1936 年起就用于国际货物销售合同。";
  fr["Incoterms are eleven three-letter trade terms published by the International Chamber of Commerce. The current edition, Incoterms 2020, has been in force since 1 January 2020 and replaced the 2010 edition; the rules themselves have been used in international sales contracts since 1936."] = "Les Incoterms sont onze termes commerciaux de trois lettres publiés par la Chambre de commerce internationale. L’édition en vigueur, les Incoterms 2020, s’applique depuis le 1er janvier 2020 et remplace l’édition 2010 ; les règles elles-mêmes sont utilisées dans les contrats de vente internationale depuis 1936.";
  zh["An Incoterm answers three questions and nothing else: who contracts and pays for carriage, where the seller’s risk ends, and which costs each side carries. It does not set the price, the payment method, the product specification, the warranty or the law that governs the contract. A quotation that says only “FOB Ningbo” still leaves payment terms, inspection and after-sales to be agreed in writing."] = "一条 Incoterm 只回答三个问题：谁订立运输合同并支付运费、卖方的风险在哪里结束、双方各自承担哪些费用。它不决定价格、付款方式、产品规格、质保，也不决定合同的适用法律。只写“FOB Ningbo”的报价，付款条件、验货和售后仍然需要另行书面约定。";
  fr["An Incoterm answers three questions and nothing else: who contracts and pays for carriage, where the seller’s risk ends, and which costs each side carries. It does not set the price, the payment method, the product specification, the warranty or the law that governs the contract. A quotation that says only “FOB Ningbo” still leaves payment terms, inspection and after-sales to be agreed in writing."] = "Un Incoterm répond à trois questions et à rien d’autre : qui conclut et paie le contrat de transport, où s’arrête le risque du vendeur, et quels coûts chaque partie supporte. Il ne fixe ni le prix, ni le mode de paiement, ni la spécification du produit, ni la garantie, ni la loi applicable au contrat. Une offre qui indique seulement « FOB Ningbo » laisse les conditions de paiement, l’inspection et le service après-vente à convenir par écrit.";
  zh["The rules bind only when the contract incorporates them by reference, including the edition and a named place. “Incoterms 2020 DAP Rotterdam” is a usable term; “DAP Europe” is not."] = "规则只有在合同明确引用时才具有约束力，引用时要写明版本和指定地点。“Incoterms 2020 DAP Rotterdam”是可用的表述，“DAP Europe”则不是。";
  fr["The rules bind only when the contract incorporates them by reference, including the edition and a named place. “Incoterms 2020 DAP Rotterdam” is a usable term; “DAP Europe” is not."] = "Les règles ne s’appliquent que si le contrat les incorpore par référence, en précisant l’édition et un lieu nommé. « Incoterms 2020 DAP Rotterdam » est une formule utilisable ; « DAP Europe » n’en est pas une.";
  zh["Seven rules apply to any mode of transport, including containers and multimodal shipments. Four apply only to sea and inland waterway carriage, and they assume the goods are handed over at the ship rather than at an inland terminal."] = "其中七条适用于任何运输方式，包括集装箱和多式联运。另有四条只适用于海运和内河运输，并且假定货物在船边交接，而不是在内陆场站交接。";
  fr["Seven rules apply to any mode of transport, including containers and multimodal shipments. Four apply only to sea and inland waterway carriage, and they assume the goods are handed over at the ship rather than at an inland terminal."] = "Sept règles s’appliquent à tout mode de transport, y compris le conteneur et le transport multimodal. Quatre ne concernent que le transport maritime et fluvial, et supposent une remise des marchandises au navire plutôt qu’à un terminal intérieur.";
  zh["Any mode:"] = "任何运输方式：";
  fr["Any mode:"] = "Tout mode de transport :";
  zh["EXW (Ex Works), FCA (Free Carrier), CPT (Carriage Paid To), CIP (Carriage and Insurance Paid To), DAP (Delivered at Place), DPU (Delivered at Place Unloaded), DDP (Delivered Duty Paid)."] = "EXW（工厂交货）、FCA（货交承运人）、CPT（运费付至）、CIP（运费及保险费付至）、DAP（目的地交货）、DPU（卸货地交货）、DDP（完税后交货）。";
  fr["EXW (Ex Works), FCA (Free Carrier), CPT (Carriage Paid To), CIP (Carriage and Insurance Paid To), DAP (Delivered at Place), DPU (Delivered at Place Unloaded), DDP (Delivered Duty Paid)."] = "EXW (Ex Works / à l’usine), FCA (Free Carrier / franco transporteur), CPT (Carriage Paid To / port payé jusqu’à), CIP (Carriage and Insurance Paid To / port payé, assurance comprise, jusqu’à), DAP (Delivered at Place / livraison à un point de destination), DPU (Delivered at Place Unloaded / livraison au lieu de destination déchargée), DDP (Delivered Duty Paid / livraison droits acquittés).";
  zh["Sea and inland waterway only:"] = "仅限海运和内河运输：";
  fr["Sea and inland waterway only:"] = "Maritime et fluvial uniquement :";
  zh["FAS (Free Alongside Ship), FOB (Free On Board), CFR (Cost and Freight), CIF (Cost, Insurance and Freight)."] = "FAS（船边交货）、FOB（船上交货）、CFR（成本加运费）、CIF（成本、保险费加运费）。";
  fr["FAS (Free Alongside Ship), FOB (Free On Board), CFR (Cost and Freight), CIF (Cost, Insurance and Freight)."] = "FAS (Free Alongside Ship / franco le long du navire), FOB (Free On Board / franco à bord), CFR (Cost and Freight / coût et fret), CIF (Cost, Insurance and Freight / coût, assurance et fret).";
  zh["The common mistake:"] = "最常见的错误：";
  fr["The common mistake:"] = "L’erreur courante :";
  zh["using FOB or CIF for a container that is handed to a carrier at a container yard inland. Risk passes when the goods are on board, but the seller lost control of them days earlier."] = "对交给内陆集装箱场站承运人的货物使用 FOB 或 CIF。风险在货物装船时才转移，但卖方在此前几天就已经失去了对货物的控制。";
  fr["using FOB or CIF for a container that is handed to a carrier at a container yard inland. Risk passes when the goods are on board, but the seller lost control of them days earlier."] = "utiliser FOB ou CIF pour un conteneur remis à un transporteur dans un parc à conteneurs intérieur. Le risque passe au chargement à bord, mais le vendeur a perdu la maîtrise des marchandises plusieurs jours plus tôt.";
  zh["Under EXW the seller makes the goods available at its own premises and does almost nothing else: the buyer loads, clears the goods for export and arranges carriage. That looks simple for the seller, but it collides with how China exports in practice, because export declaration and VAT documentation are normally handled by the exporter."] = "在 EXW 下，卖方只在自己的场所把货物备好，其余几乎什么都不做：买方负责装货、办理出口报关并安排运输。对卖方看似简单，但与中国出口的实际操作冲突，因为出口报关和增值税单证通常由出口方办理。";
  fr["Under EXW the seller makes the goods available at its own premises and does almost nothing else: the buyer loads, clears the goods for export and arranges carriage. That looks simple for the seller, but it collides with how China exports in practice, because export declaration and VAT documentation are normally handled by the exporter."] = "En EXW, le vendeur met les marchandises à disposition dans ses propres locaux et ne fait presque rien d’autre : l’acheteur charge, dédouane à l’export et organise le transport. Cela paraît simple pour le vendeur, mais se heurte à la pratique chinoise, où la déclaration d’exportation et les documents de TVA sont normalement traités par l’exportateur.";
  zh["Under FCA the seller delivers the goods, cleared for export, to a carrier nominated by the buyer at a named place. When that place is the seller’s premises, the seller loads the vehicle; when it is another place, such as a freight forwarder’s warehouse, the seller delivers the goods ready for unloading."] = "在 FCA 下，卖方在指定地点把已办理出口报关的货物交给买方指定的承运人。若该地点是卖方场所，由卖方装车；若是其他地点，例如货代仓库，卖方只需把货物送到并处于可卸状态。";
  fr["Under FCA the seller delivers the goods, cleared for export, to a carrier nominated by the buyer at a named place. When that place is the seller’s premises, the seller loads the vehicle; when it is another place, such as a freight forwarder’s warehouse, the seller delivers the goods ready for unloading."] = "En FCA, le vendeur remet les marchandises, dédouanées à l’export, à un transporteur désigné par l’acheteur dans un lieu nommé. Si ce lieu est celui du vendeur, c’est lui qui charge le véhicule ; s’il s’agit d’un autre lieu, par exemple l’entrepôt d’un transitaire, le vendeur livre les marchandises prêtes à être déchargées.";
  zh["For most Chinese manufacturers FCA is the honest minimum term. It keeps export clearance where the paperwork and the tax refund already sit, and it stops the quotation from implying a service the factory cannot legally complete for a foreign buyer."] = "对多数中国制造商来说，FCA 是诚实的底线条款。它把出口报关留在单证和退税本来所在的一方，也避免报价暗示工厂能替海外买方完成一项它在法律上无法完成的服务。";
  fr["For most Chinese manufacturers FCA is the honest minimum term. It keeps export clearance where the paperwork and the tax refund already sit, and it stops the quotation from implying a service the factory cannot legally complete for a foreign buyer."] = "Pour la plupart des fabricants chinois, FCA est le minimum honnête. Il maintient le dédouanement à l’export là où se trouvent déjà les documents et le remboursement de TVA, et il évite qu’une offre laisse entendre un service que l’usine ne peut pas légalement rendre à un acheteur étranger.";
  zh["Under FOB the seller delivers the goods on board the vessel nominated by the buyer at the named port of shipment; risk passes at that moment. CFR moves the freight cost to the seller but not the risk: the seller pays carriage to the destination port while risk still passes when the goods are on board."] = "在 FOB 下，卖方在指定装运港把货物装上买方指定的船舶，风险在装船那一刻转移。CFR 把运费成本移给卖方，但不转移风险：卖方支付到目的港的运费，风险仍在装船时转移。";
  fr["Under FOB the seller delivers the goods on board the vessel nominated by the buyer at the named port of shipment; risk passes at that moment. CFR moves the freight cost to the seller but not the risk: the seller pays carriage to the destination port while risk still passes when the goods are on board."] = "En FOB, le vendeur livre les marchandises à bord du navire désigné par l’acheteur au port d’embarquement nommé ; le risque passe à cet instant. CFR transfère le coût du fret au vendeur, mais pas le risque : le vendeur paie le transport jusqu’au port de destination alors que le risque passe toujours au chargement.";
  zh["CIF adds insurance to CFR. Incoterms 2020 keeps Institute Cargo Clauses (C) as the default level of cover for CIF, which is narrower than many buyers assume, and the parties may agree a higher level. The point for a manufacturer is that the buyer’s protection comes from the document set and the insurance cover, not from a promise that the goods will arrive intact."] = "CIF 在 CFR 之上加了保险。Incoterms 2020 仍以《协会货物条款》（C）作为 CIF 的默认保险水平，其覆盖面比许多买方以为的要窄，双方可以约定更高的水平。对制造商而言要点是：买方的保障来自单据和保险，而不是货物完好抵达的承诺。";
  fr["CIF adds insurance to CFR. Incoterms 2020 keeps Institute Cargo Clauses (C) as the default level of cover for CIF, which is narrower than many buyers assume, and the parties may agree a higher level. The point for a manufacturer is that the buyer’s protection comes from the document set and the insurance cover, not from a promise that the goods will arrive intact."] = "CIF ajoute l’assurance au CFR. Les Incoterms 2020 conservent les Institute Cargo Clauses (C) comme niveau de couverture par défaut pour CIF, plus étroit que beaucoup d’acheteurs ne l’imaginent, et les parties peuvent convenir d’un niveau supérieur. Pour un fabricant, le point important est que la protection de l’acheteur vient des documents et de l’assurance, non d’une promesse d’arrivée intacte.";
  zh["These three rules reward precision in the quotation: port name, vessel or sailing window where relevant, and the exact scope of what the price includes."] = "这三条规则要求报价精确：写清港口名称、必要时写船名或船期，以及价格究竟包含哪些环节。";
  fr["These three rules reward precision in the quotation: port name, vessel or sailing window where relevant, and the exact scope of what the price includes."] = "Ces trois règles récompensent la précision de l’offre : nom du port, navire ou fenêtre de départ le cas échéant, et périmètre exact de ce que le prix couvre.";
  zh["DAP means the seller delivers the goods at the named place, ready for unloading, with import clearance and duties left to the buyer. DPU means the same journey plus unloading by the seller; it is the rule renamed from DAT in the 2020 edition."] = "DAP 指卖方在指定地点把货物交付、处于可卸状态，进口清关和关税由买方负责。DPU 是在同一行程上再由卖方卸货；它就是 2020 年版里由 DAT 改名而来的规则。";
  fr["DAP means the seller delivers the goods at the named place, ready for unloading, with import clearance and duties left to the buyer. DPU means the same journey plus unloading by the seller; it is the rule renamed from DAT in the 2020 edition."] = "DAP signifie que le vendeur livre les marchandises au lieu nommé, prêtes à être déchargées, le dédouanement à l’import et les droits restant à l’acheteur. DPU ajoute le déchargement par le vendeur ; c’est la règle renommée depuis DAT dans l’édition 2020.";
  zh["DDP puts import clearance, duties and taxes on the seller. It is the widest obligation in the set, and the one that most often goes wrong when a factory quotes it without a customs representative or a tax registration in the destination country. A DDP price that ignores import VAT is not a price, it is a future dispute."] = "DDP 把进口清关、关税和税费都放在卖方身上。这是整套规则里义务最宽的一条，也是工厂在没有目的国报关代理或税务登记的情况下最容易出问题的一条。忽略进口增值税的 DDP 价格不是价格，而是日后的一桩纠纷。";
  fr["DDP puts import clearance, duties and taxes on the seller. It is the widest obligation in the set, and the one that most often goes wrong when a factory quotes it without a customs representative or a tax registration in the destination country. A DDP price that ignores import VAT is not a price, it is a future dispute."] = "DDP met le dédouanement à l’import, les droits et les taxes à la charge du vendeur. C’est l’obligation la plus large de l’ensemble, et celle qui tourne le plus mal quand une usine la cite sans représentant en douane ni enregistrement fiscal dans le pays de destination. Un prix DDP qui ignore la TVA à l’import n’est pas un prix, c’est un litige à venir.";
  zh["A practical rule: choose the smallest obligation you can actually perform. Sellers who quote DDP “to be helpful” end up owning a customs problem in a country where they have no standing."] = "一条实用原则：选择你确实能履行的最小义务。为了“帮客户一个忙”而报 DDP 的卖方，最后会在一个自己没有任何资格的国家里承担一个清关问题。";
  fr["A practical rule: choose the smallest obligation you can actually perform. Sellers who quote DDP “to be helpful” end up owning a customs problem in a country where they have no standing."] = "Règle pratique : choisissez la plus petite obligation que vous pouvez réellement exécuter. Les vendeurs qui citent DDP « pour rendre service » finissent par assumer un problème douanier dans un pays où ils n’ont aucune qualité pour agir.";
  zh["The 2020 edition changed presentation and a few mechanics rather than the basic allocation of risk. Five changes matter to a manufacturer that quotes every week."] = "2020 年版改的是呈现方式和少量机制，而不是风险的基本分配。对每周都要报价的制造商来说，有五处变化值得注意。";
  fr["The 2020 edition changed presentation and a few mechanics rather than the basic allocation of risk. Five changes matter to a manufacturer that quotes every week."] = "L’édition 2020 a changé la présentation et quelques mécanismes, pas la répartition de base du risque. Cinq changements comptent pour un fabricant qui chiffre chaque semaine.";
  zh["DAT became DPU"] = "DAT 改为 DPU";
  fr["DAT became DPU"] = "DAT devient DPU";
  zh["and moved after DAP, to make the seller’s unloading obligation explicit and to allow any place of destination, not only a terminal."] = "，并移到 DAP 之后，使卖方的卸货义务更明确，同时允许任意目的地，而不再只限于码头。";
  fr["and moved after DAP, to make the seller’s unloading obligation explicit and to allow any place of destination, not only a terminal."] = ", et se place après DAP, pour rendre explicite l’obligation de déchargement du vendeur et permettre tout lieu de destination, et non plus seulement un terminal.";
  zh["FCA now allows an on-board bill of lading."] = "FCA 现在允许已装船提单。";
  fr["FCA now allows an on-board bill of lading."] = "La FCA autorise désormais un connaissement à bord.";
  zh["Where goods are sold FCA for sea carriage and a letter of credit requires an on-board bill, the parties may agree that the buyer instructs the carrier to issue one to the seller after loading."] = "当货物以 FCA 条件按海运出售、而信用证要求已装船提单时，双方可以约定由买方指示承运人在装船后向卖方签发提单。";
  fr["Where goods are sold FCA for sea carriage and a letter of credit requires an on-board bill, the parties may agree that the buyer instructs the carrier to issue one to the seller after loading."] = "Lorsque les marchandises sont vendues FCA pour un transport maritime et qu’une lettre de crédit exige un connaissement à bord, les parties peuvent convenir que l’acheteur demande au transporteur d’en émettre un au vendeur après le chargement.";
  zh["All costs sit together at A9/B9"] = "所有费用合并写在 A9/B9";
  fr["All costs sit together at A9/B9"] = "Tous les coûts figurent ensemble aux articles A9/B9";
  zh["of each rule, so the full cost list can be read at a glance instead of being assembled from several articles."] = "两条里，完整费用清单可以一次读完，不必从多个条款拼凑。";
  fr["of each rule, so the full cost list can be read at a glance instead of being assembled from several articles."] = " de chaque règle, ce qui permet de lire la liste complète d’un coup d’œil au lieu de la reconstituer à partir de plusieurs articles.";
  zh["Insurance levels are split."] = "保险水平被拆开规定。";
  fr["Insurance levels are split."] = "Les niveaux d’assurance sont séparés.";
  zh["CIF keeps Institute Cargo Clauses (C) as its default; CIP now requires cover at the Institute Cargo Clauses (A) level or equivalent."] = "CIF 仍以《协会货物条款》（C）为默认；CIP 现在要求达到《协会货物条款》（A）或同等水平的保险。";
  fr["CIF keeps Institute Cargo Clauses (C) as its default; CIP now requires cover at the Institute Cargo Clauses (A) level or equivalent."] = "CIF conserve les Institute Cargo Clauses (C) par défaut ; CIP exige désormais une couverture au niveau des Institute Cargo Clauses (A) ou équivalent.";
  zh["Security obligations are clearer"] = "安全相关义务更清晰";
  fr["Security obligations are clearer"] = "Les obligations de sûreté sont plus claires";
  zh["in articles A4 (carriage) and A7 (export and import clearance), with the related costs listed in the consolidated costs article."] = "体现在 A4（运输）和 A7（进出口清关）两条，相关费用列入合并后的费用条款。";
  fr["in articles A4 (carriage) and A7 (export and import clearance), with the related costs listed in the consolidated costs article."] = "aux articles A4 (transport) et A7 (dédouanement export et import), les coûts correspondants figurant à l’article consolidé sur les coûts.";
  zh["Overseas buyers ask about terms before they ask for a price, and a terms block on the quotation or product page removes one email round from every negotiation. State the rule, the named place and the port, for example “FCA Ningbo, Incoterms 2020”, and keep payment terms in a separate line."] = "海外买家在问价格之前先问条款，把条款块放在报价页或产品页上，每轮谈判就能少一封邮件。写清规则、指定地点和港口，例如“FCA Ningbo, Incoterms 2020”，并把付款条件单独列一行。";
  fr["Overseas buyers ask about terms before they ask for a price, and a terms block on the quotation or product page removes one email round from every negotiation. State the rule, the named place and the port, for example “FCA Ningbo, Incoterms 2020”, and keep payment terms in a separate line."] = "Les acheteurs étrangers posent la question des conditions avant celle du prix, et un bloc de conditions sur la page de devis ou de produit supprime un aller-retour par négociation. Indiquez la règle, le lieu nommé et le port, par exemple « FCA Ningbo, Incoterms 2020 », et gardez les conditions de paiement sur une ligne séparée.";
  zh["Two mistakes are common on Chinese manufacturer sites. The first is a table that presents CIF as door delivery, which leads the buyer to expect a service the term does not include. The second is a single “FOB China” line with no port, which makes freight quotes impossible to compare."] = "中国制造商网站上常见两个错误。第一是把 CIF 做成表格里的门到门服务，让买方期待这条规则并不包含的服务。第二是只写“FOB China”而不写港口，导致运费报价无法比较。";
  fr["Two mistakes are common on Chinese manufacturer sites. The first is a table that presents CIF as door delivery, which leads the buyer to expect a service the term does not include. The second is a single “FOB China” line with no port, which makes freight quotes impossible to compare."] = "Deux erreurs sont fréquentes sur les sites de fabricants chinois. La première est un tableau qui présente CIF comme une livraison à domicile, ce qui laisse l’acheteur attendre un service que la règle ne comprend pas. La seconde est une simple ligne « FOB China » sans port, qui rend les devis de fret incomparables.";
  zh["A short terms section also gives an answer engine something concrete to quote when a buyer asks what a supplier’s shipping terms are. That is worth more than another paragraph about company history."] = "一段简短的条款说明，还能在买方询问供应商运输条件时，给答案引擎一段可以直接引用的事实。这比再写一段公司历史更有价值。";
  fr["A short terms section also gives an answer engine something concrete to quote when a buyer asks what a supplier’s shipping terms are. That is worth more than another paragraph about company history."] = "Un court bloc de conditions donne aussi à un moteur de réponse un fait précis à citer quand un acheteur demande quelles sont les conditions d’expédition d’un fournisseur. Cela vaut plus qu’un paragraphe de plus sur l’histoire de l’entreprise.";
  zh["Pages that state terms, ports and lead times in the same place buyers look for specifications."] = "把条款、港口和交期写在买家查看规格的同一处。";
  fr["Pages that state terms, ports and lead times in the same place buyers look for specifications."] = "Des pages qui indiquent conditions, ports et délais au même endroit que les spécifications.";
  zh["Titles and internal links around the phrases buyers use when they compare suppliers."] = "围绕买家比较供应商时使用的说法，安排标题和内部链接。";
  fr["Titles and internal links around the phrases buyers use when they compare suppliers."] = "Des titres et des liens internes autour des expressions que les acheteurs utilisent pour comparer des fournisseurs.";
  zh["Landing pages for chosen product families in the markets where your orders are growing."] = "为订单正在增长的市场，选择合适的品类做落地页。";
  fr["Landing pages for chosen product families in the markets where your orders are growing."] = "Des pages d’atterrissage pour les familles de produits choisies, sur les marchés où vos commandes progressent.";
  zh["Posts that answer the commercial questions buyers ask before the first call."] = "用文章回答买家在第一次通话前提出的商务问题。";
  fr["Posts that answer the commercial questions buyers ask before the first call."] = "Des articles qui répondent aux questions commerciales posées avant le premier appel.";
  zh["Are Incoterms 2020 mandatory?"] = "Incoterms 2020 是强制性的吗？";
  fr["Are Incoterms 2020 mandatory?"] = "Les Incoterms 2020 sont-ils obligatoires ?";
  zh["No. They apply only when the sales contract incorporates them by reference, naming the edition and a place. Without that reference, the default rules of the applicable law decide delivery and risk."] = "不是。只有当销售合同明确引用、并写明版本和地点时才适用。没有这一引用，交货与风险按适用法律的默认规则处理。";
  fr["No. They apply only when the sales contract incorporates them by reference, naming the edition and a place. Without that reference, the default rules of the applicable law decide delivery and risk."] = "Non. Ils ne s’appliquent que si le contrat de vente les incorpore par référence, en nommant l’édition et un lieu. Sans cette référence, les règles supplétives de la loi applicable déterminent la livraison et le risque.";
  zh["What is the difference between CIF and CIP?"] = "CIF 和 CIP 有什么区别？";
  fr["What is the difference between CIF and CIP?"] = "Quelle différence entre CIF et CIP ?";
  zh["CIF applies only to sea and inland waterway carriage and defaults to Institute Cargo Clauses (C) cover. CIP applies to any mode of transport and requires cover at the Institute Cargo Clauses (A) level, which is broader."] = "CIF 只适用于海运和内河运输，默认《协会货物条款》（C）保险；CIP 适用于任何运输方式，并要求达到《协会货物条款》（A）水平的保险，覆盖面更宽。";
  fr["CIF applies only to sea and inland waterway carriage and defaults to Institute Cargo Clauses (C) cover. CIP applies to any mode of transport and requires cover at the Institute Cargo Clauses (A) level, which is broader."] = "CIF ne s’applique qu’au transport maritime et fluvial et prévoit par défaut une couverture Institute Cargo Clauses (C). CIP s’applique à tout mode de transport et exige une couverture au niveau (A), plus large.";
  zh["Can we quote FOB for a container shipment?"] = "集装箱货物可以报 FOB 吗？";
  fr["Can we quote FOB for a container shipment?"] = "Peut-on citer FOB pour un envoi en conteneur ?";
  zh["It is not advisable. FOB assumes the goods are handed over on board a vessel; a container is usually handed to a carrier at an inland terminal, so risk and control separate in a way the rule does not describe."] = "不建议。FOB 假定货物在船上交接；集装箱通常在内陆场站交给承运人，风险与控制权会以这条规则没有描述的方式分离。";
  fr["It is not advisable. FOB assumes the goods are handed over on board a vessel; a container is usually handed to a carrier at an inland terminal, so risk and control separate in a way the rule does not describe."] = "Ce n’est pas conseillé. FOB suppose une remise à bord d’un navire ; un conteneur est généralement remis à un transporteur dans un terminal intérieur, si bien que risque et maîtrise se séparent d’une manière que la règle ne décrit pas.";
  zh["Who pays import duty under DAP?"] = "DAP 下谁支付进口关税？";
  fr["Who pays import duty under DAP?"] = "Qui paie les droits de douane en DAP ?";
  zh["The buyer. Under DAP the seller delivers to the named place ready for unloading, and the buyer clears the goods for import and pays duties and taxes."] = "买方。DAP 下卖方把货物送到指定地点并处于可卸状态，买方负责进口清关并支付关税和税费。";
  fr["The buyer. Under DAP the seller delivers to the named place ready for unloading, and the buyer clears the goods for import and pays duties and taxes."] = "L’acheteur. En DAP, le vendeur livre au lieu nommé prêt à être déchargé, et l’acheteur dédouane à l’import et paie droits et taxes.";
  zh["Does DDP include VAT and import taxes?"] = "DDP 包含增值税和进口税吗？";
  fr["Does DDP include VAT and import taxes?"] = "Le DDP inclut-il la TVA et les taxes à l’import ?";
  zh["Yes. DDP places import clearance, duties and taxes on the seller, which is why a DDP price requires a customs representative or tax registration in the destination country."] = "包含。DDP 把进口清关、关税和税费都归于卖方，因此报 DDP 价格需要在目的国有报关代理或税务登记。";
  fr["Yes. DDP places import clearance, duties and taxes on the seller, which is why a DDP price requires a customs representative or tax registration in the destination country."] = "Oui. DDP place le dédouanement, les droits et les taxes à la charge du vendeur, d’où la nécessité d’un représentant en douane ou d’un enregistrement fiscal dans le pays de destination.";
  zh["Do Incoterms decide when the seller gets paid?"] = "Incoterms 决定卖方何时收款吗？";
  fr["Do Incoterms decide when the seller gets paid?"] = "Les Incoterms déterminent-ils le moment du paiement ?";
  zh["No. Payment terms are separate: a letter of credit, an advance payment or open account. An Incoterm only allocates carriage, cost and risk."] = "不决定。付款条件是另一套安排：信用证、预付款或赊账。Incoterm 只分配运输、费用和风险。";
  fr["No. Payment terms are separate: a letter of credit, an advance payment or open account. An Incoterm only allocates carriage, cost and risk."] = "Non. Les conditions de paiement sont distinctes : lettre de crédit, acompte ou compte ouvert. Un Incoterm ne répartit que le transport, les coûts et le risque.";
  zh["Incoterms 2020: the eleven rules and the key changes from 2010"] = "十一条规则与相较 2010 年版的主要变化";
  fr["Incoterms 2020: the eleven rules and the key changes from 2010"] = "Les onze règles et les principaux changements par rapport à 2010";
  zh["Diagram of the steps covered in this guide: 1. Pick the rule that matches how the goods travel; 2. Check who clears export and import; 3. Name the place, not just the country; 4. Keep payment terms outside the Incoterm; 5. Publish the terms buyers ask for."] = "本指南所讲步骤示意图：1. 选择与货物运输方式相符的规则；2. 确认由谁办理出口与进口清关；3. 写清地点，而不只是国家；4. 把付款条件放在 Incoterm 之外；5. 公布买方会问的条款。";
  fr["Diagram of the steps covered in this guide: 1. Pick the rule that matches how the goods travel; 2. Check who clears export and import; 3. Name the place, not just the country; 4. Keep payment terms outside the Incoterm; 5. Publish the terms buyers ask for."] = "Schéma des étapes de ce guide : 1. Choisir la règle adaptée au mode de transport ; 2. Vérifier qui dédouane à l’export et à l’import ; 3. Nommer le lieu, pas seulement le pays ; 4. Garder les conditions de paiement hors de l’Incoterm ; 5. Publier les conditions que les acheteurs demandent.";
  zh["CE Marking for Chinese Manufacturers: A Guide | Hurfi"] = "面向中国制造商的 CE 标志指南 | Hurfi";
  fr["CE Marking for Chinese Manufacturers: A Guide | Hurfi"] = "Le marquage CE pour les fabricants chinois : guide | Hurfi";
  zh["CE marking for Chinese manufacturers"] = "中国制造商需要了解的 CE 标志";
  fr["CE marking for Chinese manufacturers"] = "Le marquage CE pour les fabricants chinois";
  zh["CE marking is the manufacturer’s own declaration that a product meets the EU harmonisation legislation that applies to it. It is not an EU approval, it is not a quality grade, and it is compulsory only for products covered by those rules. This guide explains what a Chinese manufacturer has to produce, who signs it, and when a notified body is involved."] = "CE 标志是制造商自己的声明：产品符合适用于它的欧盟协调法规。它不是欧盟的批准，也不是质量等级，并且只对属于这些法规范围内的产品才是强制的。本文说明中国制造商需要准备哪些文件、由谁签署，以及什么情况下需要公告机构介入。";
  fr["CE marking is the manufacturer’s own declaration that a product meets the EU harmonisation legislation that applies to it. It is not an EU approval, it is not a quality grade, and it is compulsory only for products covered by those rules. This guide explains what a Chinese manufacturer has to produce, who signs it, and when a notified body is involved."] = "Le marquage CE est la déclaration du fabricant lui-même : le produit est conforme à la législation d’harmonisation de l’UE qui lui s’applique. Ce n’est ni une approbation de l’UE, ni un label de qualité, et il n’est obligatoire que pour les produits couverts par ces règles. Ce guide explique ce qu’un fabricant chinois doit produire, qui le signe et quand un organisme notifié intervient.";
  zh["What the CE mark means, and what it does not"] = "CE 标志意味着什么，不意味着什么";
  fr["What the CE mark means, and what it does not"] = "Ce que le marquage CE signifie, et ce qu’il ne signifie pas";
  zh["Which products need CE marking"] = "哪些产品需要 CE 标志";
  fr["Which products need CE marking"] = "Quels produits doivent porter le marquage CE";
  zh["Who is responsible for compliance"] = "谁负责合规";
  fr["Who is responsible for compliance"] = "Qui est responsable de la conformité";
  zh["The technical file and the EU declaration of conformity"] = "技术文件与欧盟符合性声明";
  fr["The technical file and the EU declaration of conformity"] = "Le dossier technique et la déclaration UE de conformité";
  zh["When a notified body is needed"] = "什么时候需要公告机构";
  fr["When a notified body is needed"] = "Quand un organisme notifié est nécessaire";
  zh["The machinery transition: directive now, regulation from 2027"] = "机械领域的过渡：现在用指令，2027 年起用法规";
  fr["The machinery transition: directive now, regulation from 2027"] = "La transition des machines : directive aujourd’hui, règlement à partir de 2027";
  zh["Voluntary certificates that carry no legal weight"] = "没有法律效力的自愿性证书";
  fr["Voluntary certificates that carry no legal weight"] = "Les certificats volontaires sans valeur juridique";
  zh["What to publish on the website so buyers can check"] = "网站上应该公布什么，方便买家核查";
  fr["What to publish on the website so buyers can check"] = "Ce qu’il faut publier sur le site pour que les acheteurs vérifient";
  zh["The letters “CE” on a product sold in the European Economic Area signify that the product has been assessed against the EU rules on safety, health and environmental protection that apply to it. By affixing the mark, the manufacturer declares that the product meets all the legal requirements for CE marking and may be sold throughout the EEA."] = "在欧洲经济区销售的产品上标注“CE”字样，表示该产品已按适用于它的欧盟安全、健康与环境保护规则接受评估。制造商加贴标志，即声明产品满足 CE 标志的全部法律要求，可以在整个欧洲经济区内销售。";
  fr["The letters “CE” on a product sold in the European Economic Area signify that the product has been assessed against the EU rules on safety, health and environmental protection that apply to it. By affixing the mark, the manufacturer declares that the product meets all the legal requirements for CE marking and may be sold throughout the EEA."] = "Les lettres « CE » sur un produit vendu dans l’Espace économique européen signifient que le produit a été évalué au regard des règles de l’UE en matière de sécurité, de santé et d’environnement qui lui s’appliquent. En apposant la marque, le fabricant déclare que le produit satisfait à toutes les exigences légales du marquage CE et peut être vendu dans tout l’EEE.";
  zh["The European Commission is explicit about the limits. CE marking is not an approval issued by the EU or by any authority, it does not indicate that a product has been approved as safe, and it does not indicate the product’s origin. It is a declaration of conformity made by the party that places the product on the market."] = "欧盟委员会对界限说得很明确：CE 标志不是欧盟或任何机构颁发的批准，不代表产品已被认定安全，也不表示产品的原产地。它是把产品投放市场的一方所作的符合性声明。";
  fr["The European Commission is explicit about the limits. CE marking is not an approval issued by the EU or by any authority, it does not indicate that a product has been approved as safe, and it does not indicate the product’s origin. It is a declaration of conformity made by the party that places the product on the market."] = "La Commission européenne est explicite sur les limites. Le marquage CE n’est pas une approbation délivrée par l’UE ou par une autorité, il n’indique pas qu’un produit a été reconnu sûr et il n’indique pas l’origine du produit. C’est une déclaration de conformité faite par la partie qui met le produit sur le marché.";
  zh["CE marking is compulsory only for products covered by the EU harmonisation legislation that requires it, and it is forbidden on products outside that scope. A factory that adds the mark to an uncovered product is not being cautious; it is making a false declaration."] = "CE 标志只对属于欧盟协调法规范围、且该法规要求加贴的产品才是强制的；对范围之外的产品则禁止加贴。给不在范围内的产品加贴标志，不是谨慎，而是作出虚假声明。";
  fr["CE marking is compulsory only for products covered by the EU harmonisation legislation that requires it, and it is forbidden on products outside that scope. A factory that adds the mark to an uncovered product is not being cautious; it is making a false declaration."] = "Le marquage CE n’est obligatoire que pour les produits couverts par la législation d’harmonisation de l’UE qui l’exige, et il est interdit sur les produits hors de ce champ. Une usine qui appose la marque sur un produit non couvert ne fait pas preuve de prudence : elle fait une fausse déclaration.";
  zh["In practice the scope is set by the legislation for the product family, not by the product’s name. Electrical equipment, machinery, radio equipment, medical devices, personal protective equipment, toys, pressure equipment and construction products each sit under different rules with different assessment routes."] = "实践中，范围由针对产品族群的法规决定，而不是由产品名称决定。电气设备、机械、无线电设备、医疗器械、个人防护装备、玩具、压力设备和建筑产品，各自适用不同的规则和不同的评估路径。";
  fr["In practice the scope is set by the legislation for the product family, not by the product’s name. Electrical equipment, machinery, radio equipment, medical devices, personal protective equipment, toys, pressure equipment and construction products each sit under different rules with different assessment routes."] = "En pratique, le champ est fixé par la législation propre à la famille de produits, pas par le nom du produit. Équipements électriques, machines, équipements radio, dispositifs médicaux, équipements de protection individuelle, jouets, équipements sous pression et produits de construction relèvent chacun de règles et de procédures d’évaluation différentes.";
  zh["The manufacturer carries the core duties: carry out the conformity assessment, set up the technical file, issue the EU declaration of conformity and affix the CE marking. For an exporter in China, “manufacturer” means the party that designs and produces the goods, whether or not it is established in the EU."] = "制造商承担核心义务：完成符合性评估、建立技术文件、签发欧盟符合性声明并加贴 CE 标志。对中国出口企业来说，“制造商”指设计和生产该产品的一方，无论是否在欧盟境内设立。";
  fr["The manufacturer carries the core duties: carry out the conformity assessment, set up the technical file, issue the EU declaration of conformity and affix the CE marking. For an exporter in China, “manufacturer” means the party that designs and produces the goods, whether or not it is established in the EU."] = "Le fabricant porte les obligations essentielles : réaliser l’évaluation de la conformité, constituer le dossier technique, établir la déclaration UE de conformité et apposer le marquage CE. Pour un exportateur en Chine, le « fabricant » est la partie qui conçoit et produit les marchandises, qu’elle soit ou non établie dans l’UE.";
  zh["Importers and distributors have their own obligations. They must place only compliant products on the EEA market, keep the documentation available, and add their name and contact details where the legislation requires it. A European customer asking for your declaration is not being difficult; that customer is being asked to prove compliance by its own market surveillance authority."] = "进口商和分销商也有自己的义务：只能把合规产品投放欧洲经济区市场、保持文件可提供，并在法规要求时标注自己的名称和联系方式。欧洲客户索要你的声明，不是故意刁难；是其本国的市场监管机构要求它证明合规。";
  fr["Importers and distributors have their own obligations. They must place only compliant products on the EEA market, keep the documentation available, and add their name and contact details where the legislation requires it. A European customer asking for your declaration is not being difficult; that customer is being asked to prove compliance by its own market surveillance authority."] = "Les importateurs et les distributeurs ont leurs propres obligations. Ils ne doivent mettre sur le marché de l’EEE que des produits conformes, tenir la documentation à disposition et ajouter leur nom et leurs coordonnées lorsque la législation l’exige. Un client européen qui demande votre déclaration n’est pas difficile : son autorité de surveillance du marché lui demande de prouver la conformité.";
  zh["The technical file is the evidence behind the mark: drawings, specifications, risk assessment, test reports, the standards applied and the assessment records. Most harmonisation legislation requires the manufacturer to keep it available for a period after the product is placed on the market, typically ten years."] = "技术文件是标志背后的证据：图纸、规格、风险评估、测试报告、所采用的标准和评估记录。多数协调法规要求制造商在产品投放市场后的一段时间内保持文件可提供，通常是十年。";
  fr["The technical file is the evidence behind the mark: drawings, specifications, risk assessment, test reports, the standards applied and the assessment records. Most harmonisation legislation requires the manufacturer to keep it available for a period after the product is placed on the market, typically ten years."] = "Le dossier technique est la preuve qui sous-tend la marque : plans, spécifications, analyse des risques, rapports d’essai, normes appliquées et enregistrements de l’évaluation. La plupart des législations d’harmonisation imposent au fabricant de le tenir à disposition pendant une durée après la mise sur le marché, généralement dix ans.";
  zh["The EU declaration of conformity is the signed document that lists the product, the manufacturer, the legislation applied, the harmonised standards used and, where relevant, the notified body. It is the document a buyer, a customs officer or a market surveillance authority asks for first, and it is the one document a factory should be able to send within a day."] = "欧盟符合性声明是签署的文件，列明产品、制造商、所适用的法规、采用的协调标准，以及（如适用）公告机构。它是买家、海关或市场监管机构最先索要的文件，也是工厂应当能在一天内发出的文件。";
  fr["The EU declaration of conformity is the signed document that lists the product, the manufacturer, the legislation applied, the harmonised standards used and, where relevant, the notified body. It is the document a buyer, a customs officer or a market surveillance authority asks for first, and it is the one document a factory should be able to send within a day."] = "La déclaration UE de conformité est le document signé qui indique le produit, le fabricant, la législation appliquée, les normes harmonisées utilisées et, le cas échéant, l’organisme notifié. C’est le document qu’un acheteur, un agent des douanes ou une autorité de surveillance demande en premier, et celui qu’une usine doit pouvoir envoyer en une journée.";
  zh["A common gap on manufacturer websites is a wall of certificate images with no declaration and no directive numbers. Buyers who know the rules read the declaration, because it names the legislation and the standards; a certificate image without that context proves very little."] = "制造商网站上常见的缺口，是一堆证书图片，却没有声明、没有指令编号。懂规则的买家看的是声明，因为声明写明法规和标准；缺少这些背景的证书图片，证明力很有限。";
  fr["A common gap on manufacturer websites is a wall of certificate images with no declaration and no directive numbers. Buyers who know the rules read the declaration, because it names the legislation and the standards; a certificate image without that context proves very little."] = "Un manque fréquent sur les sites de fabricants est un mur d’images de certificats, sans déclaration ni numéros de directive. Les acheteurs qui connaissent les règles lisent la déclaration, parce qu’elle nomme la législation et les normes ; une image de certificat sans ce contexte prouve très peu.";
  zh["For many products the manufacturer can complete the assessment itself, through internal production control and the applicable harmonised standards. For others the legislation requires a notified body, or gives a choice between routes, for example with higher-risk machinery or certain medical devices."] = "许多产品可以由制造商自行完成评估，通过内部控制生产和适用的协调标准。另一些产品，法规要求公告机构介入，或在几条路径之间选择，例如风险较高的机械或某些医疗器械。";
  fr["For many products the manufacturer can complete the assessment itself, through internal production control and the applicable harmonised standards. For others the legislation requires a notified body, or gives a choice between routes, for example with higher-risk machinery or certain medical devices."] = "Pour de nombreux produits, le fabricant peut réaliser lui-même l’évaluation, par le contrôle interne de la production et les normes harmonisées applicables. Pour d’autres, la législation impose un organisme notifié ou laisse le choix entre plusieurs voies, par exemple pour les machines à risque élevé ou certains dispositifs médicaux.";
  zh["A notified body is designated by an EU country for a defined scope, and its four-digit identification number appears next to the CE mark when the legislation requires third-party involvement. A body outside that scope cannot certify the product, whatever the certificate says."] = "公告机构由欧盟成员国指定，范围有明确界定；法规要求第三方介入时，其四位识别号会与 CE 标志一同标注。超出该范围的机构无法为该产品认证，无论证书上怎么写。";
  fr["A notified body is designated by an EU country for a defined scope, and its four-digit identification number appears next to the CE mark when the legislation requires third-party involvement. A body outside that scope cannot certify the product, whatever the certificate says."] = "Un organisme notifié est désigné par un État membre de l’UE pour un champ défini, et son numéro d’identification à quatre chiffres figure à côté du marquage CE lorsque la législation exige l’intervention d’un tiers. Un organisme hors de ce champ ne peut pas certifier le produit, quoi qu’indique le certificat.";
  zh["Machinery is the sector where the rules are changing soonest. The current text is the Machinery Directive 2006/42/EC. The Machinery Regulation (EU) 2023/1230 was adopted on 14 June 2023 and applies on a mandatory basis from 20 January 2027."] = "机械是规则变化最快的领域。现行文本是机械指令 2006/42/EC。机械法规 (EU) 2023/1230 于 2023 年 6 月 14 日通过，自 2027 年 1 月 20 日起强制适用。";
  fr["Machinery is the sector where the rules are changing soonest. The current text is the Machinery Directive 2006/42/EC. The Machinery Regulation (EU) 2023/1230 was adopted on 14 June 2023 and applies on a mandatory basis from 20 January 2027."] = "Les machines sont le secteur où les règles changent le plus tôt. Le texte en vigueur est la directive Machines 2006/42/CE. Le règlement Machines (UE) 2023/1230 a été adopté le 14 juin 2023 et s’applique à titre obligatoire à partir du 20 janvier 2027.";
  zh["The regulation keeps the essential health and safety requirements and voluntary harmonised standards, and adds provisions for machinery with AI-powered safety functions, cyber-safety for compliance-relevant software, and conformity assessment for higher-risk machinery. Machinery placed on the EU market before 20 January 2027 must comply with the directive."] = "该法规保留了基本健康与安全要求和自愿性协调标准，并新增了针对带 AI 安全功能机械的条款、与合规相关软件的网络安全要求，以及高风险机械的符合性评估。2027 年 1 月 20 日之前投放欧盟市场的机械，仍须符合指令。";
  fr["The regulation keeps the essential health and safety requirements and voluntary harmonised standards, and adds provisions for machinery with AI-powered safety functions, cyber-safety for compliance-relevant software, and conformity assessment for higher-risk machinery. Machinery placed on the EU market before 20 January 2027 must comply with the directive."] = "Le règlement conserve les exigences essentielles de santé et de sécurité et les normes harmonisées d’application volontaire, et ajoute des dispositions pour les machines dotées de fonctions de sécurité fondées sur l’IA, la cybersécurité des logiciels pertinents pour la conformité et l’évaluation de la conformité des machines à risque élevé. Les machines mises sur le marché de l’UE avant le 20 janvier 2027 doivent être conformes à la directive.";
  zh["For a Chinese machinery maker, that date belongs in the sales conversation and on the website: buyers are already asking which text a machine is declared against."] = "对中国机械制造商来说，这个日期既属于销售对话，也属于网站内容：买家已经在问这台机器是按哪部文本声明的。";
  fr["For a Chinese machinery maker, that date belongs in the sales conversation and on the website: buyers are already asking which text a machine is declared against."] = "Pour un fabricant chinois de machines, cette date appartient à la conversation commerciale et au site : les acheteurs demandent déjà sous quel texte une machine est déclarée.";
  zh["The European Commission warns about certificates issued by bodies acting outside their notified status. Under EU law, voluntary or additional certificates are not a recognised means to prove compliance and carry no value in checks by market surveillance authorities or customs."] = "欧盟委员会对由不具备公告资格的机构签发的证书提出了警告。按欧盟法律，自愿性或附加性证书不是证明合规的认可方式，在市场监管机构或海关的检查中没有价值。";
  fr["The European Commission warns about certificates issued by bodies acting outside their notified status. Under EU law, voluntary or additional certificates are not a recognised means to prove compliance and carry no value in checks by market surveillance authorities or customs."] = "La Commission européenne met en garde contre les certificats délivrés par des organismes agissant hors de leur statut d’organisme notifié. En droit de l’UE, les certificats volontaires ou supplémentaires ne sont pas un moyen reconnu de prouver la conformité et n’ont aucune valeur lors des contrôles des autorités de surveillance du marché ou des douanes.";
  zh["CE marking can only be affixed after testing and the conformity assessment procedure that the applicable legislation prescribes, and a certificate must not itself bear the CE mark. A supplier that offers a “CE certificate” as the whole answer is describing a document that does not exist in EU law: the instruments are the declaration of conformity and the technical file."] = "CE 标志只能在完成测试和适用法规规定的符合性评估程序之后加贴，证书本身也不得带有 CE 标志。把“CE 证书”当作全部答案的供应商，描述的是一份在欧盟法律中并不存在的文件：真正的文书是符合性声明和技术文件。";
  fr["CE marking can only be affixed after testing and the conformity assessment procedure that the applicable legislation prescribes, and a certificate must not itself bear the CE mark. A supplier that offers a “CE certificate” as the whole answer is describing a document that does not exist in EU law: the instruments are the declaration of conformity and the technical file."] = "Le marquage CE ne peut être apposé qu’après les essais et la procédure d’évaluation de la conformité prescrite par la législation applicable, et un certificat ne doit pas lui-même porter le marquage CE. Un fournisseur qui propose un « certificat CE » comme réponse complète décrit un document qui n’existe pas en droit de l’UE : les instruments sont la déclaration de conformité et le dossier technique.";
  zh["The commercial consequence is simple. A buyer who receives a voluntary certificate instead of a declaration learns that the supplier does not know the rules, and moves to the next quotation."] = "商业后果很简单。买家收到的是自愿性证书而不是声明，就会知道这家供应商不了解规则，然后转向下一份报价。";
  fr["The commercial consequence is simple. A buyer who receives a voluntary certificate instead of a declaration learns that the supplier does not know the rules, and moves to the next quotation."] = "La conséquence commerciale est simple. Un acheteur qui reçoit un certificat volontaire au lieu d’une déclaration comprend que le fournisseur ne connaît pas les règles, et passe au devis suivant.";
  zh["Buyers check compliance before they check price. A compliance page that names the legislation for each product family, states the assessment route, lists the harmonised standards applied and offers the declaration of conformity on request removes a real objection."] = "买家先查合规，再谈价格。一个合规页面，如果能按产品族群写明适用法规、说明评估路径、列出采用的协调标准，并承诺按需提供符合性声明，就能消除一个真实的顾虑。";
  fr["Buyers check compliance before they check price. A compliance page that names the legislation for each product family, states the assessment route, lists the harmonised standards applied and offers the declaration of conformity on request removes a real objection."] = "Les acheteurs vérifient la conformité avant de vérifier le prix. Une page de conformité qui nomme la législation par famille de produits, indique la voie d’évaluation, liste les normes harmonisées appliquées et propose la déclaration de conformité sur demande lève une objection réelle.";
  zh["Three details make that page credible: the exact directive or regulation number, the notified body number where one is involved, and the date the declaration was signed. A fourth helps search: describe the product family in the words buyers use, such as “CE marking for industrial machinery” or “EMC and LVD compliance for control panels”, rather than a generic “certificates” heading."] = "三个细节让这个页面可信：准确的指令或法规编号、涉及公告机构时的机构编号，以及声明的签署日期。第四个细节有利于搜索：用买家使用的说法描述产品族群，例如“工业机械 CE 标志”或“控制柜 EMC 与 LVD 合规”，而不是笼统的“证书”标题。";
  fr["Three details make that page credible: the exact directive or regulation number, the notified body number where one is involved, and the date the declaration was signed. A fourth helps search: describe the product family in the words buyers use, such as “CE marking for industrial machinery” or “EMC and LVD compliance for control panels”, rather than a generic “certificates” heading."] = "Trois détails rendent cette page crédible : le numéro exact de la directive ou du règlement, le numéro de l’organisme notifié lorsqu’il intervient, et la date de signature de la déclaration. Un quatrième aide la recherche : décrire la famille de produits avec les mots des acheteurs, par exemple « marquage CE pour machines industrielles » ou « conformité EMC et LVD pour armoires de commande », plutôt qu’un titre générique « certificats ».";
  zh["Compliance content is also one of the few places where a manufacturer can answer an AI assistant’s question with a named legal instrument. That is the difference between being summarised as a supplier and being cited as a source."] = "合规内容也是制造商能用一部具名法律文书回答 AI 助手提问的少数场景之一。这决定了你被概括为一家供应商，还是被引用为一个来源。";
  fr["Compliance content is also one of the few places where a manufacturer can answer an AI assistant’s question with a named legal instrument. That is the difference between being summarised as a supplier and being cited as a source."] = "Le contenu de conformité est aussi l’un des rares endroits où un fabricant peut répondre à la question d’un assistant IA par un instrument juridique nommé. C’est la différence entre être résumé comme fournisseur et être cité comme source.";
  zh["Compliance pages that name the directive, the standards and the declaration, in the wording buyers search."] = "合规页面：按买家搜索的说法，写清指令、标准和声明。";
  fr["Compliance pages that name the directive, the standards and the declaration, in the wording buyers search."] = "Des pages de conformité qui nomment la directive, les normes et la déclaration, dans les mots que les acheteurs recherchent.";
  zh["Titles, headings and internal links that connect certificates to the products they cover."] = "标题、小标题和内部链接，把证书与它所覆盖的产品连起来。";
  fr["Titles, headings and internal links that connect certificates to the products they cover."] = "Des titres, des intertitres et des liens internes qui relient les certificats aux produits qu’ils couvrent.";
  zh["Landing pages for the product families where compliance is the buying objection."] = "为“合规就是购买障碍”的那些产品族群做落地页。";
  fr["Landing pages for the product families where compliance is the buying objection."] = "Des pages d’atterrissage pour les familles de produits où la conformité est l’objection d’achat.";
  zh["Posts that explain a certification change before a buyer asks about it."] = "在买家发问之前，先解释认证变化的文章。";
  fr["Posts that explain a certification change before a buyer asks about it."] = "Des articles qui expliquent un changement de certification avant que l’acheteur ne le demande.";
  zh["Is CE marking a quality mark?"] = "CE 标志是质量标志吗？";
  fr["Is CE marking a quality mark?"] = "Le marquage CE est-il un label de qualité ?";
  zh["No. CE marking declares conformity with the EU legislation that applies to the product. It is not an EU approval, not a safety certificate issued by an authority, and not an indication of origin."] = "不是。CE 标志声明产品符合适用于它的欧盟法规。它不是欧盟批准，不是机构颁发的安全证书，也不表示原产地。";
  fr["No. CE marking declares conformity with the EU legislation that applies to the product. It is not an EU approval, not a safety certificate issued by an authority, and not an indication of origin."] = "Non. Le marquage CE déclare la conformité à la législation de l’UE applicable au produit. Ce n’est pas une approbation de l’UE, ni un certificat de sécurité délivré par une autorité, ni une indication d’origine.";
  zh["Can a Chinese manufacturer self-certify?"] = "中国制造商可以自我声明吗？";
  fr["Can a Chinese manufacturer self-certify?"] = "Un fabricant chinois peut-il s’autocertifier ?";
  zh["For many product families, yes: the manufacturer completes the conformity assessment, builds the technical file and signs the EU declaration of conformity. Where the legislation requires a notified body, self-declaration is not enough."] = "许多产品族群可以：制造商完成符合性评估、建立技术文件并签署欧盟符合性声明。凡法规要求公告机构介入的，自我声明不够。";
  fr["For many product families, yes: the manufacturer completes the conformity assessment, builds the technical file and signs the EU declaration of conformity. Where the legislation requires a notified body, self-declaration is not enough."] = "Pour de nombreuses familles de produits, oui : le fabricant réalise l’évaluation de la conformité, constitue le dossier technique et signe la déclaration UE de conformité. Lorsque la législation impose un organisme notifié, l’autodéclaration ne suffit pas.";
  zh["Which directive applies to my product?"] = "我的产品适用哪部指令？";
  fr["Which directive applies to my product?"] = "Quelle directive s’applique à mon produit ?";
  zh["The one that covers the product family: for example 2006/42/EC for machinery until 20 January 2027, 2014/30/EU for electromagnetic compatibility, 2014/35/EU for low voltage equipment and 2014/53/EU for radio equipment. A product can fall under more than one."] = "适用覆盖该产品族群的那一部：例如机械在 2027 年 1 月 20 日之前适用 2006/42/EC，电磁兼容适用 2014/30/EU，低压设备适用 2014/35/EU，无线电设备适用 2014/53/EU。一个产品可能同时属于多部法规。";
  fr["The one that covers the product family: for example 2006/42/EC for machinery until 20 January 2027, 2014/30/EU for electromagnetic compatibility, 2014/35/EU for low voltage equipment and 2014/53/EU for radio equipment. A product can fall under more than one."] = "Celle qui couvre la famille de produits : par exemple 2006/42/CE pour les machines jusqu’au 20 janvier 2027, 2014/30/UE pour la compatibilité électromagnétique, 2014/35/UE pour les équipements basse tension et 2014/53/UE pour les équipements radio. Un produit peut relever de plusieurs textes.";
  zh["What is the difference between a CE certificate and a declaration of conformity?"] = "CE 证书和符合性声明有什么区别？";
  fr["What is the difference between a CE certificate and a declaration of conformity?"] = "Quelle différence entre un certificat CE et une déclaration de conformité ?";
  zh["There is no general “CE certificate” in EU law. The binding documents are the EU declaration of conformity, signed by the manufacturer, and the technical file that supports it. Certificates from non-notified bodies do not prove compliance."] = "欧盟法律中没有通用的“CE 证书”。有约束力的文件是制造商签署的欧盟符合性声明，以及支撑它的技术文件。非公告机构签发的证书不能证明合规。";
  fr["There is no general “CE certificate” in EU law. The binding documents are the EU declaration of conformity, signed by the manufacturer, and the technical file that supports it. Certificates from non-notified bodies do not prove compliance."] = "Il n’existe pas de « certificat CE » général en droit de l’UE. Les documents opposables sont la déclaration UE de conformité, signée par le fabricant, et le dossier technique qui la soutient. Les certificats d’organismes non notifiés ne prouvent pas la conformité.";
  zh["How long must the technical file be kept?"] = "技术文件要保存多久？";
  fr["How long must the technical file be kept?"] = "Combien de temps conserver le dossier technique ?";
  zh["Most harmonisation legislation requires the manufacturer to keep the technical file and the declaration available for about ten years after the product is placed on the market. The exact period is set by the legislation for that product family."] = "多数协调法规要求制造商在产品投放市场后约十年内保持技术文件和声明可提供。准确期限由该产品族群对应的法规规定。";
  fr["Most harmonisation legislation requires the manufacturer to keep the technical file and the declaration available for about ten years after the product is placed on the market. The exact period is set by the legislation for that product family."] = "La plupart des législations d’harmonisation imposent de tenir le dossier technique et la déclaration à disposition pendant environ dix ans après la mise sur le marché. La durée exacte est fixée par la législation de la famille de produits.";
  zh["European Commission, DG Internal Market, Industry, Entrepreneurship and SMEs."] = "欧盟委员会，内部市场、工业、创业与中小企业总司。";
  fr["European Commission, DG Internal Market, Industry, Entrepreneurship and SMEs."] = "Commission européenne, DG Marché intérieur, industrie, entrepreneuriat et PME.";
  zh["CE marking: what it signifies, who is responsible, what it does not mean"] = "CE 标志：它表示什么、由谁负责、不表示什么";
  fr["CE marking: what it signifies, who is responsible, what it does not mean"] = "Le marquage CE : ce qu’il signifie, qui en est responsable, ce qu’il ne signifie pas";
  zh["Machinery: Directive 2006/42/EC, Regulation (EU) 2023/1230 and its 20 January 2027 application date"] = "机械：指令 2006/42/EC、法规 (EU) 2023/1230 及其 2027 年 1 月 20 日适用日期";
  fr["Machinery: Directive 2006/42/EC, Regulation (EU) 2023/1230 and its 20 January 2027 application date"] = "Machines : directive 2006/42/CE, règlement (UE) 2023/1230 et sa date d’application du 20 janvier 2027";
  zh["Diagram of the steps covered in this guide: 1. Identify the legislation that covers the product; 2. Run the conformity assessment the legislation sets; 3. Build the technical file; 4. Sign the EU declaration of conformity; 5. Affix the mark correctly; 6. Publish the evidence buyers ask for."] = "本指南所讲步骤示意图：1. 确认覆盖该产品的法规；2. 执行法规规定的符合性评估；3. 建立技术文件；4. 签署欧盟符合性声明；5. 正确加贴标志；6. 公布买家会索要的证据。";
  fr["Diagram of the steps covered in this guide: 1. Identify the legislation that covers the product; 2. Run the conformity assessment the legislation sets; 3. Build the technical file; 4. Sign the EU declaration of conformity; 5. Affix the mark correctly; 6. Publish the evidence buyers ask for."] = "Schéma des étapes de ce guide : 1. Identifier la législation qui couvre le produit ; 2. Appliquer l’évaluation de conformité prévue ; 3. Constituer le dossier technique ; 4. Signer la déclaration UE de conformité ; 5. Apposer correctement la marque ; 6. Publier les preuves que les acheteurs demandent.";
  zh["The eleven rules, who pays each cost, where risk passes, and which terms a Chinese manufacturer should quote."] = "十一条规则、各项费用由谁承担、风险在哪里转移，以及中国制造商应该报哪几条。";
  fr["The eleven rules, who pays each cost, where risk passes, and which terms a Chinese manufacturer should quote."] = "Les onze règles, qui paie chaque coût, où passe le risque, et quelles conditions un fabricant chinois devrait citer.";
  zh["What CE marking requires, who signs the declaration, when a notified body is needed and which certificates mean nothing."] = "CE 标志要求什么、由谁签署声明、何时需要公告机构，以及哪些证书毫无意义。";
  fr["What CE marking requires, who signs the declaration, when a notified body is needed and which certificates mean nothing."] = "Ce que le marquage CE exige, qui signe la déclaration, quand un organisme notifié est nécessaire et quels certificats ne valent rien.";
  zh["第 1 个月：盘点技术与内容现状，在您自己的 Search Console 和统计账户里建立基线。"] = "第 1 个月：盘点技术与内容现状，在您自己的 Search Console 和统计账户里建立基线。";
  fr["第 1 个月：盘点技术与内容现状，在您自己的 Search Console 和统计账户里建立基线。"] = "Mois 1 : état des lieux technique et éditorial, avec une base de référence dans votre propre Search Console et votre outil de statistiques.";
  zh["可以。我们先看您 Search Console 里的数据和 3–5 个核心产品页，再告诉您哪些问题值得先修、哪些可以放到后面。诊断之后是否合作，由您决定。"] = "可以。我们先看您 Search Console 里的数据和 3–5 个核心产品页，再告诉您哪些问题值得先修、哪些可以放到后面。诊断之后是否合作，由您决定。";
  fr["可以。我们先看您 Search Console 里的数据和 3–5 个核心产品页，再告诉您哪些问题值得先修、哪些可以放到后面。诊断之后是否合作，由您决定。"] = "Oui. Nous regardons d’abord les données de votre Search Console et 3 à 5 pages produits clés, puis nous vous indiquons les problèmes à traiter en priorité et ceux qui peuvent attendre. Après le diagnostic, la décision de collaborer vous appartient.";
  zh["Mining & Mineral Processing Equipment: Websites and SEO | Hurfi"] = "矿山与选矿设备：网站与 SEO | Hurfi";
  fr["Mining & Mineral Processing Equipment: Websites and SEO | Hurfi"] = "Équipements miniers et de traitement des minéraux : sites et SEO | Hurfi";
  zh["Mine operators and EPC contractors abroad buy equipment on proven performance, uptime and support in remote locations. Hurfi helps Chinese crushing, screening, grinding and mining-machinery manufacturers present that evidence in English and reach buyers in mining countries."] = "海外的矿山运营方和 EPC 承包商采购设备，看的是经过验证的性能、可用率，以及在偏远地区的服务能力。Hurfi 帮助中国的破碎、筛分、磨矿和矿山机械制造商用英文呈现这些证据，并触达矿业国家的买家。";
  fr["Mine operators and EPC contractors abroad buy equipment on proven performance, uptime and support in remote locations. Hurfi helps Chinese crushing, screening, grinding and mining-machinery manufacturers present that evidence in English and reach buyers in mining countries."] = "Les exploitants de mines et les entreprises EPC à l’étranger achètent des équipements sur la base de performances prouvées, de la disponibilité et du service sur des sites isolés. Hurfi aide les fabricants chinois de concassage, de criblage, de broyage et de machines minières à présenter ces preuves en anglais et à toucher les acheteurs des pays miniers.";
  zh["Mining and minerals in 2025: the official and industry figures"] = "2025 年的矿业与矿产：官方与行业数据";
  fr["Mining and minerals in 2025: the official and industry figures"] = "Mines et minéraux en 2025 : les chiffres officiels et sectoriels";
  zh["National statistics show steady mining output but falling profits, and the construction machinery association shows strong export growth."] = "国家统计数据显示矿业产量平稳、利润下滑，而工程机械协会的数据显示出口强劲增长。";
  fr["National statistics show steady mining output but falling profits, and the construction machinery association shows strong export growth."] = "Les statistiques nationales montrent une production minière stable mais des bénéfices en baisse, tandis que l’association des machines de construction enregistre une forte croissance des exportations.";
  zh["China produced 4.85 billion tonnes of raw coal in 2025 (+1.4%) and 81.75 million tonnes of ten non-ferrous metals (+3.9%)."] = "2025 年中国原煤产量 48.5 亿吨（+1.4%），十种有色金属产量 8175 万吨（+3.9%）。";
  fr["China produced 4.85 billion tonnes of raw coal in 2025 (+1.4%) and 81.75 million tonnes of ten non-ferrous metals (+3.9%)."] = "La Chine a produit 4,85 milliards de tonnes de charbon brut en 2025 (+1,4 %) et 81,75 millions de tonnes de dix métaux non ferreux (+3,9 %).";
  zh["Mining value added grew 5.6%, but mining profits fell 26.2% to 834.5 billion yuan."] = "采矿业增加值增长 5.6%，但采矿业利润下降 26.2%，至 8345 亿元。";
  fr["Mining value added grew 5.6%, but mining profits fell 26.2% to 834.5 billion yuan."] = "La valeur ajoutée minière a progressé de 5,6 %, mais les bénéfices du secteur ont chuté de 26,2 % à 834,5 milliards de yuans.";
  zh["The CCMA reports 235,257 excavators sold in 2025 (+17%), 116,739 of them exported (+16.1%), and 61,737 loaders exported (+14.6%)."] = "中国工程机械工业协会的数据显示，2025 年挖掘机销量 235,257 台（+17%），其中出口 116,739 台（+16.1%）；装载机出口 61,737 台（+14.6%）。";
  fr["The CCMA reports 235,257 excavators sold in 2025 (+17%), 116,739 of them exported (+16.1%), and 61,737 loaders exported (+14.6%)."] = "La CCMA rapporte 235 257 excavatrices vendues en 2025 (+17 %), dont 116 739 exportées (+16,1 %), et 61 737 chargeuses exportées (+14,6 %).";
  zh["Hunan has found 154 kinds of minerals, and its concrete machinery output rose 39.6%."] = "湖南已发现 154 种矿产，其混凝土机械产量增长 39.6%。";
  fr["Hunan has found 154 kinds of minerals, and its concrete machinery output rose 39.6%."] = "Le Hunan a identifié 154 types de minéraux, et sa production de machines à béton a augmenté de 39,6 %.";
  zh["Yantai’s non-ferrous metal smelting and rolling grew 15.7%."] = "烟台的有色金属冶炼和压延加工业增长 15.7%。";
  fr["Yantai’s non-ferrous metal smelting and rolling grew 15.7%."] = "La métallurgie et le laminage des métaux non ferreux à Yantai ont progressé de 15,7 %.";
  zh["Lower domestic mining profits push equipment makers to export. Buyers in mining countries need proof of performance in similar ore and conditions, and reliable parts supply."] = "国内矿业利润下滑，推动设备制造商转向出口。矿业国家的买家需要看到设备在相似矿石和工况下的表现，以及可靠的备件供应。";
  fr["Lower domestic mining profits push equipment makers to export. Buyers in mining countries need proof of performance in similar ore and conditions, and reliable parts supply."] = "La baisse des bénéfices miniers en Chine pousse les fabricants d’équipements à exporter. Les acheteurs des pays miniers veulent des preuves de performance sur des minerais et des conditions comparables, et un approvisionnement fiable en pièces.";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the sources listed below (National Bureau of Statistics of China; CCMA; Hunan Statistics Bureau). Figures describe the sector, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制作的图表，数据来自下列来源（中国国家统计局、中国工程机械工业协会、湖南省统计局）。数字描述的是行业，而非 Hurfi 的任何客户。";
  fr["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the sources listed below (National Bureau of Statistics of China; CCMA; Hunan Statistics Bureau). Figures describe the sector, not any Hurfi client."] = "Infographie de Hurfi, établie à partir des sources ci-dessous (Bureau national de la statistique de Chine ; CCMA ; Bureau statistique du Hunan). Les chiffres décrivent le secteur, non un client de Hurfi.";
  zh["What overseas buyers compare in mining and mineral processing"] = "海外买家在矿山与选矿设备上比较什么";
  fr["What overseas buyers compare in mining and mineral processing"] = "Ce que comparent les acheteurs en mines et traitement des minéraux";
  zh["Mining buyers compare suppliers by process stage:"] = "矿业买家按工艺环节比较供应商：";
  fr["Mining buyers compare suppliers by process stage:"] = "Les acheteurs miniers comparent les fournisseurs par étape du procédé :";
  zh["Crushing and screening"] = "破碎与筛分";
  fr["Crushing and screening"] = "Concassage et criblage";
  zh["Capacity, feed size, wear parts and mobility."] = "产能、入料粒度、耐磨件和机动性。";
  fr["Capacity, feed size, wear parts and mobility."] = "Capacité, granulométrie d’alimentation, pièces d’usure et mobilité.";
  zh["Grinding and classification"] = "磨矿与分级";
