  zh["Mining and processing machinery sold in the EU falls under the Machinery Directive 2006/42/EC; the Machinery Regulation (EU) 2023/1230 applies from 20 January 2027."] = "在欧盟销售的矿山与选矿机械适用机械指令 2006/42/EC；机械法规 (EU) 2023/1230 自 2027 年 1 月 20 日起适用。";
