  fr["Beijing in the China directory"] = "Pékin dans l’annuaire Chine";
  zh["Figures are quoted from the official sources below and were checked on the date shown. They describe the city, not any Hurfi client. Guidance links are to the publisher’s own documentation."] = "以下数据引自下列官方来源，并于所示日期核对。它们描述的是城市，不涉及任何 Hurfi 客户。指引链接指向发布方自己的文档。";
  fr["Figures are quoted from the official sources below and were checked on the date shown. They describe the city, not any Hurfi client. Guidance links are to the publisher’s own documentation."] = "Les chiffres sont cités des sources officielles ci-dessous et ont été vérifiés à la date indiquée. Ils décrivent la ville, non un client de Hurfi. Les liens de recommandation renvoient à la documentation de leur éditeur.";
  zh["Talk to us about Beijing"] = "聊聊北京项目";
  fr["Talk to us about Beijing"] = "Parlons de Pékin";
  zh["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Beijing: +20.2% computers, communications and electronics value added; +137.5% new-energy vehicle output; +47.6% service robot output; 628.68 bn yuan goods exports (+3.8%)."] = "北京 2025 年四项官方数据信息图：计算机、通信和其他电子设备增加值 +20.2%；新能源汽车产量 +137.5%；服务机器人产量 +47.6%；货物出口 6,286.8 亿元（+3.8%）。";
  fr["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Beijing: +20.2% computers, communications and electronics value added; +137.5% new-energy vehicle output; +47.6% service robot output; 628.68 bn yuan goods exports (+3.8%)."] = "Infographie de quatre chiffres officiels 2025 pour Pékin : +20,2 % de valeur ajoutée dans les ordinateurs, communications et électronique ; +137,5 % de production de véhicules à énergie nouvelle ; +47,6 % de production de robots de service ; 628,68 milliards de yuans d’exportations de marchandises (+3,8 %).";
  zh["Hurfi social post “Turn your factory into a global brand”, with a factory model held on a gloved hand"] = "Hurfi 社交帖“把工厂打造成全球品牌”，配图是一只戴手套的手托着工厂模型";
  fr["Hurfi social post “Turn your factory into a global brand”, with a factory model held on a gloved hand"] = "Publication Hurfi « Transformez votre usine en marque mondiale », avec une maquette d’usine tenue dans une main gantée";
  zh["Export Websites & SEO for Zhuhai Manufacturers | Hurfi"] = "珠海制造商的出口网站与 SEO | Hurfi";
  fr["Export Websites & SEO for Zhuhai Manufacturers | Hurfi"] = "Sites web export et SEO pour les fabricants de Zhuhai | Hurfi";
  zh["Export websites and Google SEO for Zhuhai manufacturers"] = "为珠海制造商建设出口网站与谷歌 SEO";
  fr["Export websites and Google SEO for Zhuhai manufacturers"] = "Sites web export et SEO Google pour les fabricants de Zhuhai";
  zh["Zhuhai sits on the west bank of the Pearl River estuary, next to Macao: electrical appliances, electronics and printers, industrial robots, batteries and solar cells, medical and optical equipment. Its exports go to a wide spread of markets. Hurfi helps Zhuhai manufacturers present that technology clearly to overseas buyers."] = "珠海位于珠江口西岸，紧邻澳门：家电、电子与打印机、工业机器人、电池与太阳能电池、医疗与光学设备。产品出口市场分布很广。Hurfi 帮助珠海制造商把这些技术清楚地呈现给海外买家。";
  fr["Zhuhai sits on the west bank of the Pearl River estuary, next to Macao: electrical appliances, electronics and printers, industrial robots, batteries and solar cells, medical and optical equipment. Its exports go to a wide spread of markets. Hurfi helps Zhuhai manufacturers present that technology clearly to overseas buyers."] = "Zhuhai se trouve sur la rive ouest de l’estuaire de la rivière des Perles, près de Macao : électroménager, électronique et imprimantes, robots industriels, batteries et cellules solaires, équipements médicaux et optiques. Ses exportations vont vers un large éventail de marchés. Hurfi aide les fabricants de Zhuhai à présenter clairement cette technologie aux acheteurs étrangers.";
  zh["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Zhuhai. We work with Zhuhai manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi 在珠海没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频会议，从西安（陕西）和博格拉（孟加拉国）的办公室远程服务珠海制造商。";
  fr["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Zhuhai. We work with Zhuhai manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi n’a ni bureau ni personnel à Zhuhai. Nous travaillons à distance avec les fabricants de Zhuhai — WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence — depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an (Shaanxi) et de Bogura (Bangladesh).";
  zh["Ports, logistics and fairs"] = "港口、物流与展会";
  fr["Ports, logistics and fairs"] = "Ports, logistique et salons";
  zh["What Zhuhai makes, according to official data"] = "官方数据中的珠海制造业";
  fr["What Zhuhai makes, according to official data"] = "Ce que produit Zhuhai, selon les données officielles";
  zh["Zhuhai’s 2025 statistical bulletin, published on the city government portal, gives the figures below."] = "珠海市 2025 年统计公报（发布于市政府门户网站）给出以下数据。";
  fr["Zhuhai’s 2025 statistical bulletin, published on the city government portal, gives the figures below."] = "Le bulletin statistique 2025 de Zhuhai, publié sur le portail du gouvernement municipal, donne les chiffres ci-dessous.";
  zh["Zhuhai’s GDP was 457.310 billion yuan in 2025, up 2.7%, and value added of industry above designated size grew 4.1%."] = "2025 年珠海地区生产总值 4,573.1 亿元，增长 2.7%；规模以上工业增加值增长 4.1%。";
  fr["Zhuhai’s GDP was 457.310 billion yuan in 2025, up 2.7%, and value added of industry above designated size grew 4.1%."] = "Le PIB de Zhuhai a atteint 457,31 milliards de yuans en 2025, en hausse de 2,7 %, et la valeur ajoutée industrielle des entreprises de taille supérieure a progressé de 4,1 %.";
  zh["Advanced manufacturing made up 58.4% of above-designated-size industrial value added (+6.0%), equipment manufacturing 38.5% (+6.7%) and high-tech manufacturing 30.9% (+2.5%)."] = "先进制造业占规模以上工业增加值的 58.4%（+6.0%），装备制造业占 38.5%（+6.7%），高技术制造业占 30.9%（+2.5%）。";
  fr["Advanced manufacturing made up 58.4% of above-designated-size industrial value added (+6.0%), equipment manufacturing 38.5% (+6.7%) and high-tech manufacturing 30.9% (+2.5%)."] = "L’industrie de pointe représentait 58,4 % de la valeur ajoutée industrielle des entreprises de taille supérieure (+6,0 %), la fabrication d’équipements 38,5 % (+6,7 %) et les industries de haute technologie 30,9 % (+2,5 %).";
  zh["Zhuhai produced 43,702 industrial robot sets (+35.7%); output of lithium-ion batteries rose 23.3%, solar cells 83.4% and optical instruments 21.7%."] = "珠海生产工业机器人 43,702 套（+35.7%）；锂离子电池产量增长 23.3%，太阳能电池增长 83.4%，光学仪器增长 21.7%。";
  fr["Zhuhai produced 43,702 industrial robot sets (+35.7%); output of lithium-ion batteries rose 23.3%, solar cells 83.4% and optical instruments 21.7%."] = "Zhuhai a produit 43 702 ensembles de robots industriels (+35,7 %) ; la production de batteries lithium-ion a augmenté de 23,3 %, celle des cellules solaires de 83,4 % et celle des instruments optiques de 21,7 %.";
  zh["Foreign trade was 335.433 billion yuan (+3.4%), with exports of 228.684 billion yuan (−0.4%)."] = "外贸进出口总额 3,354.3 亿元（+3.4%），其中出口 2,286.8 亿元（−0.4%）。";
  fr["Foreign trade was 335.433 billion yuan (+3.4%), with exports of 228.684 billion yuan (−0.4%)."] = "Le commerce extérieur s’est élevé à 335,43 milliards de yuans (+3,4 %), avec des exportations de 228,68 milliards de yuans (−0,4 %).";
  zh["The ports handled 120.91 million tonnes of cargo (−3.8%) and 1.37 million TEU of containers (+6.7%)."] = "港口货物吞吐量 1.2091 亿吨（−3.8%），集装箱吞吐量 137 万标箱（+6.7%）。";
  fr["The ports handled 120.91 million tonnes of cargo (−3.8%) and 1.37 million TEU of containers (+6.7%)."] = "Les ports ont traité 120,91 millions de tonnes de marchandises (−3,8 %) et 1,37 million d’EVP de conteneurs (+6,7 %).";
  zh["Zhuhai’s industry is compact and technical: appliances, robots, printers, batteries and instruments. Buyers of these products compare specifications, certifications and service across many suppliers. Clear English product pages, with the data in text, are often what gets a Zhuhai supplier onto the shortlist."] = "珠海的产业紧凑而技术密集：家电、机器人、打印机、电池和仪器。这类产品的买家会在众多供应商之间比较规格、认证和服务。清晰的英文产品页面，把数据写进正文，往往就是珠海供应商进入候选名单的原因。";
  fr["Zhuhai’s industry is compact and technical: appliances, robots, printers, batteries and instruments. Buyers of these products compare specifications, certifications and service across many suppliers. Clear English product pages, with the data in text, are often what gets a Zhuhai supplier onto the shortlist."] = "L’industrie de Zhuhai est compacte et technique : électroménager, robots, imprimantes, batteries et instruments. Les acheteurs de ces produits comparent spécifications, certifications et service entre de nombreux fournisseurs. Des pages produits claires en anglais, avec les données en texte, sont souvent ce qui fait entrer un fournisseur de Zhuhai dans la liste finale.";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Zhuhai Statistics Bureau, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下列官方来源（珠海市统计局，2025 年统计公报）。数据描述的是城市，不涉及任何 Hurfi 客户。";
  fr["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Zhuhai Statistics Bureau, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Infographie réalisée par Hurfi à partir des sources officielles ci-dessous (bureau des statistiques de Zhuhai, bulletin statistique 2025). Les chiffres décrivent la ville, non un client de Hurfi.";
  zh["Zhuhai’s main industries and what buyers compare"] = "珠海的主要产业与买家的比较重点";
