  zh["Battery and PV buyers ask for test reports, certifications and capacity before price."] = "电池和光伏买家在谈价格之前，先要测试报告、认证和容量数据。";
  fr["Battery and PV buyers ask for test reports, certifications and capacity before price."] = "Les acheteurs de batteries et de photovoltaïque demandent les rapports d’essai, les certifications et la capacité avant le prix.";
  zh["Medical and optical equipment"] = "医疗与光学设备";
