  zh["Xiangzhou, Jinwan and Doumen districts had GDP of 304.770, 96.461 and 56.079 billion yuan in 2025; industrial value added grew 0.4% in Xiangzhou, 6.1% in Jinwan and 13.5% in Doumen."] = "2025 年，香洲、金湾和斗门三区的地区生产总值分别为 3,047.7 亿元、964.6 亿元和 560.8 亿元；工业增加值增速分别为香洲 0.4%、金湾 6.1%、斗门 13.5%。";
  fr["Xiangzhou, Jinwan and Doumen districts had GDP of 304.770, 96.461 and 56.079 billion yuan in 2025; industrial value added grew 0.4% in Xiangzhou, 6.1% in Jinwan and 13.5% in Doumen."] = "En 2025, les districts de Xiangzhou, Jinwan et Doumen ont réalisé un PIB de 304,77, 96,46 et 56,08 milliards de yuans ; la valeur ajoutée industrielle a progressé de 0,4 % à Xiangzhou, 6,1 % à Jinwan et 13,5 % à Doumen.";
  zh["Industrial growth was strongest in Jinwan and Doumen, Zhuhai’s western districts. Wherever you are, buyers want to see real production and real testing."] = "工业增长最快的是珠海西部的金湾和斗门。无论在哪个区，买家都想看到真实的生产和真实的检测。";
  fr["Industrial growth was strongest in Jinwan and Doumen, Zhuhai’s western districts. Wherever you are, buyers want to see real production and real testing."] = "La croissance industrielle a été la plus forte à Jinwan et Doumen, les districts occidentaux de Zhuhai. Où que vous soyez, les acheteurs veulent voir une production réelle et des essais réels.";
  zh["Ports, logistics and trade fairs"] = "港口、物流与交易会";
  fr["Ports, logistics and trade fairs"] = "Ports, logistique et foires commerciales";
  zh["Zhuhai’s ports had 144 berths at the end of 2025 and handled 1.37 million TEU of containers (+6.7%)."] = "截至 2025 年底，珠海港口拥有 144 个泊位，集装箱吞吐量 137 万标箱（+6.7%）。";
  fr["Zhuhai’s ports had 144 berths at the end of 2025 and handled 1.37 million TEU of containers (+6.7%)."] = "Fin 2025, les ports de Zhuhai comptaient 144 postes à quai et ont traité 1,37 million d’EVP de conteneurs (+6,7 %).";
  zh["Buyers comparing suppliers ask how goods will reach them, how long it takes and on what trade terms. Shipping ports, typical lead times and Incoterms on your website answer that before it is asked."] = "比较供应商的买家会问：货怎么到我这里、要多久、按什么贸易术语成交。把出货港口、常见交期和 Incoterms 写在网站上，这些问题在被问之前就有答案。";
  fr["Buyers comparing suppliers ask how goods will reach them, how long it takes and on what trade terms. Shipping ports, typical lead times and Incoterms on your website answer that before it is asked."] = "Les acheteurs qui comparent des fournisseurs demandent comment la marchandise leur parviendra, en combien de temps et à quelles conditions. Indiquer sur votre site les ports d’embarquement, les délais habituels et les Incoterms répond à la question avant qu’elle ne soit posée.";
  zh["General trade made up 164.764 billion yuan of exports and processing trade 56.702 billion yuan; trade with Belt and Road countries was 132.175 billion yuan (+0.4%)."] = "一般贸易出口 1,647.6 亿元，加工贸易出口 567.0 亿元；与共建“一带一路”国家贸易额 1,321.8 亿元（+0.4%）。";
  fr["General trade made up 164.764 billion yuan of exports and processing trade 56.702 billion yuan; trade with Belt and Road countries was 132.175 billion yuan (+0.4%)."] = "Le commerce général a représenté 164,76 milliards de yuans d’exportations et le commerce de transformation 56,70 milliards ; les échanges avec les pays des Nouvelles routes de la soie ont atteint 132,18 milliards de yuans (+0,4 %).";
  zh["Zhuhai’s bulletin lists ASEAN, the EU, Hong Kong (China), the US and India among its main export markets. A site that handles certifications per market makes it easier to sell across all of them."] = "珠海公报列出的主要出口市场包括东盟、欧盟、中国香港、美国和印度。一个能按市场处理认证的网站，更容易在这些市场同时销售。";
  fr["Zhuhai’s bulletin lists ASEAN, the EU, Hong Kong (China), the US and India among its main export markets. A site that handles certifications per market makes it easier to sell across all of them."] = "Le bulletin de Zhuhai cite l’ASEAN, l’Union européenne, Hong Kong (Chine), les États-Unis et l’Inde parmi ses principaux marchés d’exportation. Un site qui gère les certifications par marché facilite la vente sur tous ces marchés.";
  zh["Challenges Zhuhai manufacturers face online"] = "珠海制造商在线上常遇到的问题";
