  zh["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Zhuhai: 58.4% of above-scale value added from advanced manufacturing; 43,702 industrial robot sets (+35.7%); +83.4% solar cell output; 228.684 bn yuan exports."] = "珠海 2025 年四项官方数据信息图：先进制造业占规模以上工业增加值 58.4%；工业机器人 43,702 套（+35.7%）；太阳能电池产量 +83.4%；出口 2,286.8 亿元。";
  fr["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Zhuhai: 58.4% of above-scale value added from advanced manufacturing; 43,702 industrial robot sets (+35.7%); +83.4% solar cell output; 228.684 bn yuan exports."] = "Infographie de quatre chiffres officiels 2025 pour Zhuhai : 58,4 % de la valeur ajoutée des entreprises de taille supérieure issus de l’industrie de pointe ; 43 702 ensembles de robots industriels (+35,7 %) ; +83,4 % de production de cellules solaires ; 228,68 milliards de yuans d’exportations.";
  zh["Export Websites & SEO for Kunshan Manufacturers | Hurfi"] = "昆山制造企业外贸建站与谷歌SEO | Hurfi";
  fr["Export Websites & SEO for Kunshan Manufacturers | Hurfi"] = "Sites web export et SEO Google pour les fabricants de Kunshan | Hurfi";
  zh["Export websites and Google SEO for Kunshan manufacturers"] = "为昆山制造企业打造外贸网站与谷歌SEO";
  fr["Export websites and Google SEO for Kunshan manufacturers"] = "Sites web export et référencement Google pour les fabricants de Kunshan";
  zh["Kunshan is the county-level city beside Shanghai that assembles much of the world’s laptops, phones and displays: its 2025 industrial output was 1,302.79 billion yuan, 47.7% of it high-tech. Hurfi builds the English websites that turn that production base into overseas buyers."] = "昆山是紧邻上海的县级市，全球大量笔记本电脑、手机和显示屏在此组装：2025年规上工业总产值13,027.9亿元，其中高新技术产业占47.7%。Hurfi 帮助昆山制造企业把这一产能基础转化为海外买家。";
  fr["Kunshan is the county-level city beside Shanghai that assembles much of the world’s laptops, phones and displays: its 2025 industrial output was 1,302.79 billion yuan, 47.7% of it high-tech. Hurfi builds the English websites that turn that production base into overseas buyers."] = "Kunshan est la ville-district voisine de Shanghai où sont assemblés une grande partie des ordinateurs portables, téléphones et écrans du monde : sa production industrielle a atteint 1 302,79 milliards de yuans en 2025, dont 47,7 % dans les hautes technologies. Hurfi crée les sites en anglais qui transforment cette base industrielle en acheteurs étrangers.";
  zh["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Kunshan. We work with Kunshan manufacturers remotely — by WeChat, email and video call — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi 在昆山没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频会议远程服务昆山制造企业，团队位于西安（陕西）和博古拉（孟加拉国）。";
  fr["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Kunshan. We work with Kunshan manufacturers remotely — by WeChat, email and video call — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi n’a pas de bureau ni de personnel à Kunshan. Nous travaillons avec les fabricants de Kunshan à distance — WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence — depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an (Shaanxi) et de Bogura (Bangladesh).";
  zh["What Kunshan makes, according to official data"] = "官方数据中的昆山产业";
  fr["What Kunshan makes, according to official data"] = "Ce que produit Kunshan, selon les données officielles";
  zh["The figures below come from Kunshan’s 2025 statistical bulletin, published in May 2026."] = "以下数据来自昆山市2025年国民经济和社会发展统计公报（2026年5月发布）。";
  fr["The figures below come from Kunshan’s 2025 statistical bulletin, published in May 2026."] = "Les chiffres ci-dessous proviennent du bulletin statistique 2025 de Kunshan, publié en mai 2026.";
  zh["Kunshan’s GDP was 561.534 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.8%: second-industry value added was 289.057 billion yuan (+6.4%) and services 269.835 billion yuan (+5.1%), a 0.5:51.4:48.1 split."] = "2025年昆山地区生产总值5,615.34亿元，增长5.8%：第二产业增加值2,890.57亿元（+6.4%），第三产业增加值2,698.35亿元（+5.1%），三次产业结构为0.5:51.4:48.1。";
  fr["Kunshan’s GDP was 561.534 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.8%: second-industry value added was 289.057 billion yuan (+6.4%) and services 269.835 billion yuan (+5.1%), a 0.5:51.4:48.1 split."] = "Le PIB de Kunshan a atteint 561,534 milliards de yuans en 2025, en hausse de 5,8 % : la valeur ajoutée du secteur secondaire était de 289,057 milliards (+6,4 %) et celle des services de 269,835 milliards (+5,1 %), soit une répartition de 0,5:51,4:48,1.";
  zh["Industrial output above designated size reached 1,302.79 billion yuan (+4.9%); high-tech output was 622.077 billion yuan, 47.7% of the total."] = "规上工业总产值13,027.9亿元（+4.9%）；高新技术产业产值6,220.77亿元，占47.7%。";
  fr["Industrial output above designated size reached 1,302.79 billion yuan (+4.9%); high-tech output was 622.077 billion yuan, 47.7% of the total."] = "La production industrielle des entreprises au-dessus du seuil a atteint 1 302,79 milliards de yuans (+4,9 %) ; celle des hautes technologies 622,077 milliards, soit 47,7 % du total.";
  zh["The city has one IT cluster worth more than 100 billion yuan — computers, communications and other electronic equipment — and eleven clusters worth more than 10 billion yuan each. Sixteen firms passed 10 billion yuan of output and 1,147 passed 100 million."] = "全市拥有1个千亿级IT产业集群（计算机、通信和其他电子设备制造业）和11个百亿级产业集群。产值超10亿元企业16家，超1亿元企业1,147家。";
  fr["The city has one IT cluster worth more than 100 billion yuan — computers, communications and other electronic equipment — and eleven clusters worth more than 10 billion yuan each. Sixteen firms passed 10 billion yuan of output and 1,147 passed 100 million."] = "La ville compte une grappe informatique de plus de 100 milliards de yuans — ordinateurs, communications et autres équipements électroniques — et onze grappes de plus de 10 milliards chacune. Seize entreprises ont dépassé 10 milliards de yuans de production et 1 147 ont dépassé 100 millions.";
  zh["Output in 2025 included 16.372 million computers, 72.169 million mobile phones and 102 million LCD panels."] = "2025年产量包括电子计算机整机1,637.2万台、手机7,216.9万台、液晶显示屏1.02亿片。";
  fr["Output in 2025 included 16.372 million computers, 72.169 million mobile phones and 102 million LCD panels."] = "La production 2025 comprenait 16,372 millions d’ordinateurs, 72,169 millions de téléphones mobiles et 102 millions d’écrans LCD.";
  zh["Trade was 824.80 billion yuan (+1.3%), with exports of 536.94 billion yuan, flat on 2024. General trade rose 8.6% to 174.793 billion yuan; processing trade fell 0.7% to 495.303 billion yuan."] = "进出口总额8,248.0亿元（+1.3%），其中出口5,369.4亿元，与上年持平。一般贸易增长8.6%至1,747.93亿元；加工贸易下降0.7%至4,953.03亿元。";
  fr["Trade was 824.80 billion yuan (+1.3%), with exports of 536.94 billion yuan, flat on 2024. General trade rose 8.6% to 174.793 billion yuan; processing trade fell 0.7% to 495.303 billion yuan."] = "Les échanges ont atteint 824,80 milliards de yuans (+1,3 %), avec 536,94 milliards d’exportations, stables par rapport à 2024. Le commerce général a progressé de 8,6 % à 174,793 milliards ; le commerce de transformation a reculé de 0,7 % à 495,303 milliards.";
  zh["Cross-border e-commerce trade was 1.992 billion yuan, up 335.2%, and 80 new foreign-invested projects were signed, with 1.03 billion US dollars of registered foreign capital and 792 million US dollars actually used."] = "跨境电商进出口19.92亿元，增长335.2%；新签约外资项目80个，新增注册外资10.3亿美元，实际使用外资7.92亿美元。";
  fr["Cross-border e-commerce trade was 1.992 billion yuan, up 335.2%, and 80 new foreign-invested projects were signed, with 1.03 billion US dollars of registered foreign capital and 792 million US dollars actually used."] = "Le commerce électronique transfrontalier a atteint 1,992 milliard de yuans (+335,2 %) et 80 nouveaux projets étrangers ont été signés, avec 1,03 milliard de dollars de capital enregistré et 792 millions de dollars effectivement investis.";
  zh["Kunshan’s trade is still dominated by processing: about three-fifths of it is contract manufacturing for brands based elsewhere. Those brands, and their distributors, choose suppliers by reading — specifications, certifications, capacity and quality systems — before they ever send a drawing. The city also has more than 3,500 valid high-tech enterprises and 28,238 valid invention patents, so many suppliers can answer technical questions in detail. The website is where that detail has to be visible. Cross-border e-commerce grew almost fourfold in 2025, which means more Kunshan makers are now selling direct and need product pages that work for buyers who never visit China."] = "昆山的贸易仍以加工贸易为主：约五分之三为代工生产，服务对象是设在其他地区的品牌。这些品牌及其经销商在发出图纸之前，先通过阅读来选择供应商——规格、认证、产能和质量管理体系。昆山还拥有超过3,500家有效高新技术企业和28,238件有效发明专利，因此许多供应商能够详细回答技术问题。网站正是这些细节必须被看见的地方。2025年跨境电商增长近四倍，意味着更多昆山制造企业开始直接销售，需要为从未来过中国的买家提供可用的产品页面。";
  fr["Kunshan’s trade is still dominated by processing: about three-fifths of it is contract manufacturing for brands based elsewhere. Those brands, and their distributors, choose suppliers by reading — specifications, certifications, capacity and quality systems — before they ever send a drawing. The city also has more than 3,500 valid high-tech enterprises and 28,238 valid invention patents, so many suppliers can answer technical questions in detail. The website is where that detail has to be visible. Cross-border e-commerce grew almost fourfold in 2025, which means more Kunshan makers are now selling direct and need product pages that work for buyers who never visit China."] = "Le commerce de Kunshan reste dominé par la transformation : environ trois cinquièmes relèvent de la fabrication pour des marques établies ailleurs. Ces marques et leurs distributeurs choisissent leurs fournisseurs en lisant — spécifications, certifications, capacité et systèmes qualité — avant même d’envoyer un plan. La ville compte aussi plus de 3 500 entreprises high-tech valides et 28 238 brevets d’invention en vigueur : beaucoup de fournisseurs peuvent donc répondre en détail aux questions techniques. Le site web est l’endroit où ce détail doit être visible. Le commerce électronique transfrontalier a presque quadruplé en 2025 : de plus en plus de fabricants de Kunshan vendent donc en direct et ont besoin de pages produit utilisables par des acheteurs qui ne viendront jamais en Chine.";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Kunshan Statistics Bureau, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下列官方来源（昆山市统计局，2025年统计公报）。数据描述的是城市，而非任何 Hurfi 客户。";
  fr["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Kunshan Statistics Bureau, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Infographie Hurfi, établie à partir des sources officielles ci-dessous (bureau statistique de Kunshan, bulletin 2025). Les chiffres décrivent la ville, non un client de Hurfi.";
  zh["Kunshan’s main industries and what buyers compare"] = "昆山的主要产业与买家比较的内容";
  fr["Kunshan’s main industries and what buyers compare"] = "Les principales industries de Kunshan et ce que comparent les acheteurs";
  zh["Electronics, displays and IT hardware"] = "电子、显示与IT硬件";
  fr["Electronics, displays and IT hardware"] = "Électronique, écrans et matériel informatique";
  zh["Brand owners and distributors compare panel specifications, chipsets, interfaces, certifications and capacity in text."] = "品牌方和经销商会在文字中比较面板规格、芯片组、接口、认证和产能。";
  fr["Brand owners and distributors compare panel specifications, chipsets, interfaces, certifications and capacity in text."] = "Les marques et les distributeurs comparent dans le texte les spécifications d’écran, les chipsets, les interfaces, les certifications et la capacité.";
  zh["Precision parts, moulds and tooling"] = "精密零件、模具与工装";
  fr["Precision parts, moulds and tooling"] = "Pièces de précision, moules et outillage";
  zh["Buyers check tolerances, materials, inspection reports and repeatability before releasing drawings."] = "买家在发出图纸前会核查公差、材料、检测报告和一致性。";
  fr["Buyers check tolerances, materials, inspection reports and repeatability before releasing drawings."] = "Les acheteurs vérifient tolérances, matières, rapports de contrôle et répétabilité avant de diffuser leurs plans.";
  zh["Equipment and automation"] = "设备与自动化";
  fr["Equipment and automation"] = "Équipements et automatisation";
  zh["Equipment buyers need ratings, standards, cycle times, footprint and service terms on the page."] = "设备买家需要页面上的额定参数、标准、节拍、占地尺寸和服务条款。";
  fr["Equipment buyers need ratings, standards, cycle times, footprint and service terms on the page."] = "Les acheteurs d’équipements veulent les caractéristiques, normes, temps de cycle, encombrement et conditions de service sur la page.";
  zh["OEM and ODM contract manufacturing"] = "OEM与ODM代工";
  fr["OEM and ODM contract manufacturing"] = "Fabrication sous contrat OEM et ODM";
  zh["Brands look for process capability, IP handling, audit readiness and realistic lead times."] = "品牌方关注工艺能力、知识产权处理、审核准备度和切实可行的交期。";
  fr["Brands look for process capability, IP handling, audit readiness and realistic lead times."] = "Les marques recherchent la capacité de process, la gestion de la propriété intellectuelle, la préparation aux audits et des délais réalistes.";
  zh["The Yangtze River Delta International Airport Kunshan Logistics Centre, a bonded air-cargo station linked to Shanghai’s airports, handled 16.175 billion yuan of imports and exports."] = "长三角国际空港昆山物流中心是连接上海机场的保税航空前置货站，完成进出口货值161.75亿元。";
  fr["The Yangtze River Delta International Airport Kunshan Logistics Centre, a bonded air-cargo station linked to Shanghai’s airports, handled 16.175 billion yuan of imports and exports."] = "Le centre logistique de l’aéroport international du delta du Yangtsé à Kunshan, station de fret aérien sous douane reliée aux aéroports de Shanghai, a traité 161,75 milliards de yuans d’importations et d’exportations.";
  zh["Kunshan Comprehensive Bonded Zone had 44 firms in the VAT general-taxpayer pilot, with 587.31 billion yuan invoiced under the scheme."] = "昆山综合保税区有44家企业参与增值税一般纳税人资格试点，累计开票额587.31亿元。";
  fr["Kunshan Comprehensive Bonded Zone had 44 firms in the VAT general-taxpayer pilot, with 587.31 billion yuan invoiced under the scheme."] = "La zone franche globale de Kunshan comptait 44 entreprises dans le pilote de TVA pour contribuables ordinaires, pour 587,31 milliards de yuans facturés.";
  zh["Courier volume passed 1.4 billion parcels (+23.4%), the highest of any county-level city in Jiangsu."] = "快递业务量突破14亿件（+23.4%），居江苏各县市首位。";
  fr["Courier volume passed 1.4 billion parcels (+23.4%), the highest of any county-level city in Jiangsu."] = "Le volume de colis a dépassé 1,4 milliard d’envois (+23,4 %), le plus élevé de tous les districts urbains du Jiangsu.";
  zh["Taiwanese-invested firms remain central: 203 of them used the cross-group renminbi lending pilot, borrowing and lending 32.607 billion yuan and saving more than 1 billion yuan in financing costs."] = "台资企业仍是重要力量：203家台企使用集团内部人民币跨境双向借款试点，借放款326.07亿元，节约融资成本10亿元以上。";
  fr["Taiwanese-invested firms remain central: 203 of them used the cross-group renminbi lending pilot, borrowing and lending 32.607 billion yuan and saving more than 1 billion yuan in financing costs."] = "Les entreprises taïwanaises restent centrales : 203 d’entre elles ont utilisé le pilote de prêt en renminbi intra-groupe, pour 32,607 milliards de yuans prêtés et empruntés et plus de 1 milliard de yuans d’économies de financement.";
  zh["Eighty new foreign-invested projects were signed in 2025, with 1.03 billion US dollars of registered foreign capital and 792 million US dollars actually used."] = "2025年新签约外资项目80个，新增注册外资10.3亿美元，实际使用外资7.92亿美元。";
  fr["Eighty new foreign-invested projects were signed in 2025, with 1.03 billion US dollars of registered foreign capital and 792 million US dollars actually used."] = "Quatre-vingts nouveaux projets étrangers ont été signés en 2025, avec 1,03 milliard de dollars de capital enregistré et 792 millions de dollars effectivement investis.";
  zh["The city counted more than 3,500 valid high-tech enterprises, 23 Jiangsu unicorns or potential unicorns and 124 gazelle companies."] = "全市有效高新技术企业超过3,500家，江苏独角兽和潜在独角兽企业23家，瞪羚企业124家。";
  fr["The city counted more than 3,500 valid high-tech enterprises, 23 Jiangsu unicorns or potential unicorns and 124 gazelle companies."] = "La ville comptait plus de 3 500 entreprises high-tech valides, 23 licornes ou licornes potentielles du Jiangsu et 124 entreprises « gazelles ».";
  zh["Kunshan sells to brand owners in the US, Europe and Japan through processing trade, and increasingly direct to buyers in Southeast Asia and Belt and Road markets through cross-border e-commerce. Both groups research suppliers online first, but they look for different things: brands want audit and process evidence, direct buyers want product data, prices and shipping."] = "昆山通过加工贸易向美国、欧洲和日本的品牌方供货，并越来越多地通过跨境电商直接面向东南亚和“一带一路”市场的买家。两类客户都会先在网上调研供应商，但关注点不同：品牌方需要审核与工艺证据，直客需要产品数据、价格和运输信息。";
  fr["Kunshan sells to brand owners in the US, Europe and Japan through processing trade, and increasingly direct to buyers in Southeast Asia and Belt and Road markets through cross-border e-commerce. Both groups research suppliers online first, but they look for different things: brands want audit and process evidence, direct buyers want product data, prices and shipping."] = "Kunshan vend aux marques des États-Unis, d’Europe et du Japon via le commerce de transformation, et de plus en plus directement aux acheteurs d’Asie du Sud-Est et des marchés des Nouvelles routes de la soie via le commerce électronique transfrontalier. Les deux groupes recherchent d’abord leurs fournisseurs en ligne, mais pas pour les mêmes raisons : les marques veulent des preuves d’audit et de process, les acheteurs directs des données produit, des prix et du transport.";
  zh["Challenges Kunshan manufacturers face online"] = "昆山制造企业在线上常遇到的挑战";
  fr["Challenges Kunshan manufacturers face online"] = "Les défis en ligne des fabricants de Kunshan";
  zh["These are common problems on manufacturers’ export websites, tied to the industry mix above. They are general observations, not statistics about Kunshan."] = "这些是制造企业外贸网站上的常见问题，与上述产业结构相关，属于一般性观察，不是关于昆山的统计数据。";
  fr["These are common problems on manufacturers’ export websites, tied to the industry mix above. They are general observations, not statistics about Kunshan."] = "Ce sont des problèmes courants sur les sites export de fabricants, liés à la structure industrielle ci-dessus. Il s’agit d’observations générales, non de statistiques sur Kunshan.";
  zh["One page for everything."] = "一个页面装下所有产品。";
  fr["One page for everything."] = "Une seule page pour tout.";
  zh["Buyers cannot tell product families apart."] = "买家无法区分产品系列。";
  fr["Buyers cannot tell product families apart."] = "Les acheteurs ne distinguent pas les familles de produits.";
  zh["Specifications locked in PDFs."] = "规格只放在PDF里。";
  fr["Specifications locked in PDFs."] = "Des spécifications enfermées dans des PDF.";
  zh["Search engines and buyers both miss them."] = "搜索引擎和买家都找不到。";
  fr["Search engines and buyers both miss them."] = "Les moteurs de recherche et les acheteurs les manquent.";
  zh["Certifications implied, not listed."] = "认证只是暗示，没有列出。";
  fr["Certifications implied, not listed."] = "Des certifications suggérées, jamais listées.";
  zh["Say which markets, which scope."] = "说明覆盖哪些市场、哪些范围。";
  fr["Say which markets, which scope."] = "Précisez les marchés et le périmètre.";
  zh["No logistics answer."] = "没有物流答案。";
  fr["No logistics answer."] = "Aucune réponse logistique.";
  zh["Airport, port and bonded options are a buying criterion."] = "机场、港口和保税选项是采购标准。";
  fr["Airport, port and bonded options are a buying criterion."] = "Les options aéroport, port et douane sont un critère d’achat.";
  zh["Questions overseas buyers ask Kunshan suppliers"] = "海外买家会问昆山供应商的问题";
  fr["Questions overseas buyers ask Kunshan suppliers"] = "Les questions des acheteurs étrangers aux fournisseurs de Kunshan";
  zh["Can you show the exact panel, module or chipset we would receive?"] = "能否展示我们实际会收到的面板、模组或芯片组？";
  fr["Can you show the exact panel, module or chipset we would receive?"] = "Pouvez-vous montrer l’écran, le module ou le chipset exact que nous recevrons ?";
  zh["Name the part numbers you build around and put the specification table in page text, not only in a PDF."] = "写明你们围绕的料号，并把规格表放在页面文字里，而不只是PDF。";
  fr["Name the part numbers you build around and put the specification table in page text, not only in a PDF."] = "Indiquez les références sur lesquelles vous travaillez et placez le tableau de spécifications dans le texte de la page, pas seulement dans un PDF.";
  zh["Which certifications cover my market?"] = "哪些认证覆盖我的市场？";
  fr["Which certifications cover my market?"] = "Quelles certifications couvrent mon marché ?";
  zh["List them by market with scope, certificate number and the products covered."] = "按市场列出范围、证书编号和覆盖的产品。";
  fr["List them by market with scope, certificate number and the products covered."] = "Listez-les par marché avec le périmètre, le numéro de certificat et les produits couverts.";
  zh["Can you manufacture under our brand and packaging?"] = "能否按我们的品牌和包装生产？";
  fr["Can you manufacture under our brand and packaging?"] = "Pouvez-vous fabriquer sous notre marque et notre emballage ?";
  zh["Explain your OEM and ODM process, tooling ownership and how you protect drawings."] = "说明你们的OEM和ODM流程、模具归属以及如何保护图纸。";
  fr["Explain your OEM and ODM process, tooling ownership and how you protect drawings."] = "Expliquez votre process OEM et ODM, la propriété de l’outillage et la protection des plans.";
  zh["What is your monthly capacity and lead time?"] = "月产能和交期是多少？";
  fr["What is your monthly capacity and lead time?"] = "Quelle est votre capacité mensuelle et votre délai ?";
  zh["Give realistic ranges per product family and say what changes them."] = "按产品系列给出真实区间，并说明影响它们的因素。";
  fr["Give realistic ranges per product family and say what changes them."] = "Donnez des fourchettes réalistes par famille de produits et ce qui les fait varier.";
  zh["How do you ship from Kunshan?"] = "从昆山如何发货？";
  fr["How do you ship from Kunshan?"] = "Comment expédiez-vous depuis Kunshan ?";
  zh["Name the airport, port and bonded options you actually use, with typical terms."] = "写明你们实际使用的机场、港口和保税方案，以及常见条款。";
  fr["Name the airport, port and bonded options you actually use, with typical terms."] = "Nommez l’aéroport, le port et les options sous douane que vous utilisez réellement, avec les conditions habituelles.";
  zh["Can your engineers work from our specification?"] = "工程师能否按我们的规格开发？";
  fr["Can your engineers work from our specification?"] = "Vos ingénieurs peuvent-ils travailler à partir de notre cahier des charges ?";
  zh["Describe sampling, DFM feedback and how new projects are quoted."] = "说明打样、DFM反馈和新项目的报价流程。";
  fr["Describe sampling, DFM feedback and how new projects are quoted."] = "Décrivez les échantillons, le retour DFM et la façon dont les nouveaux projets sont chiffrés.";
  zh["A website, SEO and RFQ playbook for Kunshan manufacturers"] = "昆山制造企业的网站、SEO与询盘手册";
  fr["A website, SEO and RFQ playbook for Kunshan manufacturers"] = "Un plan d’action site web, SEO et demandes de devis pour les fabricants de Kunshan";
  zh["Put what you make, for which industry and to which standards on the first screen."] = "首屏说明你们做什么、服务哪个行业、符合哪些标准。";
  fr["Put what you make, for which industry and to which standards on the first screen."] = "Placez en première page ce que vous fabriquez, pour quel secteur et selon quelles normes.";
  zh["Give every product family a page with an HTML specification table and part numbers."] = "每个产品系列一个页面，配HTML规格表和料号。";
  fr["Give every product family a page with an HTML specification table and part numbers."] = "Consacrez une page à chaque famille de produits, avec un tableau de spécifications en HTML et les références.";
  zh["Publish a certifications page by market and link it from each product page."] = "发布按市场划分的认证页面，并从每个产品页面链接过去。";
  fr["Publish a certifications page by market and link it from each product page."] = "Publiez une page certifications par marché et liez-la depuis chaque page produit.";
  zh["Write a logistics page: airport and port options, packing, Incoterms and lead times."] = "写一个物流页面：机场和港口选项、包装、贸易术语和交期。";
  fr["Write a logistics page: airport and port options, packing, Incoterms and lead times."] = "Rédigez une page logistique : aéroports et ports, emballage, Incoterms et délais.";
  zh["Show production, test and inspection with real photos and short captions."] = "用真实照片和简短说明展示生产、测试和检验。";
  fr["Show production, test and inspection with real photos and short captions."] = "Montrez production, essais et contrôle avec de vraies photos et des légendes courtes.";
  zh["Track RFQs by product family and country, and review them monthly."] = "按产品系列和国家跟踪询盘，并每月复盘。";
  fr["Track RFQs by product family and country, and review them monthly."] = "Suivez les demandes de devis par famille de produits et par pays, et revoyez-les chaque mois.";
  zh["How Hurfi helps Kunshan manufacturers"] = "Hurfi 如何帮助昆山制造企业";
  fr["How Hurfi helps Kunshan manufacturers"] = "Comment Hurfi aide les fabricants de Kunshan";
  zh["We structure the site around product families, part numbers and certifications, the way engineering buyers search."] = "我们按产品系列、料号和认证来组织网站，符合工程买家的搜索方式。";
  fr["We structure the site around product families, part numbers and certifications, the way engineering buyers search."] = "Nous structurons le site autour des familles de produits, des références et des certifications, comme cherchent les acheteurs techniques.";
  zh["We write English product and capability pages with your team and get every claim approved."] = "我们与你们的团队一起撰写英文产品和能力页面，并让每一条表述都经过确认。";
  fr["We write English product and capability pages with your team and get every claim approved."] = "Nous rédigeons les pages produit et capacités en anglais avec votre équipe et faisons valider chaque affirmation.";
  zh["We report RFQs by product and country, so you can see which pages earn inquiries."] = "我们按产品和国别报告询盘，让你看到哪些页面带来了询盘。";
  fr["We report RFQs by product and country, so you can see which pages earn inquiries."] = "Nous suivons les demandes de devis par produit et par pays, et partageons les chiffres ouvertement.";
  zh["A site that presents electronics, precision parts, equipment and contract manufacturing with specifications and certifications."] = "一个用规格和认证呈现电子、精密零件、设备和代工能力的网站。";
  fr["A site that presents electronics, precision parts, equipment and contract manufacturing with specifications and certifications."] = "Un site qui présente électronique, pièces de précision, équipements et fabrication sous contrat avec spécifications et certifications.";
  zh["Searches for product types, part numbers and standards, with English and Chinese versions tagged correctly."] = "针对产品类型、料号和标准的搜索，中英文版本正确标注。";
  fr["Searches for product types, part numbers and standards, with English and Chinese versions tagged correctly."] = "Des recherches sur les types de produits, les références et les normes, avec des versions anglaise et chinoise correctement balisées.";
  zh["Campaigns built around your strongest product families and markets, reported by inquiry."] = "围绕你们最强的产品系列和市场开展推广，按询盘报告结果。";
  fr["Campaigns built around your strongest product families and markets, reported by inquiry."] = "Des campagnes autour de vos meilleures familles de produits et marchés, mesurées en demandes de devis.";
  zh["Posts that show production, testing and shipments without exposing client work."] = "展示生产、测试和发货的内容，不泄露客户项目。";
