  zh["Questions from Kunshan manufacturers"] = "昆山制造企业常问的问题";
  fr["Questions from Kunshan manufacturers"] = "Les questions des fabricants de Kunshan";
  zh["Does Hurfi have an office in Kunshan?"] = "Hurfi 在昆山有办公室吗？";
  fr["Does Hurfi have an office in Kunshan?"] = "Hurfi a-t-il un bureau à Kunshan ?";
  zh["No. Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Kunshan. We work with Kunshan manufacturers remotely by WeChat, email and video, from our offices in Xi’an and Bogura."] = "没有。Hurfi 在昆山没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频远程服务昆山制造企业，团队位于西安和博古拉。";
  fr["No. Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Kunshan. We work with Kunshan manufacturers remotely by WeChat, email and video, from our offices in Xi’an and Bogura."] = "Non. Hurfi n’a ni bureau ni personnel à Kunshan. Nous travaillons à distance par WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence, depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an et de Bogura.";
  zh["We mostly do processing trade for foreign brands. Do we need a website?"] = "我们主要为外国品牌做加工贸易，需要网站吗？";
  fr["We mostly do processing trade for foreign brands. Do we need a website?"] = "Nous faisons surtout de la transformation pour des marques étrangères. Avons-nous besoin d’un site ?";
  zh["Yes, but a different one. Your buyers are brand owners and their sourcing teams, so the site should show process capability, quality systems, audit readiness and capacity — not retail-style product listings."] = "需要，但类型不同。你们的买家是品牌方及其采购团队，因此网站应展示工艺能力、质量管理体系、审核准备度和产能，而不是零售式产品列表。";
  fr["Yes, but a different one. Your buyers are brand owners and their sourcing teams, so the site should show process capability, quality systems, audit readiness and capacity — not retail-style product listings."] = "Oui, mais d’un autre type. Vos acheteurs sont des marques et leurs équipes d’achat : le site doit montrer la capacité de process, les systèmes qualité, la préparation aux audits et la capacité de production — pas un catalogue de détail.";
  zh["We make displays and IT hardware. What should the site show?"] = "我们做显示屏和IT硬件，网站应展示什么？";
  fr["We make displays and IT hardware. What should the site show?"] = "Nous fabriquons des écrans et du matériel informatique. Que doit montrer le site ?";
  zh["Panel and module specifications, interfaces, certifications, test data and production capacity, with part numbers in the page text so buyers and search engines can match them."] = "面板和模组规格、接口、认证、测试数据和产能，并把料号写进页面文字，方便买家和搜索引擎匹配。";
  fr["Panel and module specifications, interfaces, certifications, test data and production capacity, with part numbers in the page text so buyers and search engines can match them."] = "Spécifications des écrans et modules, interfaces, certifications, données d’essai et capacité, avec les références dans le texte pour que les acheteurs et les moteurs de recherche puissent les retrouver.";
  zh["Can you write for OEM and ODM work without exposing our customers?"] = "你们能写OEM和ODM内容而不暴露我们的客户吗？";
  fr["Can you write for OEM and ODM work without exposing our customers?"] = "Pouvez-vous rédiger pour l’OEM et l’ODM sans exposer nos clients ?";
  zh["Yes. We describe capability and process, never client names or drawings unless you approve them in writing."] = "可以。我们只描述能力和流程，未经你们书面同意，不会出现客户名称或图纸。";
  fr["Yes. We describe capability and process, never client names or drawings unless you approve them in writing."] = "Oui. Nous décrivons la capacité et le process, jamais les noms de clients ni les plans sans votre accord écrit.";
  zh["How long does a site take?"] = "一个网站需要多长时间？";
  fr["How long does a site take?"] = "Combien de temps prend un site ?";
  zh["Most projects run six to ten weeks from kickoff, depending on how much technical material your engineers can review."] = "多数项目从启动到上线需要六到十周，取决于你们工程师能审阅多少技术资料。";
  fr["Most projects run six to ten weeks from kickoff, depending on how much technical material your engineers can review."] = "La plupart des projets durent six à dix semaines après le lancement, selon la quantité de documents techniques que vos ingénieurs peuvent relire.";
  zh["Do you work in Chinese as well?"] = "你们也做中文吗？";
  fr["Do you work in Chinese as well?"] = "Travaillez-vous aussi en chinois ?";
  zh["Yes. We build English sites for export and can add Chinese pages, with correct hreflang between them."] = "做。我们为出口搭建英文网站，也可以增加中文页面，并正确设置它们之间的hreflang。";
  fr["Yes. We build English sites for export and can add Chinese pages, with correct hreflang between them."] = "Oui. Nous créons des sites en anglais pour l’export et pouvons ajouter des pages chinoises, avec un hreflang correct entre elles.";
