  fr["China · Fujian"] = "Chine · Fujian";
  zh["Export websites and Google SEO for Fuzhou manufacturers"] = "为福州制造企业打造外贸网站与谷歌SEO";
  fr["Export websites and Google SEO for Fuzhou manufacturers"] = "Sites web export et référencement Google pour les fabricants de Fuzhou";
  zh["Fuzhou, Fujian’s capital, is a base for textiles and chemical fibre, steel, vehicles, displays, electronics and equipment. Its factories grew in 2025, but its exports fell sharply. Hurfi helps Fuzhou makers rebuild overseas demand with websites that show buyers exactly what they make."] = "福州是福建省省会，是纺织与化纤、钢铁、汽车、显示、电子和装备制造的基地。2025年当地工厂产值增长，但出口大幅下滑。Hurfi 帮助福州制造企业用网站重建海外需求，让买家清楚看到他们做什么。";
  fr["Fuzhou, Fujian’s capital, is a base for textiles and chemical fibre, steel, vehicles, displays, electronics and equipment. Its factories grew in 2025, but its exports fell sharply. Hurfi helps Fuzhou makers rebuild overseas demand with websites that show buyers exactly what they make."] = "Fuzhou, capitale du Fujian, est une base de textile et de fibres chimiques, d’acier, de véhicules, d’écrans, d’électronique et d’équipements. Ses usines ont produit davantage en 2025, mais ses exportations ont chuté. Hurfi aide les fabricants de Fuzhou à reconstruire la demande étrangère avec des sites qui montrent exactement ce qu’ils fabriquent.";
  zh["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Fuzhou. We work with Fuzhou manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi 在福州没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频会议远程服务福州制造企业，团队位于西安（陕西）和博古拉（孟加拉国）。";
  fr["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Fuzhou. We work with Fuzhou manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi n’a pas de bureau ni de personnel à Fuzhou. Nous travaillons avec les fabricants de Fuzhou à distance — WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence — depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an (Shaanxi) et de Bogura (Bangladesh).";
  zh["What Fuzhou makes, according to official data"] = "官方数据中的福州产业";
  fr["What Fuzhou makes, according to official data"] = "Ce que produit Fuzhou, selon les données officielles";
  zh["The figures below come from Fuzhou’s 2025 statistical bulletin, published by the Fuzhou Statistics Bureau."] = "以下数据来自福州市2025年国民经济和社会发展统计公报（福州市统计局发布）。";
  fr["The figures below come from Fuzhou’s 2025 statistical bulletin, published by the Fuzhou Statistics Bureau."] = "Les chiffres ci-dessous proviennent du bulletin statistique 2025 de Fuzhou, publié par le bureau statistique de Fuzhou.";
  zh["Fuzhou’s GDP was 1,511.232 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.6%; industrial value added was 340.746 billion yuan (+6.9%), and above-designated-size industry grew 7.2%."] = "2025年福州地区生产总值15,112.32亿元，增长5.6%；工业增加值3,407.46亿元（+6.9%），规上工业增长7.2%。";
  fr["Fuzhou’s GDP was 1,511.232 billion yuan in 2025, up 5.6%; industrial value added was 340.746 billion yuan (+6.9%), and above-designated-size industry grew 7.2%."] = "Le PIB de Fuzhou a atteint 1 511,232 milliards de yuans en 2025, en hausse de 5,6 % ; la valeur ajoutée industrielle était de 340,746 milliards (+6,9 %) et l’industrie au-dessus du seuil a progressé de 7,2 %.";
  zh["Automobile manufacturing grew 20.1%, chemicals 30.7%, electronics 24.9% and steel 18.8%; equipment manufacturing grew 21.6% and high-tech manufacturing 14.3%."] = "汽车制造业增长20.1%，化工30.7%，电子24.9%，钢铁18.8%；装备制造业增长21.6%，高技术制造业增长14.3%。";
  fr["Automobile manufacturing grew 20.1%, chemicals 30.7%, electronics 24.9% and steel 18.8%; equipment manufacturing grew 21.6% and high-tech manufacturing 14.3%."] = "La fabrication automobile a progressé de 20,1 %, la chimie de 30,7 %, l’électronique de 24,9 % et l’acier de 18,8 % ; la fabrication d’équipements a progressé de 21,6 % et les hautes technologies de 14,3 %.";
  zh["The city made 119,900 cars (+41.6%), 3.5754 million tonnes of chemical fibre and 22.4783 million displays (−15.6%); yarn output fell 29.5%."] = "全市生产汽车119,900辆（+41.6%）、化学纤维357.54万吨、显示器2,247.83万台（−15.6%）；纱产量下降29.5%。";
  fr["The city made 119,900 cars (+41.6%), 3.5754 million tonnes of chemical fibre and 22.4783 million displays (−15.6%); yarn output fell 29.5%."] = "La ville a produit 119 900 voitures (+41,6 %), 3,5754 millions de tonnes de fibres chimiques et 22,4783 millions d’écrans (−15,6 %) ; la production de fil a reculé de 29,5 %.";
  zh["Goods trade fell 24.0% to 266.43 billion yuan, and exports fell 32.0% to 174.73 billion yuan."] = "货物贸易下降24.0%至2,664.3亿元，出口下降32.0%至1,747.3亿元。";
  fr["Goods trade fell 24.0% to 266.43 billion yuan, and exports fell 32.0% to 174.73 billion yuan."] = "Le commerce de marchandises a reculé de 24,0 % à 266,43 milliards de yuans et les exportations de 32,0 % à 174,73 milliards.";
  zh["Exports to the United States fell 34.5%, to the EU 12.1% and to ASEAN 60.2%."] = "对美出口下降34.5%，对欧盟下降12.1%，对东盟下降60.2%。";
  fr["Exports to the United States fell 34.5%, to the EU 12.1% and to ASEAN 60.2%."] = "Les exportations vers les États-Unis ont reculé de 34,5 %, vers l’UE de 12,1 % et vers l’ASEAN de 60,2 %.";
  zh["Garment output was 54.4095 million pieces and crude steel 15.609 million tonnes."] = "服装产量5,440.95万件，粗钢1,560.9万吨。";
  fr["Garment output was 54.4095 million pieces and crude steel 15.609 million tonnes."] = "La production de vêtements a atteint 54,4095 millions de pièces et celle d’acier brut 15,609 millions de tonnes.";
  zh["2025 was a difficult export year for Fuzhou even as its factories produced more. That makes winning new direct buyers more important. Buyers who find a Fuzhou supplier online need detail, proof and a clear route to a quote — and a supplier that is honest about what it does well. Exports to the EU and Japan fell far less than exports to the US and ASEAN, which gives a starting point for planning."] = "2025年对福州是出口艰难的一年，尽管工厂产量更高。这让赢得新的直客更为重要。在网上找到福州供应商的买家需要细节、证据和清晰的报价路径，也需要一家坦诚说明自身优势的供应商。对欧盟和日本出口的降幅远小于对美国和东盟，这可以作为规划起点。";
  fr["2025 was a difficult export year for Fuzhou even as its factories produced more. That makes winning new direct buyers more important. Buyers who find a Fuzhou supplier online need detail, proof and a clear route to a quote — and a supplier that is honest about what it does well. Exports to the EU and Japan fell far less than exports to the US and ASEAN, which gives a starting point for planning."] = "2025 a été une année difficile à l’export pour Fuzhou alors que ses usines produisaient plus. Gagner de nouveaux acheteurs directs devient donc plus important. Les acheteurs qui trouvent un fournisseur de Fuzhou en ligne ont besoin de détails, de preuves et d’un chemin clair vers un devis — et d’un fournisseur honnête sur ce qu’il sait faire. Les exportations vers l’UE et le Japon ont beaucoup moins reculé que celles vers les États-Unis et l’ASEAN, ce qui donne un point de départ.";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Fuzhou Statistics Bureau, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下列官方来源（福州市统计局，2025年统计公报）。数据描述的是城市，而非任何 Hurfi 客户。";
  fr["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Fuzhou Statistics Bureau, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Infographie Hurfi, établie à partir des sources officielles ci-dessous (bureau statistique de Fuzhou, bulletin 2025). Les chiffres décrivent la ville, non un client de Hurfi.";
