  zh["We structure the site around products, standards and markets, so new buyers can qualify you quickly."] = "我们围绕产品、标准和市场来组织网站，让新买家能快速判断你们是否合适。";
  fr["We structure the site around products, standards and markets, so new buyers can qualify you quickly."] = "Nous structurons le site autour des produits, des normes et des marchés, pour que les nouveaux acheteurs puissent vous qualifier vite.";
  zh["We write English product and capability pages with your team and approve every claim with you."] = "我们与你们的团队一起撰写英文产品和能力页面，并与你们确认每一条表述。";
