  zh["No. Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Fuzhou. We work with Fuzhou manufacturers remotely by WeChat, email and video, from our offices in Xi’an and Bogura."] = "没有。Hurfi 在福州没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频远程服务福州制造企业，团队位于西安和博古拉。";
  fr["No. Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Fuzhou. We work with Fuzhou manufacturers remotely by WeChat, email and video, from our offices in Xi’an and Bogura."] = "Non. Hurfi n’a ni bureau ni personnel à Fuzhou. Nous travaillons à distance par WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence, depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an et de Bogura.";
  zh["Our exports fell in 2025. Is a website worth it now?"] = "我们2025年出口下滑，现在做网站值得吗？";
