  zh["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Fuzhou: 1,511.23 bn yuan GDP (+5.6%); +21.6% equipment manufacturing; 119,900 cars made (+41.6%); −32.0% exports in 2025."] = "福州2025年四项官方数据信息图：地区生产总值15,112.3亿元（+5.6%）；装备制造业+21.6%；汽车产量119,900辆（+41.6%）；2025年出口−32.0%。";
  fr["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Fuzhou: 1,511.23 bn yuan GDP (+5.6%); +21.6% equipment manufacturing; 119,900 cars made (+41.6%); −32.0% exports in 2025."] = "Infographie des quatre chiffres officiels 2025 de Fuzhou : 1 511,23 milliards de yuans de PIB (+5,6 %) ; +21,6 % de fabrication d’équipements ; 119 900 voitures produites (+41,6 %) ; −32,0 % d’exportations en 2025.";
  zh["Hurfi social post: “Your factory is powerful. But is the world seeing it?” with a factory under a lamp"] = "Hurfi 社交媒体图：“你的工厂很强，但世界看见了吗？”，灯下的工厂。";
  fr["Hurfi social post: “Your factory is powerful. But is the world seeing it?” with a factory under a lamp"] = "Publication Hurfi : « Votre usine est puissante. Mais le monde la voit-il ? », avec une usine sous une lampe.";
  zh["Export Websites & SEO for Shenyang Manufacturers | Hurfi"] = "沈阳制造企业外贸建站与谷歌SEO | Hurfi";
  fr["Export Websites & SEO for Shenyang Manufacturers | Hurfi"] = "Sites web export et SEO Google pour les fabricants de Shenyang | Hurfi";
  zh["China · Liaoning"] = "中国 · 辽宁";
  fr["China · Liaoning"] = "Chine · Liaoning";
  zh["Export websites and Google SEO for Shenyang manufacturers"] = "为沈阳制造企业打造外贸网站与谷歌SEO";
  fr["Export websites and Google SEO for Shenyang manufacturers"] = "Sites web export et référencement Google pour les fabricants de Shenyang";
  zh["Shenyang is the capital of Liaoning and one of China’s oldest equipment-making cities: machine tools and general equipment, vehicles, electrical machinery, aerospace and transport equipment, and robots. Its exports grew in 2025 while overall industry fell. Hurfi helps Shenyang manufacturers find buyers abroad with websites that explain their engineering clearly."] = "沈阳是辽宁省省会，也是中国最老的装备制造城市之一：机床与通用设备、汽车、电机电气、航空航天与运输设备，以及机器人。2025年当地出口增长，而整体工业下降。Hurfi 帮助沈阳制造企业用能清楚讲明工程能力的网站找到海外买家。";
  fr["Shenyang is the capital of Liaoning and one of China’s oldest equipment-making cities: machine tools and general equipment, vehicles, electrical machinery, aerospace and transport equipment, and robots. Its exports grew in 2025 while overall industry fell. Hurfi helps Shenyang manufacturers find buyers abroad with websites that explain their engineering clearly."] = "Shenyang, capitale du Liaoning, est l’une des plus anciennes villes de construction mécanique de Chine : machines-outils et équipements généraux, véhicules, matériel électrique, aéronautique et matériel de transport, et robots. Ses exportations ont progressé en 2025 alors que l’industrie reculait. Hurfi aide les fabricants de Shenyang à trouver des acheteurs étrangers avec des sites qui expliquent clairement leur ingénierie.";
  zh["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Shenyang. We work with Shenyang manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi 在沈阳没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频会议远程服务沈阳制造企业，团队位于西安（陕西）和博古拉（孟加拉国）。";
  fr["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Shenyang. We work with Shenyang manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi n’a pas de bureau ni de personnel à Shenyang. Nous travaillons avec les fabricants de Shenyang à distance — WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence — depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an (Shaanxi) et de Bogura (Bangladesh).";
  zh["What Shenyang makes, according to official data"] = "官方数据中的沈阳产业";
  fr["What Shenyang makes, according to official data"] = "Ce que produit Shenyang, selon les données officielles";
  zh["Shenyang’s 2025 statistical bulletin, published on the city government portal, gives the figures below."] = "沈阳市政府门户网站发布的2025年统计公报给出了以下数据。";
  fr["Shenyang’s 2025 statistical bulletin, published on the city government portal, gives the figures below."] = "Le bulletin statistique 2025 de Shenyang, publié sur le portail du gouvernement municipal, donne les chiffres ci-dessous.";
  zh["Shenyang’s GDP was 910.03 billion yuan in 2025, up 2.0%; value added of industry above designated size fell 6.0%."] = "2025年沈阳地区生产总值9,100.3亿元，增长2.0%；规上工业增加值下降6.0%。";
  fr["Shenyang’s GDP was 910.03 billion yuan in 2025, up 2.0%; value added of industry above designated size fell 6.0%."] = "Le PIB de Shenyang a atteint 910,03 milliards de yuans en 2025, en hausse de 2,0 % ; la valeur ajoutée de l’industrie au-dessus du seuil a reculé de 6,0 %.";
  zh["Equipment manufacturing made up 68.0% of above-designated-size industrial value added, though it fell 7.4% in the year."] = "装备制造业占规上工业增加值的68.0%，但全年下降7.4%。";
  fr["Equipment manufacturing made up 68.0% of above-designated-size industrial value added, though it fell 7.4% in the year."] = "La fabrication d’équipements représentait 68,0 % de la valeur ajoutée industrielle au-dessus du seuil, mais elle a reculé de 7,4 % sur l’année.";
  zh["Electrical machinery and equipment grew 15.4% and rail, ship, aerospace and other transport equipment 3.1%, while automobile manufacturing fell 10.3% and general-purpose equipment 8.1%."] = "电气机械和器材制造业增长15.4%，铁路、船舶、航空航天和其他运输设备制造业增长3.1%，而汽车制造业下降10.3%，通用设备制造业下降8.1%。";
  fr["Electrical machinery and equipment grew 15.4% and rail, ship, aerospace and other transport equipment 3.1%, while automobile manufacturing fell 10.3% and general-purpose equipment 8.1%."] = "La fabrication de machines et appareils électriques a progressé de 15,4 % et le matériel ferroviaire, naval, aéronautique et de transport de 3,1 %, tandis que la fabrication automobile reculait de 10,3 % et les équipements à usage général de 8,1 %.";
  zh["The city produced 5,170 industrial robot sets (+4.2%), and lithium-ion battery output rose 57.5%."] = "全市生产工业机器人5,170套（+4.2%），锂离子电池产量增长57.5%。";
  fr["The city produced 5,170 industrial robot sets (+4.2%), and lithium-ion battery output rose 57.5%."] = "La ville a produit 5 170 ensembles de robots industriels (+4,2 %) et la production de batteries lithium-ion a augmenté de 57,5 %.";
  zh["Goods trade was 135.37 billion yuan (−7.6%), but exports rose 8.8% to 63.33 billion yuan, with general-trade exports up 25.5%."] = "货物贸易1,353.7亿元（−7.6%），但出口增长8.8%至633.3亿元，其中一般贸易出口增长25.5%。";
  fr["Goods trade was 135.37 billion yuan (−7.6%), but exports rose 8.8% to 63.33 billion yuan, with general-trade exports up 25.5%."] = "Le commerce de marchandises a atteint 135,37 milliards de yuans (−7,6 %), mais les exportations ont progressé de 8,8 % à 63,33 milliards, dont +25,5 % pour les exportations en commerce général.";
  zh["With two-thirds of industry in equipment and domestic demand weaker, exports are where Shenyang’s growth came from in 2025. Equipment buyers abroad want to understand the machine, the company’s engineering record and the after-sales arrangements before they talk price. Those answers belong on the website."] = "由于三分之二的工业是装备制造，而内需走弱，2025年沈阳的增长来自出口。海外设备买家在谈价格之前，希望了解设备本身、公司的工程业绩和售后安排。这些答案应当放在网站上。";
  fr["With two-thirds of industry in equipment and domestic demand weaker, exports are where Shenyang’s growth came from in 2025. Equipment buyers abroad want to understand the machine, the company’s engineering record and the after-sales arrangements before they talk price. Those answers belong on the website."] = "Avec deux tiers de l’industrie dans les équipements et une demande intérieure plus faible, la croissance de Shenyang est venue des exportations en 2025. Les acheteurs d’équipements étrangers veulent comprendre la machine, les références d’ingénierie de l’entreprise et les arrangements après-vente avant de parler prix. Ces réponses doivent figurer sur le site.";
