  zh["Many factories can make parts; fewer can show a buyer exactly what they can make, to what tolerance, and how they check it. Those that do get better RFQs."] = "很多工厂都能加工零件；但很少有工厂能向买家准确说明自己能做什么、达到什么公差、如何检测。做到这一点的企业会得到更好的询盘。";
  fr["Many factories can make parts; fewer can show a buyer exactly what they can make, to what tolerance, and how they check it. Those that do get better RFQs."] = "Beaucoup d’usines savent fabriquer des pièces ; peu savent montrer à un acheteur exactement ce qu’elles peuvent faire, à quelle tolérance et comment elles le contrôlent. Celles qui le font reçoivent de meilleures demandes.";
