  zh["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Nanjing: 1,942.88 bn yuan GDP (+5.2%); +12.1% instruments and meters value added; 55.2% of above-scale output from high-tech industry; 54,134 industrial robot sets produced."] = "南京 2025 年四大官方数据图：GDP 19,428.8 亿元（+5.2%）；仪器仪表增加值 +12.1%；高新技术产业占规模以上产值 55.2%；工业机器人产量 54,134 套。";
  fr["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Nanjing: 1,942.88 bn yuan GDP (+5.2%); +12.1% instruments and meters value added; 55.2% of above-scale output from high-tech industry; 54,134 industrial robot sets produced."] = "Infographie de quatre chiffres officiels 2025 pour Nanjing : PIB de 1 942,88 milliards de yuans (+5,2 %) ; +12,1 % de valeur ajoutée pour les instruments et compteurs ; 55,2 % de la production de taille supérieure issus de la haute technologie ; 54 134 ensembles de robots industriels produits.";
  zh["Export Websites & SEO for Yantai Manufacturers | Hurfi"] = "烟台制造商外贸网站建设与SEO | Hurfi";
