  zh["China · Shandong"] = "中国 · 山东";
  fr["China · Shandong"] = "Chine · Shandong";
  zh["Export websites and Google SEO for Yantai manufacturers"] = "为烟台制造商提供外贸网站建设与 Google SEO";
  fr["Export websites and Google SEO for Yantai manufacturers"] = "Sites web export et SEO Google pour les fabricants de Yantai";
  zh["Yantai is a coastal industrial city on the Shandong peninsula: chemicals, non-ferrous metals, vehicles, electronics, general equipment and processed food. Its industry grew fast in 2025 and its port keeps expanding. Hurfi helps Yantai manufacturers turn that capacity into overseas inquiries."] = "烟台是山东半岛的沿海工业城市：化工、有色金属、汽车、电子、通用设备和食品加工。2025 年其工业增长迅速，港口持续扩张。Hurfi 帮助烟台制造商把这种产能转化为海外询盘。";
  fr["Yantai is a coastal industrial city on the Shandong peninsula: chemicals, non-ferrous metals, vehicles, electronics, general equipment and processed food. Its industry grew fast in 2025 and its port keeps expanding. Hurfi helps Yantai manufacturers turn that capacity into overseas inquiries."] = "Yantai est une ville industrielle côtière de la péninsule du Shandong : chimie, métaux non ferreux, véhicules, électronique, équipements polyvalents et produits alimentaires transformés. Son industrie a progressé rapidement en 2025 et son port continue de s’étendre. Hurfi aide les fabricants de Yantai à transformer cette capacité en demandes venues de l’étranger.";
  zh["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Yantai. We work with Yantai manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi 在烟台没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频通话，从西安（陕西）和博格拉（孟加拉国）的办公室远程与烟台制造商合作。";
  fr["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Yantai. We work with Yantai manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi n’a ni bureau ni personnel à Yantai. Nous travaillons avec les fabricants de Yantai à distance — WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence — depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an (Shaanxi) et de Bogura (Bangladesh).";
  zh["What Yantai makes, according to official data"] = "官方数据中的烟台产业";
  fr["What Yantai makes, according to official data"] = "Ce que produit Yantai, selon les données officielles";
  zh["Yantai’s 2025 statistical bulletin gives the figures below."] = "烟台市 2025 年统计公报提供了以下数据。";
  fr["Yantai’s 2025 statistical bulletin gives the figures below."] = "Le bulletin statistique 2025 de Yantai donne les chiffres ci-dessous.";
  zh["Yantai’s GDP was 1,135.098 billion yuan in 2025, up 6.1%, and value added of industry above designated size grew 13.5%, with manufacturing up 16.1%."] = "2025 年烟台 GDP 为 11,350.98 亿元，增长 6.1%；规模以上工业增加值增长 13.5%，其中制造业增长 16.1%。";
  fr["Yantai’s GDP was 1,135.098 billion yuan in 2025, up 6.1%, and value added of industry above designated size grew 13.5%, with manufacturing up 16.1%."] = "Le PIB de Yantai s’est élevé à 1 135,098 milliards de yuans en 2025, en hausse de 6,1 %, et la valeur ajoutée de l’industrie de taille supérieure a progressé de 13,5 %, dont 16,1 % pour la fabrication.";
  zh["Among the ten largest industries, chemical raw materials and products grew 46.2%, non-ferrous metal smelting and rolling 15.7%, general-purpose equipment 8.8% and agricultural and food processing 6.7%."] = "十大行业中，化学原料及制品增长 46.2%，有色金属冶炼和压延加工增长 15.7%，通用设备增长 8.8%，农副食品加工增长 6.7%。";
  fr["Among the ten largest industries, chemical raw materials and products grew 46.2%, non-ferrous metal smelting and rolling 15.7%, general-purpose equipment 8.8% and agricultural and food processing 6.7%."] = "Parmi les dix plus grandes industries, les matières premières chimiques et produits chimiques ont progressé de 46,2 %, la métallurgie et le laminage des métaux non ferreux de 15,7 %, les équipements polyvalents de 8,8 % et la transformation agroalimentaire de 6,7 %.";
  zh["Equipment manufacturing made up 31.2% of above-designated-size industrial value added, and high-tech industry output 62.45% of above-designated-size industrial output."] = "装备制造业占规模以上工业增加值的 31.2%，高新技术产业产值占规模以上工业产值的 62.45%。";
  fr["Equipment manufacturing made up 31.2% of above-designated-size industrial value added, and high-tech industry output 62.45% of above-designated-size industrial output."] = "La fabrication d’équipements a représenté 31,2 % de la valeur ajoutée industrielle de taille supérieure, et la production de haute technologie 62,45 % de la production industrielle de taille supérieure.";
  zh["Coastal ports handled 544.127 million tonnes of cargo (+8.4%), including 192.11 million tonnes of foreign-trade cargo, and 5.5596 million TEU of containers (+9.2%)."] = "沿海港口完成货物吞吐量 5.44127 亿吨（+8.4%），其中外贸货物 1.9211 亿吨；集装箱吞吐量 555.96 万标箱（+9.2%）。";
  fr["Coastal ports handled 544.127 million tonnes of cargo (+8.4%), including 192.11 million tonnes of foreign-trade cargo, and 5.5596 million TEU of containers (+9.2%)."] = "Les ports côtiers ont traité 544,127 millions de tonnes de fret (+8,4 %), dont 192,11 millions de tonnes de fret international, et 5,5596 millions d’EVP (+9,2 %).";
  zh["Goods trade was 537.932 billion yuan (+13.7%), with exports of 296.861 billion yuan (+7.1%)."] = "货物贸易 5,379.32 亿元（+13.7%），出口 2,968.61 亿元（+7.1%）。";
  fr["Goods trade was 537.932 billion yuan (+13.7%), with exports of 296.861 billion yuan (+7.1%)."] = "Le commerce de marchandises a atteint 537,932 milliards de yuans (+13,7 %), avec 296,861 milliards d’exportations (+7,1 %).";
  zh["Yantai’s growth is led by chemicals, metals and equipment — products sold on specifications, grades and standards. Its buyers are technical purchasers who compare suppliers across countries. The suppliers that answer their questions in clear English, with data they can check, get shortlisted."] = "烟台的增长由化工、金属和设备带动——这些产品按规格、牌号和标准销售。买家是跨国比较供应商的技术采购方。能用清晰英文、以可核查的数据回答问题的供应商，才能进入候选名单。";
  fr["Yantai’s growth is led by chemicals, metals and equipment — products sold on specifications, grades and standards. Its buyers are technical purchasers who compare suppliers across countries. The suppliers that answer their questions in clear English, with data they can check, get shortlisted."] = "La croissance de Yantai est portée par la chimie, les métaux et les équipements — des produits vendus sur spécifications, grades et normes. Ses acheteurs sont des acheteurs techniques qui comparent les fournisseurs entre pays. Les fournisseurs qui répondent en anglais clair, avec des données vérifiables, sont présélectionnés.";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Yantai Statistics Bureau, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下方所列官方来源（烟台市统计局，2025 年统计公报）。数据描述的是城市整体，并非任何 Hurfi 客户。";
  fr["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Yantai Statistics Bureau, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Infographie réalisée par Hurfi à partir des sources officielles ci-dessous (Bureau des statistiques de Yantai, bulletin statistique 2025). Les chiffres décrivent la ville, et non un client de Hurfi.";
  zh["Yantai’s main industries and what buyers compare"] = "烟台的主要产业与买家比较的要点";
  fr["Yantai’s main industries and what buyers compare"] = "Les principales industries de Yantai et ce que comparent les acheteurs";
  zh["Chemical buyers need grades, specifications, SDS and packaging per product, plus the registrations you hold."] = "化工买家需要每个产品的牌号、规格、SDS 和包装，以及你持有的注册。";
