  fr["Export websites and Google SEO for Dalian manufacturers"] = "Sites web export et SEO Google pour les fabricants de Dalian";
  zh["Dalian is a port city at the tip of the Liaodong peninsula with shipyards, petrochemicals, equipment, vehicles and a growing chip industry. Many of its suppliers sell to Japan, Korea and beyond. Hurfi helps Dalian manufacturers present heavy, technical products clearly to international buyers."] = "大连是辽东半岛尖端的港口城市，拥有造船、石化、装备、汽车和不断增长的芯片产业。许多供应商销往日本、韩国及其他地区。Hurfi 帮助大连制造商向国际买家清晰展示重型、技术型产品。";
  fr["Dalian is a port city at the tip of the Liaodong peninsula with shipyards, petrochemicals, equipment, vehicles and a growing chip industry. Many of its suppliers sell to Japan, Korea and beyond. Hurfi helps Dalian manufacturers present heavy, technical products clearly to international buyers."] = "Dalian est une ville portuaire à la pointe de la péninsule du Liaodong, avec des chantiers navals, la pétrochimie, des équipements, des véhicules et une industrie de puces en croissance. Beaucoup de ses fournisseurs vendent au Japon, en Corée et au-delà. Hurfi aide les fabricants de Dalian à présenter clairement des produits lourds et techniques aux acheteurs internationaux.";
  zh["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Dalian. We work with Dalian manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi 在大连没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频通话，从西安（陕西）和博格拉（孟加拉国）的办公室远程与大连制造商合作。";
  fr["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Dalian. We work with Dalian manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi n’a ni bureau ni personnel à Dalian. Nous travaillons avec les fabricants de Dalian à distance — WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence — depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an (Shaanxi) et de Bogura (Bangladesh).";
  zh["What Dalian makes, according to official data"] = "官方数据中的大连产业";
  fr["What Dalian makes, according to official data"] = "Ce que produit Dalian, selon les données officielles";
  zh["Dalian’s 2025 statistical bulletin and the State Council approval of the Jinpu New Area give the figures below."] = "大连市 2025 年统计公报和国务院关于金普新区的批复提供了以下数据。";
  fr["Dalian’s 2025 statistical bulletin and the State Council approval of the Jinpu New Area give the figures below."] = "Le bulletin statistique 2025 de Dalian et l’approbation de la nouvelle zone de Jinpu par le Conseil des affaires d’État donnent les chiffres ci-dessous.";
  zh["Value added of industry above designated size grew 11.7% in 2025, with high-tech manufacturing up 13.9%, equipment manufacturing 15.4% and the petrochemical industry 8.9%."] = "2025 年规模以上工业增加值增长 11.7%，其中高技术制造业增长 13.9%，装备制造业增长 15.4%，石化产业增长 8.9%。";
  fr["Value added of industry above designated size grew 11.7% in 2025, with high-tech manufacturing up 13.9%, equipment manufacturing 15.4% and the petrochemical industry 8.9%."] = "La valeur ajoutée de l’industrie de taille supérieure a progressé de 11,7 % en 2025, dont 13,9 % pour la fabrication de haute technologie, 15,4 % pour la fabrication d’équipements et 8,9 % pour la pétrochimie.";
  zh["Dalian completed 4.395 million deadweight tonnes of civilian steel ships, up 74.6%, and 300,000 vehicles, up 29.5%; integrated-circuit wafer output rose 19.1%."] = "大连完工民用钢质船舶 439.5 万载重吨，增长 74.6%；汽车 30 万辆，增长 29.5%；集成电路晶圆产量增长 19.1%。";
  fr["Dalian completed 4.395 million deadweight tonnes of civilian steel ships, up 74.6%, and 300,000 vehicles, up 29.5%; integrated-circuit wafer output rose 19.1%."] = "Dalian a achevé 4,395 millions de tonnes de port en lourd de navires en acier civil, en hausse de 74,6 %, et 300 000 véhicules, en hausse de 29,5 % ; la production de plaquettes de circuits intégrés a augmenté de 19,1 %.";
  zh["Goods trade was 449.26 billion yuan (−0.3%), while exports grew 10.6% to 243.25 billion yuan."] = "货物贸易 4,492.6 亿元（−0.3%），出口增长 10.6% 至 2,432.5 亿元。";
  fr["Goods trade was 449.26 billion yuan (−0.3%), while exports grew 10.6% to 243.25 billion yuan."] = "Le commerce de marchandises a atteint 449,26 milliards de yuans (−0,3 %), tandis que les exportations ont augmenté de 10,6 % pour atteindre 243,25 milliards.";
  zh["Port cargo throughput was 300 million tonnes and container throughput 5.482 million TEU, up 1.5%."] = "港口货物吞吐量 3 亿吨，集装箱吞吐量 548.2 万标箱，增长 1.5%。";
  fr["Port cargo throughput was 300 million tonnes and container throughput 5.482 million TEU, up 1.5%."] = "Le trafic portuaire de marchandises a atteint 300 millions de tonnes et celui des conteneurs 5,482 millions d’EVP, en hausse de 1,5 %.";
  zh["Singapore, the UAE, the Cayman Islands, Hong Kong (China) and Japan were the top five sources of foreign investment actually used."] = "实际使用外资的前五大来源地是新加坡、阿联酋、开曼群岛、中国香港和日本。";
  fr["Singapore, the UAE, the Cayman Islands, Hong Kong (China) and Japan were the top five sources of foreign investment actually used."] = "Singapour, les Émirats arabes unis, les îles Caïmans, Hong Kong (Chine) et le Japon ont été les cinq premières sources d’investissements étrangers effectivement utilisés.";
  zh["Dalian’s fastest growth is in ships and equipment — products sold through long, technical procurement processes. Buyers check certifications, classification-society approvals, references and engineering capacity long before they ask for a price. A Dalian supplier’s website is often the first place that checking happens."] = "大连增长最快的是船舶和设备——这些产品要经过漫长而技术化的采购流程。买家在询价很久之前就会核查认证、船级社认可、业绩和工程能力。大连供应商的网站往往就是这些核查的第一站。";
  fr["Dalian’s fastest growth is in ships and equipment — products sold through long, technical procurement processes. Buyers check certifications, classification-society approvals, references and engineering capacity long before they ask for a price. A Dalian supplier’s website is often the first place that checking happens."] = "La croissance la plus rapide de Dalian se situe dans les navires et les équipements — des produits vendus via de longs processus d’achat techniques. Les acheteurs vérifient les certifications, les approbations des sociétés de classification, les références et la capacité d’ingénierie bien avant de demander un prix. Le site d’un fournisseur de Dalian est souvent le premier endroit où ces vérifications ont lieu.";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Dalian 2025 Statistical Bulletin; State Council). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下方所列官方来源（大连市 2025 年统计公报；国务院）。数据描述的是城市整体，并非任何 Hurfi 客户。";
  fr["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Dalian 2025 Statistical Bulletin; State Council). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Infographie réalisée par Hurfi à partir des sources officielles ci-dessous (bulletin statistique 2025 de Dalian ; Conseil des affaires d’État). Les chiffres décrivent la ville, et non un client de Hurfi.";
  zh["Dalian’s main industries and what buyers compare"] = "大连的主要产业与买家比较的要点";
  fr["Dalian’s main industries and what buyers compare"] = "Les principales industries de Dalian et ce que comparent les acheteurs";
  zh["Shipbuilding and marine equipment"] = "造船与海洋装备";
  fr["Shipbuilding and marine equipment"] = "Construction navale et équipements marins";
  zh["Marine buyers check class approvals, materials, welding procedures and delivered projects. Publish what you are allowed to."] = "船舶买家核查船级认可、材料、焊接工艺和已交付项目。在允许范围内尽量公开。";
  fr["Marine buyers check class approvals, materials, welding procedures and delivered projects. Publish what you are allowed to."] = "Les acheteurs maritimes vérifient les approbations de classe, les matériaux, les procédés de soudage et les projets livrés. Publiez ce que vous êtes autorisé à publier.";
  zh["Petrochemicals and materials"] = "石化与材料";
  fr["Petrochemicals and materials"] = "Pétrochimie et matériaux";
  zh["Chemical buyers ask for grades, specifications, SDS and packaging."] = "化工买家会询问牌号、规格、SDS 和包装。";
  fr["Chemical buyers ask for grades, specifications, SDS and packaging."] = "Les acheteurs chimiques demandent les grades, spécifications, FDS et emballages.";
  zh["Equipment buyers compare capacity, specifications, service and spare parts."] = "设备买家比较产能、规格、服务和备件。";
  fr["Equipment buyers compare capacity, specifications, service and spare parts."] = "Les acheteurs d’équipements comparent la capacité, les spécifications, le service et les pièces de rechange.";
  zh["Vehicle and parts buyers look for certifications, part data and quality systems."] = "汽车及零部件买家关注认证、零件数据和质量体系。";
  fr["Vehicle and parts buyers look for certifications, part data and quality systems."] = "Les acheteurs de véhicules et de pièces recherchent les certifications, les données de pièces et les systèmes qualité.";
  zh["Chip-related suppliers need process, quality and qualification information in searchable text."] = "芯片相关供应商需要以可搜索的文字提供工艺、质量和鉴定信息。";
  fr["Chip-related suppliers need process, quality and qualification information in searchable text."] = "Les fournisseurs liés aux puces doivent fournir des informations sur les procédés, la qualité et la qualification dans un texte interrogeable.";
  zh["Industrial zones and districts in Dalian"] = "大连的工业园区与片区";
  fr["Industrial zones and districts in Dalian"] = "Zones et districts industriels de Dalian";
  zh["Dalian Jinpu New Area, approved by the State Council in 2014, covers about 2,299 square kilometres, including all of Jinzhou District and part of Pulandian."] = "大连金普新区于 2014 年获国务院批复，面积约 2,299 平方公里，包括金州区全部和普兰店区部分区域。";
  fr["Dalian Jinpu New Area, approved by the State Council in 2014, covers about 2,299 square kilometres, including all of Jinzhou District and part of Pulandian."] = "La nouvelle zone de Dalian Jinpu, approuvée par le Conseil des affaires d’État en 2014, couvre environ 2 299 kilomètres carrés, dont tout le district de Jinzhou et une partie de Pulandian.";
  zh["The approval positions the new area as a strategic base for open cooperation with Northeast Asia and supports Dalian as a Northeast Asian shipping and logistics centre."] = "批复将新区定位为面向东北亚开放合作的战略基地，并支持大连建设东北亚航运和物流中心。";
  fr["The approval positions the new area as a strategic base for open cooperation with Northeast Asia and supports Dalian as a Northeast Asian shipping and logistics centre."] = "L’approbation positionne la nouvelle zone comme base stratégique de coopération ouverte avec l’Asie du Nord-Est et soutient Dalian comme centre de navigation et de logistique d’Asie du Nord-Est.";
  zh["Many of Dalian’s export manufacturers sit in Jinpu and around the port. Buyers in Japan, Korea and further afield want to see approvals, references and shipping capability, so put those up front."] = "大连许多出口制造商位于金普新区和港口周边。日本、韩国及更远地区的买家希望看到认可、业绩和航运能力，所以请把这些放在显眼位置。";
  fr["Many of Dalian’s export manufacturers sit in Jinpu and around the port. Buyers in Japan, Korea and further afield want to see approvals, references and shipping capability, so put those up front."] = "Beaucoup de fabricants exportateurs de Dalian sont installés à Jinpu et autour du port. Les acheteurs au Japon, en Corée et plus loin veulent voir les approbations, les références et la capacité d’expédition : mettez-les en avant.";
  zh["Port cargo throughput was 300 million tonnes in 2025 (−6.2%) and containers 5.482 million TEU (+1.5%); air cargo was 60,000 tonnes (+12.0%)."] = "2025 年港口货物吞吐量 3 亿吨（−6.2%），集装箱 548.2 万标箱（+1.5%）；航空货运 6 万吨（+12.0%）。";
  fr["Port cargo throughput was 300 million tonnes in 2025 (−6.2%) and containers 5.482 million TEU (+1.5%); air cargo was 60,000 tonnes (+12.0%)."] = "Le trafic portuaire de marchandises a atteint 300 millions de tonnes en 2025 (−6,2 %) et les conteneurs 5,482 millions d’EVP (+1,5 %) ; le fret aérien 60 000 tonnes (+12,0 %).";
  zh["By trade type, processing trade grew 4.6% to 113.68 billion yuan while general trade fell 6.3%; foreign-invested firms’ trade grew 4.8%."] = "按贸易方式看，加工贸易增长 4.6% 至 1,136.8 亿元，一般贸易下降 6.3%；外商投资企业贸易增长 4.8%。";
  fr["By trade type, processing trade grew 4.6% to 113.68 billion yuan while general trade fell 6.3%; foreign-invested firms’ trade grew 4.8%."] = "Par type de commerce, le perfectionnement actif a progressé de 4,6 % à 113,68 milliards de yuans tandis que le commerce général reculait de 6,3 % ; le commerce des entreprises à capitaux étrangers a augmenté de 4,8 %.";
  zh["Dalian’s ties to Japan and Korea are strong — Japan is among its top sources of foreign investment. Japanese- or Korean-language pages can help where you already sell, if they are well translated and tagged."] = "大连与日本、韩国联系紧密——日本是其外资主要来源地之一。日语或韩语页面在你已有销售的地区会有帮助，前提是翻译地道并正确标注。";
  fr["Dalian’s ties to Japan and Korea are strong — Japan is among its top sources of foreign investment. Japanese- or Korean-language pages can help where you already sell, if they are well translated and tagged."] = "Les liens de Dalian avec le Japon et la Corée sont forts — le Japon figure parmi ses principales sources d’investissements étrangers. Des pages en japonais ou en coréen peuvent aider là où vous vendez déjà, si elles sont bien traduites et balisées.";
  zh["Challenges Dalian manufacturers face online"] = "大连制造商在线上常见的难题";
  fr["Challenges Dalian manufacturers face online"] = "Les difficultés en ligne des fabricants de Dalian";
  zh["These are common problems on manufacturers’ export websites, tied to the industry mix above. They are general observations, not statistics about Dalian."] = "以下是制造商外贸网站上常见的问题，与上述产业结构相关。这些是一般性观察，并非关于大连的统计数据。";
  fr["These are common problems on manufacturers’ export websites, tied to the industry mix above. They are general observations, not statistics about Dalian."] = "Voici des problèmes courants sur les sites export de fabricants, liés au tissu industriel décrit plus haut. Il s’agit d’observations générales, non de statistiques sur Dalian.";
  zh["Slow, heavy sites."] = "网站缓慢、笨重。";
  fr["Slow, heavy sites."] = "Des sites lents et lourds.";
  zh["Big images and old systems make pages slow for buyers abroad."] = "大图片和旧系统让海外买家打开页面很慢。";
  fr["Big images and old systems make pages slow for buyers abroad."] = "De grandes images et des systèmes anciens ralentissent les pages pour les acheteurs étrangers.";
  zh["Approvals not listed."] = "没有列出认可。";
  fr["Approvals not listed."] = "Des approbations non listées.";
  zh["Marine and chemical buyers check class and registrations first."] = "船舶和化工买家首先核查船级和注册。";
  fr["Marine and chemical buyers check class and registrations first."] = "Les acheteurs maritimes et chimiques vérifient d’abord la classe et les enregistrements.";
  zh["No reference projects."] = "没有业绩项目。";
  fr["No reference projects."] = "Aucun projet de référence.";
  zh["Equipment buyers want proof from delivered work."] = "设备买家希望看到已交付工作的证明。";
  fr["Equipment buyers want proof from delivered work."] = "Les acheteurs d’équipements veulent des preuves de travaux livrés.";
  zh["Northeast Asian markets underserved."] = "东北亚市场未被充分服务。";
  fr["Northeast Asian markets underserved."] = "Des marchés d’Asie du Nord-Est mal servis.";
  zh["English-only sites miss buyers who search in Japanese or Korean."] = "只有英文的网站会错过用日语或韩语搜索的买家。";
  fr["English-only sites miss buyers who search in Japanese or Korean."] = "Des sites uniquement en anglais manquent les acheteurs qui recherchent en japonais ou en coréen.";
  zh["Questions overseas buyers ask Dalian suppliers"] = "海外买家会向大连供应商提出的问题";
  fr["Questions overseas buyers ask Dalian suppliers"] = "Les questions que les acheteurs étrangers posent aux fournisseurs de Dalian";
  zh["Which classification societies approve your products?"] = "哪些船级社认可你们的产品？";
  fr["Which classification societies approve your products?"] = "Quelles sociétés de classification approuvent vos produits ?";
  zh["List approvals per product with certificate numbers where possible."] = "按产品列出认可，尽可能附上证书编号。";
  fr["List approvals per product with certificate numbers where possible."] = "Listez les approbations par produit, avec les numéros de certificat lorsque c’est possible.";
  zh["What projects have you delivered?"] = "你们交付过哪些项目？";
  fr["What projects have you delivered?"] = "Quels projets avez-vous livrés ?";
  zh["Describe permitted projects with facts: type, size, year, scope."] = "用事实描述获准公开的项目：类型、规模、年份、范围。";
  fr["Describe permitted projects with facts: type, size, year, scope."] = "Décrivez les projets autorisés avec des faits : type, taille, année, périmètre.";
  zh["What is your engineering capacity?"] = "你们的工程能力如何？";
  fr["What is your engineering capacity?"] = "Quelle est votre capacité d’ingénierie ?";
  zh["Explain design, testing and production capacity in numbers you can stand behind."] = "用你能担保的数字说明设计、测试和生产能力。";
  fr["Explain design, testing and production capacity in numbers you can stand behind."] = "Expliquez la capacité de conception, d’essai et de production avec des chiffres que vous pouvez assumer.";
  zh["Do you serve Japanese or Korean buyers?"] = "你们服务日本或韩国买家吗？";
  fr["Do you serve Japanese or Korean buyers?"] = "Servez-vous des acheteurs japonais ou coréens ?";
  zh["If so, say which documents and languages you support."] = "如果有，说明支持哪些文件和语言。";
  fr["If so, say which documents and languages you support."] = "Si oui, précisez les documents et les langues pris en charge.";
  zh["How do you ship oversized items?"] = "你们如何运输超大件？";
  fr["How do you ship oversized items?"] = "Comment expédiez-vous les pièces surdimensionnées ?";
  zh["Describe port access, packing and shipping methods."] = "说明港口条件、包装和运输方式。";
  fr["Describe port access, packing and shipping methods."] = "Décrivez l’accès portuaire, l’emballage et les modes d’expédition.";
  zh["A website, SEO and RFQ playbook for Dalian manufacturers"] = "大连制造商的网站、SEO 与询盘手册";
  fr["A website, SEO and RFQ playbook for Dalian manufacturers"] = "Un guide site web, SEO et demande de devis pour les fabricants de Dalian";
  zh["Publish a certification and approvals page, and link each approval to the products it covers."] = "发布认证与认可页面，并把每项认可链接到它所覆盖的产品。";
  fr["Publish a certification and approvals page, and link each approval to the products it covers."] = "Publiez une page certifications et approbations, et reliez chaque approbation aux produits concernés.";
  zh["Build project pages for permitted references with specifications and photos."] = "为获准公开的业绩建立项目页面，附规格和照片。";
  fr["Build project pages for permitted references with specifications and photos."] = "Créez des pages projet pour les références autorisées, avec spécifications et photos.";
  zh["Add an engineering capability page — design tools, test facilities, welding and inspection processes."] = "增加工程能力页面——设计工具、测试设施、焊接和检验流程。";
  fr["Add an engineering capability page — design tools, test facilities, welding and inspection processes."] = "Ajoutez une page capacité d’ingénierie — outils de conception, installations d’essai, procédés de soudage et d’inspection.";
  zh["Consider Japanese or Korean language pages if those buyers matter, with proper language annotations."] = "如果这些买家重要，考虑日语或韩语页面，并正确标注语言。";
  fr["Consider Japanese or Korean language pages if those buyers matter, with proper language annotations."] = "Si ces acheteurs comptent, envisagez des pages en japonais ou en coréen, avec des annotations de langue correctes.";
  zh["Keep pages fast and readable:"] = "保持页面快速且易读：";
  fr["Keep pages fast and readable:"] = "Gardez des pages rapides et lisibles :";
  zh["set good thresholds of 2.5 s for LCP, 200 ms for INP and 0.1 for CLS."] = "以 LCP 2.5 秒、INP 200 毫秒和 CLS 0.1 作为良好阈值。";
  fr["set good thresholds of 2.5 s for LCP, 200 ms for INP and 0.1 for CLS."] = "visez de bons seuils : 2,5 s pour le LCP, 200 ms pour l’INP et 0,1 pour le CLS.";
  zh["Track RFQs by product type and country to see which markets respond."] = "按产品类型和国家跟踪询盘，看清哪些市场有回应。";
  fr["Track RFQs by product type and country to see which markets respond."] = "Suivez les demandes par type de produit et par pays pour voir quels marchés répondent.";
  zh["How Hurfi helps Dalian manufacturers"] = "Hurfi 如何帮助大连制造商";
  fr["How Hurfi helps Dalian manufacturers"] = "Comment Hurfi aide les fabricants de Dalian";
  zh["We structure the site around approvals, projects and engineering capability."] = "我们围绕认可、项目和工程能力来组织网站。";
  fr["We structure the site around approvals, projects and engineering capability."] = "Nous structurons le site autour des approbations, des projets et de la capacité d’ingénierie.";
  zh["We write English pages with your engineering team and plan Japanese or Korean versions if needed."] = "我们与你的工程团队一起撰写英文页面，并按需规划日语或韩语版本。";
  fr["We write English pages with your engineering team and plan Japanese or Korean versions if needed."] = "Nous rédigeons les pages en anglais avec votre équipe d’ingénierie et planifions des versions japonaise ou coréenne si nécessaire.";
  zh["We report search and inquiry data from your own accounts."] = "我们基于你自己的账户报告搜索和询盘数据。";
  fr["We report search and inquiry data from your own accounts."] = "Nous rendons compte des données de recherche et de demandes depuis vos propres comptes.";
  zh["A site that presents ships, marine equipment, chemicals and machinery with approvals, references and fast pages."] = "展示船舶、海洋装备、化工和机械的网站，包含认可、业绩和快速页面。";
  fr["A site that presents ships, marine equipment, chemicals and machinery with approvals, references and fast pages."] = "Un site qui présente navires, équipements marins, produits chimiques et machines avec approbations, références et pages rapides.";
  zh["Searches for equipment types, standards and class approvals, on pages that load well abroad."] = "针对设备类型、标准和船级认可的搜索，页面在海外加载良好。";
  fr["Searches for equipment types, standards and class approvals, on pages that load well abroad."] = "Des recherches sur les types d’équipements, les normes et les approbations de classe, sur des pages qui se chargent bien à l’étranger.";
  zh["Campaigns for named equipment in chosen countries."] = "针对选定国家指定设备的推广。";
  fr["Campaigns for named equipment in chosen countries."] = "Des campagnes pour des équipements nommés dans des pays choisis.";
  zh["Posts that show deliveries, launches and testing."] = "展示交付、下水与测试的帖子。";
  fr["Posts that show deliveries, launches and testing."] = "Des publications montrant les livraisons, les mises à l’eau et les essais.";
  zh["Questions from Dalian manufacturers"] = "大连制造商常见问题";
  fr["Questions from Dalian manufacturers"] = "Questions des fabricants de Dalian";
  zh["Does Hurfi have an office in Dalian?"] = "Hurfi 在大连有办公室吗？";
  fr["Does Hurfi have an office in Dalian?"] = "Hurfi a-t-il un bureau à Dalian ?";
  zh["No. Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Dalian. We work with Dalian manufacturers remotely by WeChat, email and video, from our offices in Xi’an and Bogura."] = "没有。Hurfi 在大连没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频，从西安和博格拉的办公室远程与大连制造商合作。";
  fr["No. Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Dalian. We work with Dalian manufacturers remotely by WeChat, email and video, from our offices in Xi’an and Bogura."] = "Non. Hurfi n’a ni bureau ni personnel à Dalian. Nous travaillons avec les fabricants de Dalian à distance par WeChat, e-mail et vidéo, depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an et de Bogura.";
  zh["Our sales cycles are long. Does a website matter?"] = "我们的销售周期很长。网站重要吗？";
  fr["Our sales cycles are long. Does a website matter?"] = "Nos cycles de vente sont longs. Un site web compte-t-il ?";
  zh["Yes. Buyers revisit your site many times during evaluation; it needs to answer technical questions consistently."] = "重要。买家在评估期间会多次回访你的网站；它需要一致地回答技术问题。";
  fr["Yes. Buyers revisit your site many times during evaluation; it needs to answer technical questions consistently."] = "Oui. Les acheteurs reviennent plusieurs fois sur votre site pendant l’évaluation ; il doit répondre de façon cohérente aux questions techniques.";
  zh["Can we show projects without breaking confidentiality?"] = "可以在不违反保密的情况下展示项目吗？";
  fr["Can we show projects without breaking confidentiality?"] = "Pouvons-nous montrer des projets sans rompre la confidentialité ?";
  zh["Yes. We describe projects by type, size and scope, and only name clients with permission."] = "可以。我们按类型、规模和范围描述项目，只有获得许可才点出客户名称。";
  fr["Yes. We describe projects by type, size and scope, and only name clients with permission."] = "Oui. Nous décrivons les projets par type, taille et périmètre, et ne nommons les clients qu’avec autorisation.";
  zh["Should we have Japanese or Korean pages?"] = "我们应该有日语或韩语页面吗？";
