  zh["Yes. It shows which searches and countries bring visibility."] = "会。它能显示哪些搜索和国家带来可见度。";
  fr["Yes. It shows which searches and countries bring visibility."] = "Oui. Elle montre quelles recherches et quels pays apportent de la visibilité.";
  zh["Yes, for chosen models and countries, once tracking is in place."] = "是的，针对选定的型号和国家，前提是跟踪已经就位。";
  fr["Yes, for chosen models and countries, once tracking is in place."] = "Oui, pour des modèles et pays choisis, une fois le suivi en place.";
  zh["Book a free consultation and send us your main models."] = "预约免费咨询，并把你的主力型号发给我们。";
