  zh["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Jinan: +37.8% computers, communications and electronics value added; 298,000 trucks produced (+19.6%); 195.71 bn yuan exports (+24.2%); 1,252 China–Europe Railway Express trains (+21.7%)."] = "济南 2025 年四大官方数据图：计算机、通信和电子设备增加值 +37.8%；卡车产量 29.8 万辆（+19.6%）；出口 1,957.1 亿元（+24.2%）；中欧班列 1,252 列（+21.7%）。";
  fr["Infographic of four 2025 official figures for Jinan: +37.8% computers, communications and electronics value added; 298,000 trucks produced (+19.6%); 195.71 bn yuan exports (+24.2%); 1,252 China–Europe Railway Express trains (+21.7%)."] = "Infographie de quatre chiffres officiels 2025 pour Jinan : +37,8 % de valeur ajoutée pour ordinateurs, communications et électronique ; 298 000 camions produits (+19,6 %) ; 195,71 milliards de yuans d’exportations (+24,2 %) ; 1 252 trains China-Europe Railway Express (+21,7 %).";
  zh["Export Websites & SEO for Chongqing Manufacturers | Hurfi"] = "重庆制造商外贸网站建设与SEO | Hurfi";
  fr["Export Websites & SEO for Chongqing Manufacturers | Hurfi"] = "Sites export et SEO pour les fabricants de Chongqing | Hurfi";
  zh["China · Chongqing"] = "中国 · 重庆";
  fr["China · Chongqing"] = "Chine · Chongqing";
  zh["Export websites and Google SEO for Chongqing manufacturers"] = "为重庆制造商提供外贸网站建设与 Google SEO";
  fr["Export websites and Google SEO for Chongqing manufacturers"] = "Sites web export et SEO Google pour les fabricants de Chongqing";
  zh["Chongqing is a municipality and a major inland manufacturing base: cars, motorcycles, laptops, equipment and materials. Its exports travel by rail, river and the New International Land-Sea Trade Corridor. Hurfi helps Chongqing manufacturers present that capacity clearly to overseas buyers."] = "重庆是直辖市，也是重要的内陆制造业基地：汽车、摩托车、笔记本电脑、装备和材料。其出口通过铁路、河流和新国际陆海贸易新通道运输。Hurfi 帮助重庆制造商向海外买家清晰展示这种能力。";
  fr["Chongqing is a municipality and a major inland manufacturing base: cars, motorcycles, laptops, equipment and materials. Its exports travel by rail, river and the New International Land-Sea Trade Corridor. Hurfi helps Chongqing manufacturers present that capacity clearly to overseas buyers."] = "Chongqing est une municipalité et une grande base industrielle intérieure : automobiles, motos, ordinateurs portables, équipements et matériaux. Ses exportations passent par le rail, le fleuve et le nouveau corridor commercial international terre-mer. Hurfi aide les fabricants de Chongqing à présenter clairement cette capacité aux acheteurs étrangers.";
  zh["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Chongqing. We work with Chongqing manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi 在重庆没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频通话，从西安（陕西）和博格拉（孟加拉国）的办公室远程与重庆制造商合作。";
  fr["Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Chongqing. We work with Chongqing manufacturers remotely — WeChat, email and video calls — from our offices in Xi’an (Shaanxi) and Bogura (Bangladesh)."] = "Hurfi n’a ni bureau ni personnel à Chongqing. Nous travaillons avec les fabricants de Chongqing à distance — WeChat, e-mail et visioconférence — depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an (Shaanxi) et de Bogura (Bangladesh).";
  zh["What Chongqing makes, according to official data"] = "官方数据中的重庆产业";
  fr["What Chongqing makes, according to official data"] = "Ce que produit Chongqing, selon les données officielles";
  zh["Chongqing’s 2025 statistical bulletin and the Liangjiang New Area’s English site give the figures below."] = "重庆市 2025 年统计公报和两江新区英文网站提供了以下数据。";
  fr["Chongqing’s 2025 statistical bulletin and the Liangjiang New Area’s English site give the figures below."] = "Le bulletin statistique 2025 de Chongqing et le site anglais de la nouvelle zone de Liangjiang donnent les chiffres ci-dessous.";
  zh["Value added of industry above designated size grew 5.9% in 2025: the automobile industry grew 12.6%, motorcycles 18.4%, equipment 8.5% and materials 7.6%."] = "2025 年规模以上工业增加值增长 5.9%：汽车产业增长 12.6%，摩托车增长 18.4%，装备增长 8.5%，材料增长 7.6%。";
  fr["Value added of industry above designated size grew 5.9% in 2025: the automobile industry grew 12.6%, motorcycles 18.4%, equipment 8.5% and materials 7.6%."] = "La valeur ajoutée de l’industrie de taille supérieure a progressé de 5,9 % en 2025 : l’industrie automobile de 12,6 %, les motos de 18,4 %, les équipements de 8,5 % et les matériaux de 7,6 %.";
  zh["Chongqing produced 2.7877 million vehicles (+9.7%), including 1.2961 million new-energy vehicles (+36.0%), and 6.4731 million motorcycles (+9.1%)."] = "重庆生产汽车 278.77 万辆（+9.7%），其中新能源汽车 129.61 万辆（+36.0%）；摩托车 647.31 万辆（+9.1%）。";
  fr["Chongqing produced 2.7877 million vehicles (+9.7%), including 1.2961 million new-energy vehicles (+36.0%), and 6.4731 million motorcycles (+9.1%)."] = "Chongqing a produit 2,7877 millions de véhicules (+9,7 %), dont 1,2961 million de véhicules à énergie nouvelle (+36,0 %), et 6,4731 millions de motos (+9,1 %).";
  zh["Goods trade was 800.68 billion yuan (+12.0%) and exports 558.73 billion yuan (+10.2%); private firms accounted for 48.0% of trade."] = "货物贸易 8,006.8 亿元（+12.0%），出口 5,587.3 亿元（+10.2%）；民营企业占贸易额的 48.0%。";
  fr["Goods trade was 800.68 billion yuan (+12.0%) and exports 558.73 billion yuan (+10.2%); private firms accounted for 48.0% of trade."] = "Le commerce de marchandises a atteint 800,68 milliards de yuans (+12,0 %) et les exportations 558,73 milliards (+10,2 %) ; les entreprises privées ont représenté 48,0 % du commerce.";
  zh["Vehicle exports (including chassis) were 53.04 billion yuan, up 23.0%, and laptop exports 152.15 billion yuan, 30.2% of China’s laptop exports."] = "汽车出口（含底盘）530.4 亿元，增长 23.0%；笔记本电脑出口 1,521.5 亿元，占中国笔记本电脑出口的 30.2%。";
  fr["Vehicle exports (including chassis) were 53.04 billion yuan, up 23.0%, and laptop exports 152.15 billion yuan, 30.2% of China’s laptop exports."] = "Les exportations de véhicules (châssis compris) ont atteint 53,04 milliards de yuans, en hausse de 23,0 %, et celles d’ordinateurs portables 152,15 milliards, soit 30,2 % des exportations chinoises de portables.";
  zh["Vehicles and laptops dominate the headline numbers, but behind them sit thousands of parts, motorcycle and materials suppliers. Overseas buyers reach them through distributors, marketplaces and their own searches. A website that shows real models, parts data and export logistics lets a Chongqing supplier be found directly."] = "汽车和笔记本电脑占据头条数字，但背后是成千上万的零部件、摩托车和材料供应商。海外买家通过经销商、平台和自己的搜索找到他们。展示真实车型、零件数据和出口物流的网站，能让重庆供应商被直接找到。";
  fr["Vehicles and laptops dominate the headline numbers, but behind them sit thousands of parts, motorcycle and materials suppliers. Overseas buyers reach them through distributors, marketplaces and their own searches. A website that shows real models, parts data and export logistics lets a Chongqing supplier be found directly."] = "Les véhicules et les ordinateurs portables dominent les chiffres, mais derrière eux se trouvent des milliers de fournisseurs de pièces, de motos et de matériaux. Les acheteurs étrangers les trouvent via des distributeurs, des places de marché et leurs propres recherches. Un site qui montre de vrais modèles, des données de pièces et la logistique export permet à un fournisseur de Chongqing d’être trouvé directement.";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Chongqing Municipal Bureau of Statistics, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下方所列官方来源（重庆市统计局，2025 年统计公报）。数据描述的是城市整体，并非任何 Hurfi 客户。";
  fr["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the official sources listed below (Chongqing Municipal Bureau of Statistics, 2025 Statistical Bulletin). Figures describe the city, not any Hurfi client."] = "Infographie réalisée par Hurfi à partir des sources officielles ci-dessous (Bureau des statistiques de la municipalité de Chongqing, bulletin statistique 2025). Les chiffres décrivent la ville, et non un client de Hurfi.";
  zh["Chongqing’s main industries and what buyers compare"] = "重庆的主要产业与买家比较的要点";
  fr["Chongqing’s main industries and what buyers compare"] = "Les principales industries de Chongqing et ce que comparent les acheteurs";
