  zh["Electronics suppliers should state processes, test steps and certifications in searchable text."] = "电子供应商应以可搜索的文字说明工艺、测试步骤和认证。";
  fr["Electronics suppliers should state processes, test steps and certifications in searchable text."] = "Les fournisseurs d’électronique doivent décrire les procédés, les étapes d’essai et les certifications dans un texte interrogeable.";
  zh["Equipment and materials"] = "装备与材料";
  fr["Equipment and materials"] = "Équipements et matériaux";
  zh["Equipment and materials buyers want specifications, grades, standards and capacity."] = "装备和材料买家想要规格、牌号、标准和产能。";
  fr["Equipment and materials buyers want specifications, grades, standards and capacity."] = "Les acheteurs d’équipements et de matériaux veulent des spécifications, des grades, des normes et de la capacité.";
  zh["Industrial zones and districts in Chongqing"] = "重庆的工业园区与片区";
  fr["Industrial zones and districts in Chongqing"] = "Zones et districts industriels de Chongqing";
  zh["Liangjiang New Area became an administrative entity in January 2026 after the former Jiangbei and Yubei districts were merged into it; it covers about 1,360 square kilometres and 3.52 million people."] = "两江新区于 2026 年 1 月成为行政区，由原江北区和渝北区合并而成，面积约 1,360 平方公里，人口 352 万。";
  fr["Liangjiang New Area became an administrative entity in January 2026 after the former Jiangbei and Yubei districts were merged into it; it covers about 1,360 square kilometres and 3.52 million people."] = "La nouvelle zone de Liangjiang est devenue une entité administrative en janvier 2026 après la fusion des anciens districts de Jiangbei et Yubei ; elle couvre environ 1 360 kilomètres carrés et 3,52 millions d’habitants.";
  zh["Liangjiang is the hub for much of Chongqing’s vehicle and electronics industry. A supplier there should show buyers which supply chains it serves, without naming customers it is not allowed to name."] = "两江新区是重庆汽车和电子产业的重要枢纽。那里的供应商应向买家展示自己服务于哪些供应链，而不点名不允许公开的客户。";
  fr["Liangjiang is the hub for much of Chongqing’s vehicle and electronics industry. A supplier there should show buyers which supply chains it serves, without naming customers it is not allowed to name."] = "Liangjiang est le cœur d’une grande partie de l’industrie automobile et électronique de Chongqing. Un fournisseur qui s’y trouve doit montrer aux acheteurs quelles chaînes d’approvisionnement il sert, sans nommer des clients qu’il n’est pas autorisé à nommer.";
  zh["The New Western Land-Sea Corridor reached 584 ports in 127 countries and regions; Chongqing’s container volume on the corridor rose 30% in 2025."] = "新西部陆海新通道通达 127 个国家和地区的 584 个港口；2025 年重庆在该通道上的集装箱量增长 30%。";
  fr["The New Western Land-Sea Corridor reached 584 ports in 127 countries and regions; Chongqing’s container volume on the corridor rose 30% in 2025."] = "Le nouveau corridor terrestre et maritime de l’Ouest a atteint 584 ports dans 127 pays et régions ; le volume de conteneurs de Chongqing sur ce corridor a augmenté de 30 % en 2025.";
  zh["Inland river ports handled 245.16 million tonnes of cargo (+6.9%); container throughput was 2.2503 million TEU, of which 781,500 TEU moved by rail (+23.3%)."] = "内河港口完成货物吞吐量 2.4516 亿吨（+6.9%）；集装箱吞吐量 225.03 万标箱，其中铁路运输 78.15 万标箱（+23.3%）。";
  fr["Inland river ports handled 245.16 million tonnes of cargo (+6.9%); container throughput was 2.2503 million TEU, of which 781,500 TEU moved by rail (+23.3%)."] = "Les ports fluviaux ont traité 245,16 millions de tonnes de fret (+6,9 %) ; le trafic de conteneurs a atteint 2,2503 millions d’EVP, dont 781 500 EVP par rail (+23,3 %).";
  zh["Trade with Belt and Road countries was 369.73 billion yuan (+12.1%), 46.2% of the total; high-tech product exports were 329.16 billion yuan (+4.4%)."] = "与共建“一带一路”国家贸易额 3,697.3 亿元（+12.1%），占总额的 46.2%；高新技术产品出口 3,291.6 亿元（+4.4%）。";
  fr["Trade with Belt and Road countries was 369.73 billion yuan (+12.1%), 46.2% of the total; high-tech product exports were 329.16 billion yuan (+4.4%)."] = "Le commerce avec les pays des Nouvelles routes de la soie a atteint 369,73 milliards de yuans (+12,1 %), soit 46,2 % du total ; les exportations de produits de haute technologie se sont élevées à 329,16 milliards (+4,4 %).";
  zh["Nearly half of Chongqing’s trade is with Belt and Road countries, and rail and the land-sea corridor link it to Southeast and Central Asia and Europe. Language versions and shipping pages for those markets are worth planning early."] = "重庆近一半贸易来自共建“一带一路”国家，铁路和陆海新通道把它与东南亚、中亚和欧洲连接起来。面向这些市场的语言版本和运输页面值得尽早规划。";
  fr["Nearly half of Chongqing’s trade is with Belt and Road countries, and rail and the land-sea corridor link it to Southeast and Central Asia and Europe. Language versions and shipping pages for those markets are worth planning early."] = "Près de la moitié du commerce de Chongqing se fait avec les pays des Nouvelles routes de la soie, et le rail et le corridor terre-mer la relient à l’Asie du Sud-Est, à l’Asie centrale et à l’Europe. Les versions linguistiques et les pages d’expédition pour ces marchés méritent d’être planifiées tôt.";
  zh["Challenges Chongqing manufacturers face online"] = "重庆制造商在线上常见的难题";
