  zh["No. Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Chongqing. We work with Chongqing manufacturers remotely by WeChat, email and video, from our offices in Xi’an and Bogura."] = "没有。Hurfi 在重庆没有办公室或员工。我们通过微信、邮件和视频，从西安和博格拉的办公室远程与重庆制造商合作。";
  fr["No. Hurfi does not have an office or staff in Chongqing. We work with Chongqing manufacturers remotely by WeChat, email and video, from our offices in Xi’an and Bogura."] = "Non. Hurfi n’a ni bureau ni personnel à Chongqing. Nous travaillons avec les fabricants de Chongqing à distance par WeChat, e-mail et vidéo, depuis nos bureaux de Xi’an et de Bogura.";
  zh["We export motorcycles through dealers. What should the website do?"] = "我们通过经销商出口摩托车。网站应该做什么？";
  fr["We export motorcycles through dealers. What should the website do?"] = "Nous exportons des motos via des concessionnaires. Que doit faire le site ?";
  zh["Help dealers check you: models, certifications, parts, training and terms. A dealer page with a short application form works well."] = "帮助经销商核查你：车型、认证、零件、培训和条款。带简短申请表的经销商页面效果很好。";
  fr["Help dealers check you: models, certifications, parts, training and terms. A dealer page with a short application form works well."] = "Aider les concessionnaires à vous vérifier : modèles, certifications, pièces, formation et conditions. Une page concessionnaires avec un court formulaire de demande fonctionne bien.";
  zh["Should part numbers be on the website?"] = "零件编号应该放在网站上吗？";
