  zh["Yes, as searchable text where possible. Many buyers search by part number."] = "应该，尽可能作为可搜索的文字。许多买家按零件编号搜索。";
  fr["Yes, as searchable text where possible. Many buyers search by part number."] = "Oui, en texte interrogeable lorsque c’est possible. Beaucoup d’acheteurs recherchent par référence.";
  zh["Can you build pages in other languages for dealer markets?"] = "你们能为经销商市场建立其他语言的页面吗？";
