  zh["Whether you need a small run of 50 pieces or a 100,000-unit export order, {city} suppliers can scale with your programme. Our shortlist includes factories that accept low MOQs and provide clear per-unit pricing."] = "无论您需要 50 件的小批量，还是 10 万件的出口订单，{city}的供应商都能随您的项目灵活扩产。我们的候选名单包含接受低起订量并提供清晰单件报价的工厂。";
  zh["- 50 to 199 units, ideal for pilot runs and sample approval."] = "- 50 至 199 件，适合试产与样品确认。";
