  zh["Brands and importers abroad are spreading orders across more factories and checking them more carefully. Hurfi helps Chinese garment and footwear manufacturers show capabilities, compliance and capacity in English, so sourcing teams can shortlist them before the first sample."] = "海外品牌与进口商正把订单分散到更多工厂，并更仔细地考察这些工厂。Hurfi 帮助中国服装与鞋类制造商用英语展示能力、合规与产能，让采购团队在打样之前就能将其纳入候选名单。";
  zh["Infographic of four figures for Apparel & Footwear Production: 1,082.2bn yuan of garment exports in 2025, down 4.4%; 9bn pairs of footwear exported in 2025; 5.815bn garments made in Fujian in 2025; 256.03m pairs of shoes made in Taizhou, Zhejiang."] = "服装与鞋类生产四项数据的图表：2025 年服装出口 10,822 亿元，下降 4.4%；2025 年出口鞋类 90 亿双；2025 年福建生产成衣 58.15 亿件；浙江台州生产鞋子 2.56034 亿双。";
  zh["Falling export values and steady volumes mean buyers have choice. Factories that show what they do well (product categories, materials, compliance, speed) are easier to choose than those with a generic “OEM garment factory” page."] = "出口额下降而出口量保持稳定，意味着买家有更多选择。能够清楚展示自身优势（产品类别、材料、合规、速度）的工厂，比只有一页泛泛的“OEM 服装厂”介绍的工厂更容易被选中。";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the sources listed below (National Bureau of Statistics of China; Fujian and Taizhou statistics bureaus). Figures describe the sector, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下方所列来源（中国国家统计局；福建与台州统计部门）。数据描述行业整体情况，不涉及 Hurfi 的任何客户。";
  zh["The Commission’s Digital Product Passport timeline lists textiles for an ecodesign delegated act in 2027, which will change what product data brands ask suppliers for."] = "欧盟委员会的数字产品护照时间表将纺织品列入 2027 年的生态设计授权法案，这将改变品牌向供应商索取的产品数据。";
  zh["China’s national statistics show that garment and footwear exports fell in 2025, while provincial output held up. City bulletins show where the work is concentrated."] = "中国国家统计数据显示，2025 年服装与鞋类出口下降，而各省产量保持稳定。各城市统计公报则显示产业集中在哪些地方。";
  zh["This post, “a brand is not built by one thread”, fits garment makers whose reputation rests on many small details. It is Hurfi’s own brand work, not a client result."] = "这篇题为“品牌不是一根线织成的”的文章，适合那些声誉建立在众多细节之上的服装制造商。这是 Hurfi 自身的品牌工作，并非客户案例。";
  zh["The EU Textile Labelling Regulation (EU) 1007/2011 requires fibre-composition labelling of textile products; it does not cover size, origin or care labelling."] = "欧盟纺织品标签法规 (EU) 1007/2011 要求纺织产品标注纤维成分；该法规不涵盖尺码、产地或护理标签。";
  zh["List certificates and audits with their scope and validity. If an audit is a client’s own, say so, and never imply a certificate covers products it does not."] = "列出证书与审核项目及其范围和有效期。如果审核是客户自行进行的，请如实说明，切勿暗示某证书涵盖其并不涵盖的产品。";
  zh["REACH (EC 1907/2006) restricts chemicals of concern; the authorisation process aims to replace substances of very high concern where alternatives exist."] = "REACH (EC 1907/2006) 限制关注化学品；授权程序旨在在有替代品的情况下替代高度关注物质。";
  zh["Apparel sourcing is visual and fast. The website must show capability quickly and handle sample requests well. Our usual order:"] = "服装采购直观且节奏快。网站必须迅速展示能力，并妥善处理样品请求。我们通常的顺序是：";
  zh["Build category pages around what you make best, with photos of real production and finished goods you are allowed to show."] = "围绕您最擅长的品类构建类别页面，配上真实生产照片以及您获准展示的成品照片。";
  zh["OEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100 tests every component, including threads and buttons, against more than 1,000 substances."] = "OEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100 对每一个部件（包括缝线纽扣）进行检测，覆盖 1,000 多种物质。";
  zh["By showing what you do better, such as speed, technical capability, materials or flexibility, with evidence."] = "通过展示您做得更好的地方，例如速度、技术能力、材料或灵活性，并附上证据。";
  zh["Wenzhou’s footwear exports were 26.31 billion yuan (−7.3%) and clothing exports 14.31 billion yuan (−5.5%)."] = "温州鞋类出口 263.1 亿元（−7.3%），服装出口 143.1 亿元（−5.5%）。";
  zh["Wenzhou Statistics Bureau and NBS Wenzhou Survey Team (bulletin text as reproduced by tjgb.hongheiku.com)."] = "温州市统计局与国家统计局温州调查队（公报文本转载自 tjgb.hongheiku.com）。";
  zh["Many do, alongside LinkedIn, trade fairs and agents. They also check a factory online after meeting it."] = "很多会，同时也会使用 LinkedIn、展会与代理商。他们还会在见面后上网核查工厂。";
  zh["Compliance depends on product and market. These are the references European buyers raise most often:"] = "合规要求取决于产品和市场。以下是欧洲买家最常提到的参考法规：";
  zh["Category-led factory sites with capability pages, compliance information and sample-request forms."] = "以品类为导向的工厂网站，包含能力页面、合规信息与样品请求表单。";
  zh["Plan content around buying calendars and trade fairs, and track which categories bring requests."] = "围绕采购日历与展会规划内容，并跟踪哪些品类带来了询盘。";
  zh["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an and Bogura; we work with factories anywhere in China remotely."] = "不是。Hurfi 的办公室位于西安和博古拉；我们以远程方式与中国各地的工厂合作。";
  zh["Taizhou in Zhejiang made 256.034 million pairs of shoes, and Fuzhou 54.4095 million garments."] = "浙江台州生产鞋子 2.56034 亿双，福州生产成衣 5,440.95 万件。";
  zh["Write pages for specific searches such as a garment type plus a fabric or a certification."] = "针对具体搜索词撰写页面，例如服装类型加面料或认证。";
  zh["Official statistics point to garment and footwear production in cities with Hurfi guides:"] = "官方统计数据表明，服装与鞋类生产集中在以下设有 Hurfi 指南的城市：";
  zh["Yes: fair landing pages and follow-up content so new contacts find the right information."] = "可以：提供展会落地页与后续内容，让新联系人找到所需信息。";
  zh["Shirts, trousers and jackets: construction, trims, seam sealing and technical fabrics."] = "衬衫、长裤与夹克：结构、辅料、接缝密封与技术面料。";
  zh["Add a sample-request form that captures category, quantity, target price and timeline."] = "添加样品请求表单，收集品类、数量、目标价格与时间安排。";
  zh["China exported 9 billion pairs of footwear (−2.0%) worth 297.5 billion yuan (−10.8%)."] = "中国出口鞋类 90 亿双（−2.0%），金额 2,975 亿元（−10.8%）。";
  zh["Garment and clothing-accessory exports were 1,082.2 billion yuan in 2025, down 4.4%."] = "2025 年服装及衣着附件出口 10,822 亿元，下降 4.4%。";
  zh["Publish a compliance page with certificates, test capabilities and audit summaries."] = "发布合规页面，列出证书、检测能力与审核摘要。";
  zh["LinkedIn and Instagram content showing development, production and quality control."] = "在 LinkedIn 与 Instagram 上发布内容，展示开发、生产与质量控制。";
  zh["Athletic, casual and safety footwear: constructions, materials, lasts and testing."] = "运动鞋、休闲鞋与安全鞋：结构、材料、鞋楦与检测。";
  zh["No. We make your factory easier to find and evaluate, and report actual inquiries."] = "不是。我们让您的工厂更容易被找到和评估，并报告真实询盘。";
  zh["Only with written permission. Otherwise describe the category, market and volume."] = "仅在获得书面许可的情况下可以。否则请描述品类、市场与产量。";
  zh["Yes, as ranges. It filters out unsuitable requests and saves time for both sides."] = "可以，以区间形式公布。这样可以过滤不合适的询盘，为双方节省时间。";
  zh["Show your strongest categories with examples, not every product you could make."] = "用示例展示您最强的品类，而不是您能生产的所有产品。";
  zh["SEO for garment-type, material and certification searches in buyers’ languages."] = "针对服装类型、材料与认证搜索，以买家语言进行 SEO。";
