  zh["Formulators, distributors and procurement teams abroad buy chemicals on specifications, documentation and reliability. Hurfi helps Chinese chemical and specialty-material producers publish technical data, safety information and application know-how in English, so buyers can qualify them faster."] = "海外配方师、分销商与采购团队采购化学品时看重规格、文件与可靠性。Hurfi 帮助中国化学品与特种材料生产商用英语发布技术数据、安全信息与应用知识，让买家更快完成供应商资质评估。";
  zh["ISO/IEC 17025 lets testing and calibration laboratories show that they operate competently and generate valid results, and helps their reports be accepted from one country to another, which is why buyers ask whether certificates of analysis come from an accredited lab."] = "ISO/IEC 17025 使检测与校准实验室能够证明其具备相应能力并出具有效结果，也有助于其报告获得他国认可，因此买家会询问分析证书是否来自获认可的实验室。";
  zh["Infographic of four figures for Chemicals & Specialty Materials: +7.8% chemical raw materials value added, 2025; 41.51m t of ethylene made in 2025, up 6.4%; 15.67tn yuan petroleum and chemical industry revenue; +46.2% chemicals growth in Yantai, 2025."] = "化学品与特种材料四项数据的图表：2025 年化工原料增加值增长 7.8%；2025 年乙烯产量 4,151 万吨，增长 6.4%；石油和化学工业营业收入 15.67 万亿元；2025 年烟台化工增长 46.2%。";
  zh["REACH (EC 1907/2006) is the EU’s main law on chemicals; companies must register substances, ECHA and Member States evaluate the information, and substances of very high concern can be authorised or restricted."] = "REACH (EC 1907/2006) 是欧盟化学品管理的主要法规；企业须注册物质，由 ECHA 与成员国评估信息，高度关注物质可被授权或限制。";
  zh["Output included 110.816 million tonnes of sulphuric acid (+4.5%), 46.535 million tonnes of caustic soda (+5.0%), 41.508 million tonnes of ethylene (+6.4%) and 64.808 million tonnes of fertiliser (+7.1%)."] = "产量包括硫酸 1.10816 亿吨（+4.5%）、烧碱 4,653.5 万吨（+5.0%）、乙烯 4,150.8 万吨（+6.4%）和化肥 6,480.8 万吨（+7.1%）。";
  zh["Rising volumes and falling trade values mean more competition on price. Producers who document grades, purity, consistency and regulatory status clearly give buyers reasons beyond price to qualify them."] = "产量上升而贸易额下降，意味着价格竞争更加激烈。能够清楚记录牌号、纯度、一致性与法规状态的生产商，能让买家有价格之外的理由选择他们。";
  zh["The CPCIF reports petroleum and chemical industry revenue of 15.67 trillion yuan in 2025 and profits of 702.09 billion yuan; value added grew 6.9%, one point faster than industry as a whole."] = "中国石油和化学工业联合会 (CPCIF) 数据显示，2025 年石油和化学工业营业收入 15.67 万亿元，利润 7,020.9 亿元；增加值增长 6.9%，比工业整体快一个百分点。";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the sources listed below (National Bureau of Statistics of China; CPCIF; Yantai Statistics Bureau). Figures describe the sector, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下方所列来源（中国国家统计局；中国石油和化学工业联合会；烟台市统计局）。数据描述行业整体情况，不涉及 Hurfi 的任何客户。";
  zh["Never state or imply REACH registration, food-contact status or other approvals you do not hold. Name each registration or approval, its scope and the grade it applies to."] = "切勿声称或暗示您并不持有的 REACH 注册、食品接触状态或其他批准。请说明每项注册或批准的适用范围及其对应的牌号。";
  zh["Google’s guidance on helpful, people-first content favours pages that show first-hand expertise, which suits detailed technical-data and application pages."] = "Google 关于“以人为本、有帮助的内容”的指南偏好展示一手专业知识的页面，这正适合详尽的技术数据与应用页面。";
  zh["OEKO-TEX says its chemical requirements cover REACH Annexes XVII and XIV, CPSIA and the ECHA candidate list, which matters for suppliers to textile mills."] = "OEKO-TEX 表示，其化学品要求涵盖 REACH 附件 XVII 和 XIV、CPSIA 及 ECHA 候选清单，这对纺织厂供应商尤为重要。";
  zh["China’s national statistics and the China Petroleum and Chemical Industry Federation (CPCIF) describe a large industry still growing in output."] = "中国国家统计数据与中国石油和化学工业联合会 (CPCIF) 显示，这是一个产量仍在增长的大型行业。";
  zh["Exactly: substance, registration status and the role you play (manufacturer, importer via representative). Do not claim registration you lack."] = "请准确说明：物质、注册状态以及您所扮演的角色（生产商，或通过代表进口的进口商）。不要声称您并未持有的注册。";
  zh["City bulletins show fast growth in chemical raw materials and products in Yantai (+46.2%), Qingdao (+15.9%) and Weifang (+11.4%)."] = "城市统计公报显示，烟台（+46.2%）、青岛（+15.9%）和潍坊（+11.4%）的化工原料及产品增长迅速。";
  zh["Create a page per product or grade family with CAS numbers, specifications, typical properties and applications in text."] = "为每个产品或牌号系列创建页面，用文字列出 CAS 号、规格、典型特性与应用。";
  zh["Apparent consumption of ethylene grew 7.7%; the CPCIF says export volumes grew quickly even as total trade value fell."] = "乙烯表观消费量增长 7.7%；CPCIF 表示，尽管贸易总额下降，出口量仍快速增长。";
  zh["Many producers publish TDS openly and supply SDS on request. Either way, buyers should see that the documents exist."] = "许多生产商会公开发布 TDS，并在收到请求后提供 SDS。无论哪种方式，买家都应能看到这些文件确实存在。";
  zh["Chemical buyers search by CAS number, grade name and application, and expect documents on request. Our usual order:"] = "化学品买家按 CAS 号、牌号名称与应用进行搜索，并期望能按需获取文件。我们通常的顺序是：";
  zh["Regulatory status is often the first filter. These references matter for European and international buyers:"] = "法规状态往往是第一道筛选条件。以下参考对欧洲及国际买家尤为重要：";
  zh["High-purity materials, battery and semiconductor inputs: purity, traceability and qualification support."] = "高纯材料、电池与半导体原料：纯度、可追溯性与认证支持。";
  zh["For specific grades and applications in selected markets, often yes. Broad terms tend to waste budget."] = "针对特定市场中的具体牌号与应用，通常可以。宽泛关键词往往浪费预算。";
  zh["Grade-based product sites with technical data, document downloads, regulatory pages and RFQ forms."] = "按牌号组织的产品网站，包含技术数据、文件下载、法规页面与询价表单。";
  zh["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an and Bogura. We work with producers in any province remotely."] = "不是。Hurfi 的办公室位于西安和博古拉。我们以远程方式与任何省份的生产商合作。";
  zh["Make technical and safety data sheets available per grade, and explain how COAs are issued."] = "按牌号提供技术数据表与安全数据表，并说明 COA 的出具方式。";
  zh["Publish a regulatory page that states registrations and approvals per substance and market."] = "发布法规页面，按物质与市场列明注册与批准情况。";
  zh["Use an RFQ form that asks for grade, quantity, packaging, destination and documents needed."] = "使用询价表单，收集牌号、数量、包装、目的地及所需文件。";
  zh["Yes. CAS numbers and grade names are among the most specific searches serious buyers use."] = "可以。CAS 号与牌号名称是严肃买家最常使用的精确搜索词之一。";
  zh["Yes, from your technical documents; your chemists approve every claim before publication."] = "可以，依据您的技术文件撰写；所有表述均由您的化学师在发布前审核确认。";
  zh["A website, SEO and RFQ playbook for chemicals and specialty materials manufacturers"] = "面向化学品与特种材料生产商的网站、SEO 与询价手册";
  zh["No. We target specific searches and report results from your own Search Console."] = "不是。我们针对具体搜索词进行优化，并报告您自己 Search Console 中的数据。";
  zh["Offer TDS and SDS downloads, gated or open, and make clear how to request COAs."] = "提供 TDS 与 SDS 下载（可设门槛或公开），并明确说明如何索取 COA。";
  zh["City bulletins show strong chemical growth in several places with Hurfi guides:"] = "城市统计公报显示，多个设有 Hurfi 指南的地方化工增长强劲：";
  zh["Track which grades and applications bring inquiries, and expand those first."] = "跟踪哪些牌号与应用带来询盘，并优先扩展这些内容。";
  zh["Write application pages for the problems buyers solve with your materials."] = "围绕买家使用您材料所解决的问题撰写应用页面。";
  zh["Chemical buyers compare suppliers grade by grade within product families:"] = "化学品买家在产品系列内逐个牌号比较供应商：";
