  zh["With home construction weaker in 2025, many Chinese building-materials makers are looking harder at export markets. Hurfi helps them present performance data, declarations and project references in English, so contractors, distributors and specifiers abroad can evaluate them."] = "2025 年国内住宅建设走弱，许多中国建材制造商正更加积极地开拓出口市场。Hurfi 帮助它们用英语展示性能数据、声明与项目案例，让海外承包商、分销商与设计指定方能够评估它们。";
  zh["The EU Construction Products Regulation was revised in 2024. The Commission describes declarations of performance and conformity, CE marking, notified bodies and a digital product passport, and obligations for manufacturers, importers, distributors and online sellers."] = "欧盟《建筑产品法规》于 2024 年修订。欧盟委员会说明了性能与符合性声明、CE 标志、公告机构与数字产品护照，以及制造商、进口商、分销商和线上卖家的义务。";
  zh["Infographic of four figures for Construction Materials & Systems: 1.69bn t of cement made in 2025, down 6.9%; −17.2% real-estate development investment, 2025; 119.02m t of steel products exported, up 7.5%; 116,739 excavators exported in 2025, up 16.1%."] = "建材与系统四项数据的图表：2025 年水泥产量 16.9 亿吨，下降 6.9%；2025 年房地产开发投资下降 17.2%；出口钢材 1.1902 亿吨，增长 7.5%；2025 年出口挖掘机 116,739 台，增长 16.1%。";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the sources listed below (National Bureau of Statistics of China; Foshan Statistics Bureau; CCMA). Figures describe the sector, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下方所列来源（中国国家统计局；佛山市统计局；中国工程机械工业协会）。数据描述行业整体情况，不涉及 Hurfi 的任何客户。";
  zh["This post builds a brand from bricks, a fair image for construction-materials makers building an export presence step by step. It is Hurfi’s own brand work, not a client result."] = "这篇“用砖块筑品牌”的文章，适合正逐步建立出口影响力的建材制造商。这是 Hurfi 自身的品牌工作，并非客户案例。";
  zh["Export volumes are rising while prices fall. Buyers abroad have more choice, and they choose suppliers who can prove product performance and deliver to site reliably."] = "出口量上升而价格下降。海外买家选择更多，他们会选择能够证明产品性能并可靠交付到工地的供应商。";
  zh["Google’s guidance on multi-regional and multilingual sites explains how to signal language and country versions, which matters when you serve several export markets."] = "Google 关于多地区和多语言网站的指南说明了如何标示语言与国家版本，这在服务多个出口市场时尤为重要。";
  zh["By affixing the CE marking, a manufacturer declares that a product meets all EU legal requirements for CE marking; this applies to products made outside the EU too."] = "加贴 CE 标志即表示制造商声明产品符合欧盟所有 CE 标志相关法律要求；这也适用于欧盟以外生产的产品。";
  zh["Publish declarations of performance and test reports per product, with the standard and test body. For markets outside the EU, say which local approvals you hold."] = "按产品发布性能声明与检测报告，注明标准与检测机构。对于欧盟以外的市场，请说明您持有的当地批准。";
  zh["The revised buildings directive aims to raise the EU renovation rate, currently about 1% a year, which drives demand for insulation, windows and facade systems."] = "修订后的建筑能效指令旨在提高欧盟的翻新率（目前约为每年 1%），这将带动保温材料、门窗与幕墙系统的需求。";
  zh["Construction value added was 8,642.5 billion yuan, down 1.1%, and real-estate development investment fell 17.2% to 8,278.8 billion yuan."] = "建筑业增加值 86,425 亿元，下降 1.1%；房地产开发投资下降 17.2%，至 82,788 亿元。";
  zh["For many construction products covered by harmonised standards it is. Your notified body or consultant can confirm what applies."] = "对于许多受协调标准覆盖的建筑产品，是的。您的公告机构或顾问可以确认适用范围。";
  zh["Hurfi social post “Build your global brand: from factory strength to global buyer trust”, with birds lifting a crate of bricks"] = "Hurfi 社交帖“打造全球品牌：从工厂实力到全球买家信任”，画面为鸟儿吊起一箱砖块";
  zh["Construction products are specified by architects and engineers and bought by contractors and distributors. Our usual order:"] = "建筑产品由建筑师和工程师指定，由承包商和分销商采购。我们通常的顺序是：";
  zh["Cement output was 1.69 billion tonnes in 2025, down 6.9%, and non-metallic mineral products value added fell 0.6%."] = "2025 年水泥产量 16.9 亿吨，下降 6.9%；非金属矿物制品业增加值下降 0.6%。";
  zh["Official statistics point to building-materials and construction-equipment activity in cities with Hurfi guides:"] = "官方统计数据表明，建材与建筑设备产业集中在以下设有 Hurfi 指南的城市：";
  zh["We can host and present BIM and CAD files properly; producing them needs your engineering team or a specialist."] = "我们可以妥善托管并展示 BIM 与 CAD 文件；制作这些文件需要您的工程团队或专业机构。";
  zh["Organise the site by system and building type, with clear routes for specifiers, contractors and distributors."] = "按系统与建筑类型组织网站，为设计指定方、承包商和分销商提供清晰的访问路径。";
  zh[": hosted the China-Africa Economic and Trade Expo in June 2025, with construction machinery among its themes."] = "：于 2025 年 6 月举办中非经贸博览会，工程机械是主题之一。";
  zh["China’s national statistics show a domestic market under pressure, which is pushing manufacturers to export."] = "中国国家统计数据显示，国内市场承压，这正推动制造商转向出口。";
  zh["Steel product exports rose 7.5% to 119.02 million tonnes, while their value fell 0.7% to 591.1 billion yuan."] = "钢材出口量增长 7.5%，达 1.1902 亿吨；出口额下降 0.7%，至 5,911 亿元。";
  zh["Excavator exports rose 16.1% to 116,739 units, according to the China Construction Machinery Association."] = "据中国工程机械工业协会数据，挖掘机出口增长 16.1%，达 116,739 台。";
  zh["Give each product a page with performance data, dimensions, finishes and downloadable technical files."] = "为每个产品设置页面，包含性能数据、尺寸、饰面及可下载的技术文件。";
  zh[": building materials value added fell 14.3% in 2025, a sign of pressure on a large domestic cluster."] = "：2025 年建材增加值下降 14.3%，显示这一大型国内产业集群承压。";
  zh["These references come up repeatedly with buyers in Europe and markets that follow European rules:"] = "以下参考在欧洲及遵循欧洲规则的市场买家口中反复出现：";
  zh["Those where your approvals, logistics and price fit. Market pages should answer local questions."] = "选择您的批准、物流与价格都合适的市场。市场页面应回答当地的具体问题。";
  zh["Construction buyers compare suppliers within system groups and against project specifications:"] = "建筑买家按系统类别并对照项目规格比较供应商：";
  zh["Usually not for project products. Publish specifications and invite RFQs with project details."] = "项目类产品通常不需要。请发布规格，并邀请买家带着项目详情询价。";
  zh["SEO for product, performance and application searches used by specifiers and contractors."] = "针对设计指定方与承包商使用的产品、性能与应用搜索进行 SEO。";
  zh["System-based product sites with technical files, approvals pages and project references."] = "按系统组织的产品网站，包含技术文件、批准页面与项目案例。";
  zh["Test reports for fire, thermal, structural or acoustic properties, per product."] = "按产品提供防火、保温、结构或声学性能的检测报告。";
  zh["Build market pages for the regions you serve, covering approvals and logistics."] = "为您服务的地区建立市场页面，涵盖批准与物流。";
  zh["Add project references with photos, location, building type and products used."] = "添加项目案例，附照片、地点、建筑类型及所用产品。";
  zh["No. We improve how you are found and assessed and report actual inquiries."] = "不是。我们改善您被找到和被评估的方式，并报告真实询盘。";
  zh["A website, SEO and RFQ playbook for construction materials manufacturers"] = "面向建材制造商的网站、SEO 与询价手册";
  zh["Campaigns for distributors and contractors in selected export markets."] = "面向特定出口市场分销商与承包商的推广活动。";
  zh["Thermal, acoustic, wind-load and fire performance with test evidence."] = "保温、声学、风荷载与防火性能，并附检测证据。";
  zh["Design support, fabrication standards, coating and erection guidance."] = "设计支持、加工标准、涂装与安装指导。";
  zh["Offer BIM or CAD files and installation guides where you have them."] = "在具备条件时提供 BIM 或 CAD 文件及安装指南。";
  zh["Construction Materials & Systems: Export Websites and SEO | Hurfi"] = "建材与系统：出口网站与 SEO | Hurfi";
  zh["Book a free consultation to review your site and product systems."] = "预约免费咨询，评估您的网站与产品系统。";
  zh["Packing method and container loading for heavy or fragile items."] = "重型或易碎品的包装方式与集装箱装载。";
  zh["Publish a declarations and approvals page by product and market."] = "按产品与市场发布声明与批准页面。";
  zh["Production and shipping times, and how you sequence deliveries."] = "生产与运输周期，以及您如何安排交付顺序。";
  zh["Questions overseas buyers ask construction materials suppliers"] = "海外买家向建材供应商提出的问题";
  zh["Track which products and markets bring RFQs, and expand those."] = "跟踪哪些产品与市场带来询价，并加以扩展。";
  zh["Fire classification, thermal values and moisture resistance."] = "防火等级、热工指标与防潮性能。";
  zh["Slip resistance, dimensions, finishes and batch consistency."] = "防滑性、尺寸、饰面与批次一致性。";
