  zh["Warehouse operators and integrators abroad want automation that is safe, proven and supported. Hurfi helps Chinese AGV, AMR, racking, conveyor and sortation manufacturers present safety evidence, throughput data and references in English, so buyers can shortlist them."] = "海外仓库运营商与系统集成商需要安全、经过验证且有支持的自动化方案。Hurfi 帮助中国 AGV、AMR、货架、输送与分拣制造商用英语呈现安全证据、吞吐数据与项目案例，让买家能够将其纳入候选名单。";
  zh["Infographic of four figures for Logistics & Warehouse Technology: 368.2tn yuan total social logistics value, up 5.1%; 13.9% logistics costs as a share of GDP; 35.45m TEU container throughput at China’s ports; 199bn express delivery items in 2025."] = "物流与仓储技术四项数据的图表：社会物流总额 368.2 万亿元，增长 5.1%；物流成本占 GDP 的 13.9%；中国港口集装箱吞吐量 3,545 万 TEU；2025 年快递业务量 1,990 亿件。";
  zh["Cost pressure and robotics growth in China mean many suppliers are now exporting automation. Buyers abroad, however, need safety evidence, integration support and local service before they commit."] = "中国的成本压力与机器人产业增长意味着许多供应商正走向出口自动化。但海外买家在做出承诺前，需要安全证据、集成支持与本地服务。";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the sources listed below (CFLP and China Logistics Information Center; National Bureau of Statistics of China). Figures describe the sector, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下方所列来源（中国物流与采购联合会与中国物流信息中心；中国国家统计局）。数据描述行业整体情况，不涉及 Hurfi 的任何客户。";
  zh["ISO 3691-4:2023 specifies safety requirements for driverless industrial trucks and their systems, naming automated guided vehicles, autonomous mobile robots and bots as examples."] = "ISO 3691-4:2023 规定了无人驾驶工业车辆及其系统的安全要求，并将自动导引车、自主移动机器人与机器人列为示例。";
  zh["Automated warehouse equipment sold in the EU falls under the Machinery Directive 2006/42/EC; the Machinery Regulation (EU) 2023/1230 applies from 20 January 2027."] = "在欧盟销售的自动化仓储设备属于机械指令 2006/42/EC 范围；机械法规 (EU) 2023/1230 自 2027 年 1 月 20 日起适用。";
  zh["Incoterms® rules, first published by the ICC in 1936, are eleven three-letter trade terms used in sales contracts; buyers expect them on delivery and quote pages."] = "Incoterms® 规则由国际商会于 1936 年首次发布，是销售合同中使用的十一个三字母贸易术语；买家希望在交付与报价页面看到它们。";
  zh["Total logistics costs fell to 13.9% of GDP; storage costs were 4.6% of GDP, down 0.2 points. Logistics industry revenue was 14.3 trillion yuan (+4.1%)."] = "物流总费用占 GDP 比重降至 13.9%；保管费用占 GDP 的 4.6%，下降 0.2 个百分点。物流业收入 14.3 万亿元（增长 4.1%）。";
  zh["The EMC Directive requires electrical equipment not to generate, or be affected by, electromagnetic disturbance, relevant to wireless-guided fleets."] = "《电磁兼容指令》要求电气设备不产生电磁干扰，也不受其影响，这与无线导航车队相关。";
  zh["This post sets out a digital growth system, a fitting picture for suppliers of logistics systems. It is Hurfi’s own brand work, not a client result."] = "这篇介绍数字增长系统的文章，与物流系统供应商的情况很契合。这是 Hurfi 自身的品牌工作，并非客户案例。";
  zh["Data from China’s national statistics and the China Federation of Logistics and Purchasing (CFLP) show a large and still-growing logistics market."] = "中国国家统计与中国物流与采购联合会（CFLP）的数据显示，物流市场规模庞大且仍在增长。";
  zh["Total social logistics value reached 368.2 trillion yuan in 2025, up 5.1%; industrial goods logistics grew 5.3% and contributed 82% of the growth."] = "2025 年社会物流总额达 368.2 万亿元，增长 5.1%；工业品物流增长 5.3%，贡献了 82% 的增量。";
  zh["Say which standards your safety design and testing follow, and who assessed it. Buyers in this sector check safety claims carefully."] = "说明您的安全设计与测试遵循哪些标准，以及由谁评估。该行业的买家会仔细核查安全声明。";
  zh["Automation buyers research for months and involve operations, IT and safety teams. The website must answer each. Our usual order:"] = "自动化买家会调研数月，并涉及运营、IT 与安全团队。网站必须逐一回应。我们通常的顺序是：";
  zh["ISO 3691-4:2023 Industrial trucks — Safety requirements and verification — Part 4: Driverless industrial trucks and their systems"] = "ISO 3691-4:2023 工业车辆——安全要求与验证——第 4 部分：无人驾驶工业车辆及其系统";
  zh["China’s ports handled 35.447 million TEU of containers (+6.8%), and express delivery reached 199 billion items."] = "中国港口完成集装箱吞吐量 3,544.7 万 TEU（增长 6.8%），快递业务量达 1,990 亿件。";
  zh["Many automation suppliers do both. The site should explain your model so the right partners contact you."] = "许多自动化供应商两者兼做。网站应说明您的模式，以便合适的合作伙伴联系您。";
  zh["Solution-based sites with safety pages, case studies, integration information and detailed RFQ forms."] = "以解决方案为主线的网站，包含安全页面、案例研究、集成信息与详细的询价表单。";
  zh["Publish product pages with payloads, speeds, dimensions, safety functions and integration options."] = "发布产品页面，包含载荷、速度、尺寸、安全功能与集成选项。";
  zh["Yes. Specific payload, navigation and application searches bring better leads than generic terms."] = "是的。具体的载荷、导航与应用搜索比泛泛的关键词带来更优质的线索。";
  zh["SEO for product, payload, throughput and application searches used by operators and integrators."] = "针对运营者与集成商使用的产品、载荷、吞吐与应用搜索进行 SEO。";
  zh["Ports and logistics hubs covered by Hurfi guides show where logistics demand is concentrated:"] = "设有 Hurfi 指南的港口与物流枢纽，体现了物流需求的集中地：";
  zh["Use an RFQ form that collects warehouse size, SKU profile, throughput targets and timeline."] = "使用询价表单，收集仓库面积、SKU 结构、吞吐目标与时间安排。";
  zh["Name the standards, assessments and models covered, with dates. Avoid vague “safe” claims."] = "列明所涵盖的标准、评估与型号，并注明日期。避免含糊的“安全”表述。";
  zh["Industrial-robot logistics volume grew 28%, and recycled-resource logistics value 13.2%."] = "工业机器人物流量增长 28%，再生资源物流额增长 13.2%。";
  zh["Structure the site by solution (picking, storage, transport, sortation) and by product."] = "按解决方案（拣选、存储、运输、分拣）与产品组织网站结构。";
  zh["Safety and machinery rules dominate questions from buyers in Europe and North America:"] = "安全与机械法规主导了欧洲和北美买家的问题：";
  zh["A website, SEO and RFQ playbook for logistics and warehouse technology manufacturers"] = "面向物流与仓储技术制造商的网站、SEO 与询价手册";
  zh["Yes, with the client’s permission. Video is very persuasive for automation buyers."] = "可以，需客户许可。视频对自动化买家非常有说服力。";
  zh["Payload, navigation, fleet management, safety functions and integration with WMS."] = "载荷、导航、车队管理、安全功能以及与 WMS 的集成。";
  zh["Build a safety and compliance page mapping standards and assessments to models."] = "建立安全与合规页面，将标准与评估对应到具体型号。";
  zh["Questions overseas buyers ask logistics and warehouse technology suppliers"] = "海外买家向物流与仓储技术供应商提出的问题";
  zh["Add case studies with layout, throughput and results where clients allow."] = "在客户允许的情况下，添加包含布局、吞吐与成果的案例研究。";
  zh["Yes, from your engineers’ material; your team approves technical claims."] = "可以，依据您工程师提供的材料撰写；技术表述由您的团队确认。";
  zh["No. We set targets with you and report real data from your own accounts."] = "不会。我们与您共同设定目标，并汇报您自有账户的真实数据。";
  zh["Explain integration and service: partners, APIs, training and support."] = "说明集成与服务：合作伙伴、API、培训与支持。";
  zh["Track which solution pages bring qualified inquiries and expand those."] = "跟踪哪些解决方案页面带来高质量询盘，并扩展这些页面。";
  zh[": the airport handled 1.033 million tonnes of cargo and mail (+25.2%)."] = "：机场完成货邮吞吐量 103.3 万吨（增长 25.2%）。";
