  zh["NSF/ANSI 61 sets minimum health-effects requirements for contaminants that products and materials can impart to drinking water. Its scope covers mechanical devices such as water meters, valves and filters, pipes and fittings, and process media such as filter media and ion-exchange resins. It does not set performance requirements."] = "NSF/ANSI 61 规定了产品与材料可能向饮用水带入污染物的最低健康影响要求。其范围涵盖水表、阀门、过滤器等机械装置，管道与管件，以及滤料、离子交换树脂等过程介质。它不规定性能要求。";
  zh["Infographic of four figures for Water & Wastewater Technology: 91.4% of China’s 3,641 national surface-water sections rated good in 2025; 30,354 urban wastewater treatment plants in operation in the EU; 1 Jan 2025 revised EU Urban Wastewater Treatment Directive in force; 64.05m pumps made in Taizhou, Zhejiang, in 2025."] = "水务与污水处理技术四项数据的图表：2025 年中国 3,641 个国控地表水断面中 91.4% 水质优良；欧盟在运城市污水处理厂 30,354 座；修订后的欧盟《城市污水处理指令》于 2025 年 1 月 1 日生效；2025 年浙江台州生产水泵 6,405 万台。";
  zh["Utilities, plant builders and industrial buyers abroad buy water equipment on performance data and approvals, not on catalogues. Hurfi helps Chinese pump, valve, membrane, filtration and treatment-system manufacturers show that evidence clearly in English and get found by the engineers who specify it."] = "海外水务公司、工厂建设方与工业买家采购水处理设备时看重性能数据与认证，而非产品目录。Hurfi 帮助中国水泵、阀门、膜、过滤与处理系统制造商用英语清晰呈现这些证据，并让负责选型的工程师找到他们。";
  zh["Stricter rules abroad translate into more detailed questions for suppliers: what a membrane removes, what a pump’s wetted materials are, whether components are approved for drinking water. Suppliers who publish those answers save buyers a round of emails, and get shortlisted earlier."] = "海外更严格的法规，转化为对供应商更细致的问题：膜能去除什么、泵的接液材质是什么、部件是否获准用于饮用水。公布这些答案的供应商能为买家省去一轮邮件往来，也更早进入候选名单。";
  zh["The revised EU Urban Wastewater Treatment Directive entered into force on 1 January 2025. It requires collection and treatment in all urban areas of more than 1,000 inhabitants and stricter treatment, including for new pollutants."] = "修订后的欧盟《城市污水处理指令》于 2025 年 1 月 1 日生效。它要求所有常住人口超过 1,000 人的城市区域进行污水收集与处理，并实行更严格的处理，包括针对新污染物。";
  zh["The recast EU Drinking Water Directive applies to water for domestic purposes and food production, from tap, tanker or bottle, and sets thresholds that the Commission says are often stricter than WHO guidelines."] = "重订的欧盟《饮用水指令》适用于生活用水与食品生产用水，包括自来水、罐车供水或瓶装水，并设定了欧盟委员会称往往比世卫组织指南更严格的限值。";
  zh["Demand for water technology is driven by regulation and by the condition of rivers, plants and pipes. The figures below come from China’s national statistics, Chinese city bulletins and the European Commission."] = "水技术需求受法规以及河流、水厂与管网状况驱动。以下数据来自中国国家统计、中国城市统计公报与欧盟委员会。";
  zh["This post, built around a pressure-gauge dial, makes the point that capacity only matters if buyers can see it, which fits pump and valve makers well. It is Hurfi’s own brand work, not a client result."] = "这篇以压力表表盘为主视觉的文章指出：只有买家看得见，产能才有意义——这很契合泵阀制造商。这是 Hurfi 自身的品牌工作，并非客户案例。";
  zh["Infographic by Hurfi, drawn from the sources listed below (National Bureau of Statistics of China; European Commission; Taizhou Statistics Bureau). Figures describe the sector, not any Hurfi client."] = "Hurfi 制图，数据来自下方所列来源（中国国家统计局；欧盟委员会；台州市统计局）。数据描述行业整体情况，不涉及 Hurfi 的任何客户。";
  zh["For the website itself, Google’s SEO Starter Guide recommends describing products in the words people actually search with, which in water usually means process terms and contaminants."] = "就网站本身而言，Google 的 SEO 入门指南建议用人们实际搜索的词语描述产品；在水处理领域，这通常意味着工艺术语与污染物名称。";
  zh["Pumps, blowers and other machinery sold in the EU fall under the Machinery Directive 2006/42/EC; the new Machinery Regulation (EU) 2023/1230 applies from 20 January 2027."] = "在欧盟销售的水泵、鼓风机及其他机械属于机械指令 2006/42/EC 范围；新机械法规 (EU) 2023/1230 自 2027 年 1 月 20 日起适用。";
  zh["It depends on the product and market, and only you or your certification body can confirm what applies. The site should state clearly what you hold and for which models."] = "这取决于产品与市场，只有您或您的认证机构能确认适用哪些要求。网站应清楚说明您持有哪些认证、覆盖哪些型号。";
  zh["The revised EU Urban Wastewater Treatment Directive pushes for more nutrient removal, water reuse and resource recovery, and lower greenhouse-gas emissions from plants."] = "修订后的欧盟《城市污水处理指令》推动更多营养物去除、水回用与资源回收，并降低水厂的温室气体排放。";
  zh["A page should never say a product is “approved” in general. Say which approval, for which model and material, issued by whom, and link to the certificate or listing."] = "页面绝不应笼统地说产品“已获认证”。要说明是哪种认证、对应哪个型号与材质、由谁颁发，并链接到证书或备案。";
  zh["Organise the site by application (municipal drinking water, municipal wastewater, industrial process water, reuse) and by product family, and cross-link the two."] = "按应用（市政饮用水、市政污水、工业工艺用水、回用）与产品系列组织网站，并将两者相互链接。";
  zh["Water equipment is specified by engineers and approved by utilities or plant owners, so the website has to serve both. This is the order we usually work in."] = "水处理设备由工程师选型，由水务公司或工厂业主批准，因此网站必须同时服务两者。以下是我们通常的工作顺序。";
  zh["The recast EU Drinking Water Directive (EU) 2020/2184 introduces a risk-based monitoring model aimed at emerging pollutants such as PFAS and microplastics."] = "重订的欧盟《饮用水指令》(EU) 2020/2184 引入了基于风险的监测模式，针对 PFAS 与微塑料等新兴污染物。";
  zh["Give each product family a page with duty ranges, materials, performance tables and downloadable datasheets, with the key figures written on the page."] = "为每个产品系列设置页面，包含工况范围、材质、性能表与可下载的数据表，并把关键数据直接写在页面上。";
  zh["The EU counts 30,354 urban wastewater treatment plants in operation, and says 10 million Europeans still lack access to basic sanitation services."] = "欧盟统计在运城市污水处理厂 30,354 座，并表示仍有 1,000 万欧洲人无法获得基本卫生服务。";
  zh["Of 3,641 national surface-water monitoring sections in China, 91.4% were rated good (Classes I–III) in 2025; 0.6% were rated worse than Class V."] = "2025 年中国 3,641 个国控地表水监测断面中，91.4% 水质优良（I—III 类）；0.6% 为劣 V 类。";
  zh["Write application pages for specific problems buyers search for, such as removing a named contaminant or treating a named industrial effluent."] = "针对买家搜索的具体问题撰写应用页面，例如去除某种特定污染物或处理某种工业废水。";
  zh["Enough for an engineer to shortlist you: duty ranges, materials, performance data and dimensions. Detailed designs can stay behind an RFQ."] = "足以让工程师将您列入候选：工况范围、材质、性能数据与尺寸。详细设计可留在询价之后。";
  zh["Which approvals apply depends on the product and the country. These are the references overseas water buyers most often bring up."] = "适用哪些认证取决于产品与国家。以下是海外水务买家最常提到的参考。";
  zh["We write from your engineers’ material and recognised sources, and your team approves every technical claim before publication."] = "我们依据您工程师的材料与公认来源撰写，所有技术表述在发布前均经您的团队确认。";
  zh["Packaged plants, sludge dewatering, aeration and disinfection: design basis, footprint, energy use and commissioning support."] = "一体化水厂、污泥脱水、曝气与消毒：设计依据、占地、能耗与调试支持。";
  zh["Yes, as an OEM or ODM section that explains what you make for others and how, without naming customers who have not agreed."] = "可以，作为一个 OEM 或 ODM 板块，说明您为他人生产什么、如何生产，但不提未经同意的客户名称。";
  zh["Water buyers usually arrive with a process problem or a specification. They compare suppliers within one of these groups:"] = "水务买家通常带着工艺问题或规格而来。他们会在以下类别中比较供应商：";
  zh["Duty points, efficiency curves, materials in contact with water or chemicals, seal options and spare-parts lead times."] = "工况点、效率曲线、与水或化学品接触的材质、密封选项与备件交期。";
  zh["Both, cross-linked. Engineers often start from the application; purchasing teams often start from the product family."] = "两者都要，并相互链接。工程师常从应用入手，采购团队常从产品系列入手。";
  zh["Application- and product-led websites with performance tables, approvals pages and RFQs that collect water analysis."] = "以应用与产品为主线的网站，包含性能表、认证页面，以及收集水质分析的询价表单。";
  zh["Components and integrated systems for reuse and seawater, where buyers ask for reference plants and operating data."] = "用于回用与海水的部件与集成系统，买家会要求参考水厂与运行数据。";
  zh["Publish case studies with feed and treated water parameters, where clients allow it, rather than photos alone."] = "在客户允许的情况下，发布包含进水与出水参数的水厂案例，而不只是照片。";
  zh["RO, UF and MBR membranes, cartridges and media: flux, rejection, cleaning regimes and replacement intervals."] = "RO、UF 与 MBR 膜、滤芯与滤料：通量、脱盐率、清洗制度与更换周期。";
  zh["Water-quality sensors, smart meters, leak detection and control panels: accuracy, protocols and calibration."] = "水质传感器、智能水表、泄漏检测与控制柜：精度、协议与校准。";
  zh["Book a free consultation. We review your site and product range and suggest the first pages to build or fix."] = "预约免费咨询。我们评估您的网站与产品线，并建议优先建设或修正哪些页面。";
  zh["Use an RFQ form that collects flow, water analysis, discharge or product-water targets and site conditions."] = "使用询价表单，收集流量、水质分析、排放或产水目标与现场条件。";
  zh["Energy use, chemical consumption and membrane or cartridge replacement intervals, with assumptions stated."] = "能耗、化学品消耗与膜或滤芯更换周期，并说明假设条件。";
  zh["Say whether you send engineers, use a local partner or support remotely, and how spare parts are shipped."] = "说明您派工程师、使用本地合作伙伴还是远程支持，以及备件如何发运。";
  zh["An RFQ form that asks for flow, feed-water analysis and discharge limits gets you an answerable request."] = "询价表单询问流量、进水分析与排放限值，才能得到可作答的需求。";
  zh["Pressure ratings, connection standards, materials and approvals for drinking water or aggressive media."] = "压力等级、连接标准、材质，以及用于饮用水或腐蚀性介质的认证。";
  zh["No. We set targets with you and report actual searches, visits and inquiries from your own analytics."] = "不会。我们与您共同设定目标，并汇报您自有分析工具中的实际搜索、访问与询盘。";
  zh["No. Hurfi’s offices are in Xi’an and Bogura. We work with manufacturers in any Chinese city remotely."] = "不。Hurfi 的办公室位于西安与博古拉。我们远程服务任何中国城市的制造商。";
  zh["Taizhou in Zhejiang made 64.0521 million pumps in 2025 (−2.0%) and 232,000 tonnes of valves (−3.2%)."] = "2025 年浙江台州生产水泵 6,405.21 万台（下降 2.0%），阀门 23.2 万吨（下降 3.2%）。";
  zh["Build an approvals page that maps each certificate or listing to the models and materials it covers."] = "建立认证页面，将每份证书或备案对应到其所覆盖的型号与材质。";
  zh["Pump, valve and water-equipment making is concentrated in a few clusters covered by our city guides:"] = "水泵、阀门与水处理设备制造集中在以下城市指南所覆盖的产业集群：";
  zh[": the Zhejiang provincial portal names pumps and valves among Wenzhou’s five traditional industries."] = "：浙江省政府门户将泵阀列为温州五大传统产业之一。";
  zh["Track which application pages lead to RFQs in Search Console and analytics, and extend those first."] = "在 Search Console 与分析工具中跟踪哪些应用页面带来询价，并优先扩展这些页面。";
  zh["SEO for process, contaminant and specification searches in English and your target languages."] = "针对工艺、污染物与规格搜索，用英语及您的目标语言进行 SEO。";
  zh["Publish design basis and test results for named contaminants, with the test conditions."] = "发布针对特定污染物的设计依据与测试结果，并注明测试条件。";
  zh["A references page by application and country, with what was supplied and since when."] = "按应用与国家划分的案例页面，说明供应了什么、从何时起供应。";
  zh["Campaigns aimed at consultants, contractors and plant operators in selected markets."] = "面向特定市场顾问、承包商与水厂运营方的推广活动。";
  zh["NSF/ANSI 61: Drinking Water System Components – Health Effects (18 February 2024)"] = "NSF/ANSI 61：饮用水系统部件——健康影响（2024 年 2 月 18 日）";
  zh["LinkedIn content showing installations, test benches and commissioning work."] = "在 LinkedIn 上发布安装、测试台与调试工作内容。";
